/* SEO copy for brand, category, concern, scent, range, price, keyword, routine, brands A-Z and home pages (20 Oct 2026) */
window.SW_COPY = {"b-davidoff":{"h2":"Davidoff perfume at Swansura","blocks":[{"p":"Davidoff perfume is known for clean, easy-to-wear scents, and our edit brings four of them together at friendly prices. You can shop the range from £18.99, with three men's eaux de toilette and one bright eau de parfum for her. Every bottle is 100% authentic and ships to you from the UK."},{"h3":"The men's line-up","p":"If you want Davidoff perfume for men, start with Davidoff The Game Eau de Toilette 100ml at £27.99. Juniper berries open into a smooth iris heart, then ebony wood gives it a deep, polished finish. Davidoff Champion Eau de Toilette 90ml, at £23.99, is the sporty one: lemon and bergamot sit over sage, cedarwood and oakmoss. For something cooler, Davidoff Indigo Eau de Toilette 110ml pairs crisp peppermint with lavender and a soft sandalwood base for £21.99."},{"h3":"A fresh pick for her","p":"Davidoff Cool Water Reborn Intense Eau de Parfum 50ml is described as a modern women's scent with fruity, floral and woody accords. It feels clean and vibrant, and at £18.99 it is the lowest-priced bottle in the range."},{"p":"Most of these scents sit in our [woody fragrances](#scent-woody) and [fresh fragrances](#scent-fresh) edits, so you can compare them with similar bottles from other houses. If you are buying a present, our [gifts for him](#k-gifts-for-him) page groups more ideas at a range of prices."},{"p":"Spend over £50 and UK delivery is free, which makes it easy to pair two Davidoff bottles, one for everyday and one for evenings. Every scent here is genuine, sold in its original packaging and sent from our UK base."}]},"b-calvin-klein":{"h2":"Calvin Klein perfume for him and her","blocks":[{"p":"Calvin Klein perfume covers some of the best-known names in modern fragrance, and our edit gathers ten of them, from full bottles to 10ml miniatures. Prices start at £18.99, so it is an easy place to try a new scent before you commit to a larger size. Every Calvin Klein perfume on this page is 100% authentic."},{"h3":"Eternity, the signature line","p":"Calvin Klein Eternity runs through much of this range. Calvin Klein Eternity for women comes as an Eternity Eau de Parfum at £28.99, a graceful mix of freesia, lily, rose and carnation over sandalwood, amber and musk. Calvin Klein Eternity for men is here as Eternity for Men Eau de Toilette 100ml at £38.99, with citrus, aromatic herbs and smooth woods. You will also find Eternity Parfum and Eternity Aromatic Essence Parfum Intense in 10ml miniatures, each £18.99."},{"h3":"Defy and more","p":"Calvin Klein Defy is the bolder men's line. Defy Eau de Parfum opens with bergamot and mandarin before lavender, leather, vetiver and amber. The Calvin Klein Defy Parfum goes deeper, with suede and warm woods, at £22.99 for the full bottle or £18.99 as a mini. For a sweeter feminine scent, My Euphoria Eau de Parfum 10ml Miniature blends blackcurrant, florals, vanilla and amber."},{"h3":"Minis and gift sets","p":"Our Calvin Klein miniature set, the Women's Miniature Fragrance Set 4x15ml at £33.99, includes Obsession, Eternity and CK One in travel sizes. It sits well alongside our [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets) and [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis). Browse [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women) for more ideas. Every bottle is genuine and ships from the UK, with free delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-coach":{"h2":"Coach Green Shower Gel","blocks":[{"p":"Coach shower gel brings the character of a much-loved fragrance into your daily shower. We stock one product from the brand, the Coach Green Shower Gel 100ml, priced at £13.99."},{"p":"It is a refreshing men's body wash inspired by the crisp, aromatic feel of Coach Green. It gently cleanses the skin and leaves a fresh trace of citrus, green and woody notes behind. The 100ml size suits a gym bag or a weekend away, and it makes a thoughtful extra in a present for him. Choose it if you want your Coach shower gel to double as a light layer of scent before you reach for a fragrance, or keep it as an easy everyday wash."},{"p":"If you like this kind of scent, you can find more bottles in our [woody fragrances](#scent-woody) edit, or compare other washes in [shower gel and body wash](#k-shower-gel-body-wash). For more grooming ideas, see [men's grooming](#k-mens-grooming)."},{"p":"Like everything we sell, it is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Add it to an order over £50 and UK delivery is free."}]},"b-dkny":{"h2":"DKNY perfume and gift sets","blocks":[{"p":"DKNY perfume is playful, fruity and easy to love, and our edit focuses on four women's scents and sets. Prices start at £28.99, with full 100ml bottles and gift sets that let you share the Delicious collection."},{"h3":"Two full-size favourites","p":"DKNY Be Tempted Eau de Parfum 100ml, at £39.99, is the bolder choice. Red berries and citrus meet rose and violet, then vanilla, patchouli and myrrh give it a warm, gourmand base. DKNY Be Delicious Orchard Street Eau de Parfum 100ml, at £28.99, is brighter and more energetic, with juicy fruit, fresh florals and a smooth musky-woody finish."},{"h3":"Sets for gifting","p":"For DKNY perfume for women in smaller sizes, the DKNY miniature set, the Women's Miniature Eau de Parfum Set 4x7ml at £35.99, brings together Be Delicious, Golden Delicious, Be Extra Delicious and Be 100% Delicious. The Be Delicious and Be Delicious Fresh Blossom Eau de Parfum Gift Set 2x30ml, at £41.99, pairs a crisp fruity scent with a lighter floral one. Both are handy if you want to try a few bottles before choosing a favourite."},{"p":"You can compare these with other sweet, fruity bottles in our [floral fragrances](#scent-floral) edit, or browse [gifts for her](#k-gifts-for-her) and [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets) for more present ideas. Every DKNY scent we sell is 100% authentic and sent from our UK base, and orders over £50 qualify for free UK delivery."}]},"b-chloe":{"h2":"Chloé perfume, Nomade and Rose Naturelle","blocks":[{"p":"Chloé perfume is soft, feminine and quietly elegant, and our edit holds seven bottles and sets from the French house. Prices start at £43.99, and every piece is 100% authentic."},{"h3":"The Nomade family","p":"Chloé Nomade is at the heart of this range. Nomade Eau de Parfum 50ml, at £51.99, blends juicy mirabelle plum with soft freesia and earthy oakmoss. Chloé Nomade Nuit d'Égypte, at £55.99, is warmer and more sensual, with myrrh, spices, orange blossom and vanilla inspired by the old Egyptian perfume tradition of kyphi. Nomade Jasmin Naturel Intense, at £43.99, adds luminous jasmine, sweet date, vanilla and sandalwood."},{"h3":"Rose Naturelle Intense","p":"Chloé Rose Naturelle Intense Eau de Parfum 50ml is built around a natural rose accord. Citrus and neroli lift the opening, and vanilla with sandalwood keeps the finish warm. It is £43.99."},{"h3":"Gift sets and minis","p":"The Chloé Nomade gift set pairs a 75ml bottle with a 20ml travel spray for £66.99. As a Chloé miniature set, the Women's Miniature Perfume Set 4x5ml at £45.99 lets you try Nomade, Rose Tangerine and the classic eau de parfum. There is also a two-piece Miniature Eau de Parfum Gift Set with 20ml sizes for £48.99."},{"p":"For more Chloé perfume for women and similar styles, see our [floral fragrances](#scent-floral), [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women) and [luxury gifts over £50](#k-gifts-over-50). We ship every order from the UK, free on orders over £50. Each set arrives in its original packaging."}]},"b-abercrombie-fitch":{"h2":"Abercrombie & Fitch perfume","blocks":[{"p":"Abercrombie & Fitch perfume offers bright, modern scents at accessible prices. We carry two women's eaux de parfum, starting at £19.99."},{"p":"Abercrombie & Fitch Naturally Fierce Eau de Parfum 50ml, at £19.99, is fresh and feminine. Citrus and fruit notes lead into soft florals, then warm woods give it a clean, elegant finish for daytime."},{"p":"Abercrombie & Fitch First Instinct Together Eau de Parfum 100ml, at £24.99, is a little sweeter. Juicy red fruits and pineapple meet soft florals over a base of musk and woods. It has a soft, cosy feel that works well from day into evening, and the 100ml bottle lasts a good while. If you want one Abercrombie & Fitch perfume for daily wear and one for later, these two pair nicely."},{"p":"Both bottles sit within our [£15 to £25](#price-15-25) range, and you can find more ideas in [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women) and [gifts under £25](#k-gifts-under-25). Each one is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery when you spend over £50."}]},"b-highborn-london":{"h2":"Highborn London luxury skincare","blocks":[{"p":"Highborn London skincare is luxury face, eye and neck care made in England, built around simple morning and evening routines. Our edit holds 22 pieces, from a £22.50 lip butter to full regimen collections."},{"h3":"Serums and moisturisers","p":"Pre-Eminent Beauty Serum, at £66, is a lightweight face serum with hyaluronic acid and vitamin C that helps skin feel soft and look smooth. MOISTUREBURST Hydrating Glow Ceramide Serum, at £85, is made for dry and dehydrated skin and layers well under cream. Bakuchiol Youth Elixir, at £99, uses the plant-based ingredient bakuchiol and suits sensitive skin. For a rich moisturiser for dry skin, Imperial Moisturiser at £46 helps tight-feeling skin feel comfortable, while Night Elixir at £56 gives your evening routine a softer cream texture. GLOWGUARD SPF30 Moisturiser covers the morning step."},{"h3":"Eyes, lips and body","p":"Imperial Eye Gel, at £59, is a cooling under eye cream alternative that gives the delicate eye area light moisture. Superior Lip Butter comes in 15ml and 50ml sizes. Natural Luminosity Scrub and Natural Luminosity Body Butter, each £50, smooth and nourish dry skin."},{"h3":"Sets and routines","p":"If you prefer a ready-made routine, try the Cleanse and Tone Pack at £44, the Revive and Defy Starter Set at £78 or the Four Phase Day and Night collection at £145. The Seven Phase Collection, at £185, brings the full range together, and each one works as a skincare gift set."},{"p":"Explore more in [face serum](#k-face-serum), [under eye cream](#k-eye-cream) and [moisturiser for dry skin](#k-moisturiser-for-dry-skin). Every product is 100% authentic and sent from our UK base, with free delivery over £50. Each Highborn London skincare piece is a calm, considered step you can repeat morning and night."}]},"b-anatome":{"h2":"anatomē perfume and sleep rituals","blocks":[{"p":"anatomē perfume comes from a London apothecary that creates scents, sleep oils, pillow sprays and bath salts designed around how you want to feel. Our edit holds 24 pieces, starting at £28."},{"h3":"Eaux de parfum","p":"Each functional fragrance is a unisex eau de parfum with its own mood. Focus opens with cardamom and black pepper over sandalwood. Energy pairs Calabrian lemon and peppermint with neroli and tobacco. Balance layers damask rose and saffron with amber and patchouli. Expression is oceanic, with sea salt, sea moss and cedarwood, and Support is herbal, with watermint, parsley, coriander and sage. Order is a clean, blank-canvas scent. Most come in a £28 size and a £125 size. Parfum Travel, a perfume discovery set of six scents, is £125."},{"h3":"For the bedroom and bath","p":"The Somali Frankincense Sleep Pillow Spray and the Roman Chamomile Sleep Pillow Spray are £34 each, made to mist over your linens as part of a calm bedtime routine. Sleep oils start at £28. The Relax + Sleep Chamomile Bath Salts, at £30, blend natural salts with organic botanicals, and the Bath & Shower Oils at £68 add jojoba, coconut and sunflower oils for soft skin. The Little Gift of Good Sleep at £35 and The Gift of Good Sleep at £68 make lovely presents."},{"h3":"Face care","p":"Botanical Balm, at £39, is a cleansing balm that lifts away make-up, and the Illuminating Rose-hip, Grape Seed & Avocado Face Oil, at £52, nourishes all skin types."},{"p":"Find similar bottles in [unisex perfume](#k-unisex-perfume) and [niche perfume](#k-niche-perfume), or browse our [calm and sleep](#concern-calm) edit. All 100% authentic, shipped from the UK and free to deliver over £50. Each anatomē perfume is made to be worn by anyone, whatever the time of day."}]},"b-armaf":{"h2":"Armaf perfume: Hunter Eau de Parfum","blocks":[{"p":"Armaf perfume is popular for confident scents at friendly prices. At Swansura we stock one bottle from the house, the Armaf Hunter Eau de Parfum 100ml, at £22.99."},{"p":"Armaf Hunter is a fresh, modern men's scent. Bright citrus and herbal notes open it up, then spices, cedarwood and musk give it a clean, woody finish that suits everyday wear. The generous 100ml bottle makes it good value if you want one dependable bottle for work and weekends. It has the kind of easy, crowd-pleasing character that makes Armaf perfume a popular choice as a present."},{"p":"If you are looking for Armaf perfume for men alongside other options, compare it with our [woody fragrances](#scent-woody) and [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men) edits, or see more bottles in the [£15 to £25](#price-15-25) range."},{"p":"The Armaf Hunter Eau de Parfum is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Add a second item to pass £50 and UK delivery is free."}]},"b-bentley":{"h2":"Bentley perfume for men","blocks":[{"p":"Bentley perfume brings polished, fresh and woody scents to the men's fragrance shelf. Our edit includes six Bentley bottles, each a 100ml size, with prices from £30.99 to £40.99. Every bottle is designed for men, and each sits in our £25 to £50 range, so they are easy to compare side by side. The fresher eaux de toilette suit daytime and the office, while the eaux de parfum feel richer for evenings and cooler weather."},{"h3":"Fresh and aromatic","p":"Bentley Azure, in the For Men Azure Eau de Toilette 100ml at £31.99, is clean and energetic, with bright citrus, aromatic herbs and smooth woods. The Bentley Infinite Eau de Toilette, at £30.99, pairs grapefruit and cedar leaf with lavender and vetiver. Bentley Momentum Unlimited Eau de Toilette, at £31.99, mixes grapefruit and green apple with cardamom and warm woods."},{"h3":"Deeper eaux de parfum","p":"Bentley Silverlake, in the For Men Silverlake Eau de Parfum at £32.99, blends lemon and mint with lavender, violet leaf and amberwood. Become Eau de Parfum, at £40.99, is spicier, with citrus, herbs, warm woods and amber. Bentley Absolute, the For Men Absolute Eau de Parfum at £31.99, is the smokiest of the group, with ginger, pink pepper, papyrus, sandalwood, olibanum and a touch of oud. Check its page for current stock."},{"p":"For more Bentley perfume for men and similar styles, browse [woody fragrances](#scent-woody), [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men) and [gifts for him](#k-gifts-for-him). Each bottle is 100% authentic and sent from our UK base, and orders over £50 qualify for free UK delivery."}]},"b-hugo-boss":{"h2":"Hugo Boss perfume and gift sets","blocks":[{"p":"Hugo Boss perfume is a modern classic on many fragrance shelves, and our edit brings together five bottles and sets for him and her. Prices start at £40.99."},{"h3":"For him","p":"Hugo Boss Bottled is here as Bottled Eau de Parfum 200ml for Men at £63.99, a generous size that blends fresh fruit, warm spices and deep woods. Hugo Boss HUGO Man, in the HUGO Man Eau de Toilette 125ml for Men at £40.99, is crisp, herbal and woody, made for everyday wear. If you prefer something richer, The Collection Confident Oud Eau de Parfum Intense 100ml at £70.99 puts oud at the centre of a modern composition. BOSS The Scent Eau de Toilette 100ml Tester, with ginger, maninka fruit, lavender and leather, is also listed, so check its page for stock."},{"h3":"For her","p":"Hugo Boss Alive is a vibrant, confident women's scent. The Alive Eau de Parfum 80ml + Body Lotion 75ml Gift Set for Women, at £64.99, pairs the fragrance with a matching lotion, ready to give. It is a ready-made present that needs no extra wrapping."},{"p":"Shop more Hugo Boss perfume for men alongside similar bottles in [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men) and [oud perfume](#k-oud-perfume). For Hugo Boss perfume for women and other presents, see [gifts for her](#k-gifts-for-her). Every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and orders over £50 come with free UK delivery."}]},"b-burberry":{"h2":"Burberry perfume for women","blocks":[{"p":"Burberry perfume carries a distinctly British character, and our edit focuses on the house's women's scents. You will find five bottles and sets here, starting at £45.99."},{"h3":"My Burberry","p":"Burberry My Burberry Eau de Parfum is inspired by a London garden after the rain. Fresh bergamot and sweet pea open into geranium, quince and freesia, with patchouli and rose underneath. It comes in 50ml at £48.99 and 90ml at £58.99."},{"h3":"My Burberry Black","p":"Burberry My Burberry Black Parfum is deeper and more sensual. Jasmine and peach nectar sit around an intense rose heart, while amber and patchouli give it a warm, lasting base. It is also £48.99 for 50ml and £58.99 for 90ml, so you can choose the size that suits you."},{"h3":"Minis for gifting","p":"The Burberry miniature set, the Women's Miniature Perfume Set 4x5ml at £45.99, brings together scents from the Burberry Her collection, including Her London Dream Eau de Parfum, Her Eau de Toilette and Her Eau de Parfum. It is a neat way to try several before buying a full bottle. Each mini is easy to slip into a handbag for a top-up during the day."},{"p":"For more Burberry perfume for women and similar styles, explore [floral fragrances](#scent-floral), [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women) and [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis). Each piece is 100% authentic and sent from our UK base, with free delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-antonio-banderas":{"h2":"Antonio Banderas perfume","blocks":[{"p":"Antonio Banderas perfume is known for warm, likeable scents at easy prices. Our edit includes four bottles from the range, starting at £16.99. The line-up is split evenly, with two fresh scents for men and two sweet ones for women, so you can buy a matching pair as presents. Each scent feels easy to wear and is priced for everyday use, which makes it simple to keep one for daytime and one for evenings."},{"h3":"For him","p":"Antonio Banderas Power of Seduction Eau de Toilette 50ml, at £16.99, is fresh and confident, with citrus and apple over herbal notes and warm woods. Antonio Banderas Diavolo Eau de Toilette, at £19.99, is bolder and spicier, blending citrus and herbs with pepper, leather and smooth woods. Both are good picks if you want Antonio Banderas perfume for men for daily wear."},{"h3":"For her","p":"Antonio Banderas Her Secret Temptation Eau de Toilette 80ml is sweet and feminine. Pink pepper and neroli open into rose, jasmine and iris, with sugar cane and vanilla in the base. Antonio Banderas Her Secret Desire Eau de Toilette 80ml is more playful, with citrus and raspberry, jasmine and iris, then vanilla and sandalwood. Each is £20.99."},{"p":"All four sit in our [£15 to £25](#price-15-25) range, so they work well as presents. Browse [gifts under £25](#k-gifts-under-25) or [stocking fillers](#k-stocking-fillers) for more ideas at similar prices. Each bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and orders over £50 come with free UK delivery."}]},"b-anna-sui":{"h2":"Anna Sui perfume: Sky Eau de Toilette","blocks":[{"p":"Anna Sui perfume is playful and full of personality, much like the brand's famous bottles. We stock one scent from the house, the Anna Sui Sky Eau de Toilette 30ml, priced at £18.99."},{"p":"Anna Sui Sky is an airy women's fragrance with fruity, floral and gourmand notes. Juicy pear and bergamot open into lily of the valley, rose and lotus. Vanilla and musk follow, along with a distinctive popcorn note that gives it a sweet, light-hearted finish. It feels bright and sunny rather than heavy, so it works well for daytime and warmer weather. If you are new to Anna Sui perfume, it is a friendly first choice."},{"p":"The 30ml size is easy to carry and a good way to try something new. It also makes a thoughtful small present, so see our [gifts under £25](#k-gifts-under-25) and [stocking fillers](#k-stocking-fillers) for more ideas, or browse [floral fragrances](#scent-floral)."},{"p":"Every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-philipp-plein":{"h2":"Philipp Plein perfume and grooming","blocks":[{"p":"Philipp Plein perfume is bold and unapologetic, and our edit brings together three pieces from the No Limits line for men, starting at £16.99. Every piece of Philipp Plein perfume and grooming here is made for men."},{"p":"Philipp Plein No Limits Super Fresh Eau de Toilette 50ml, at £25.99, combines marine notes with dark fruits, spices and smooth leather. Blackcurrant, fig and lavender lead into pepper and cardamom for a fresh but strong character."},{"p":"To layer the scent through your routine, add the No Limits Deodorant Stick 75g at £16.99, which leaves a warm, spicy and woody trace with amber and leathery notes. The No Limits After Shave Balm 150ml, at £23.99, is a comforting balm for after shaving, carrying the same signature scent."},{"p":"Together they make an easy present, so see [gifts for him](#k-gifts-for-him) and [men's grooming](#k-mens-grooming), or compare similar bottles in [fresh fragrances](#scent-fresh). Every item is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-john-varvatos":{"h2":"John Varvatos perfume: Artisan","blocks":[{"p":"John Varvatos perfume has a relaxed, crafted feel, and at Swansura we carry one bottle from the house. The John Varvatos Artisan Eau de Toilette 75ml is priced at £32.99."},{"p":"John Varvatos Artisan is a fresh, refined men's scent. Crisp mandarin and orange blossom open it, then ginger and lavender add an aromatic heart before warm woods settle the base. It feels clean and easy, good for warmer days and for the office. The 75ml bottle is a practical size, and the scent works year round. If you are new to John Varvatos perfume, Artisan is a good place to start because it is fresh rather than heavy."},{"p":"If you are comparing it with other bottles, look at our [fresh fragrances](#scent-fresh) and [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men) edits, or browse [gifts £25 to £50](#k-gifts-25-to-50) for present ideas at a similar price."},{"p":"The bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Pair it with another item to pass £50 and UK delivery is free."}]},"b-ariana-grande":{"h2":"Ariana Grande perfume: Thank U, Next","blocks":[{"p":"Ariana Grande perfume is sweet, fun and easy to wear. We stock one bottle from the range, the Ariana Grande Thank U, Next Eau de Parfum 100ml, priced at £43.99."},{"p":"Ariana Grande Thank U, Next is a playful women's fragrance with juicy fruit, soft florals and creamy gourmand notes. Pear and raspberry open the scent, then coconut and rose come through, with macarons and musk adding a soft, sugary finish. The 100ml size gives you plenty to wear every day. It feels light enough for daytime but sweet enough for evenings, which is part of why Ariana Grande perfume is such a popular choice for younger fragrance fans and anyone with a sweet tooth."},{"p":"It is a popular choice as a present, so see [gifts for her](#k-gifts-for-her) and [gifts £25 to £50](#k-gifts-25-to-50), or explore more sweet bottles in [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women)."},{"p":"Your bottle is 100% authentic and sent from our UK base, and UK delivery is free on orders over £50."}]},"b-hemel":{"h2":"Hemel perfume: unisex eaux de parfum","blocks":[{"p":"Hemel perfume is about modern, long-lasting eaux de parfum with refined floral, woody and amber accords. Every scent in the range is unisex and comes in a 100ml bottle, with prices from £49.99. Many Hemel perfume lovers own more than one bottle and wear them by mood."},{"h3":"Floral and fruity","p":"Hemel Valley of Diamond blends bright citrus, elegant florals, warm woods and soft musk for a polished, versatile scent. Rosado is gentler, with soft florals balanced by amber and woods. Hemel Amethyst Dream is the most vibrant, with mandarin, peach and toffee opening into Damask rose, violet and patchouli."},{"h3":"Woody and warm","p":"Hemel Patchouli For All puts earthy patchouli at the centre, with warm woods and smooth amber. Hemel Favourite Black is bolder, with juniper and bergamot, smoky mate, tonka bean and leather. Dorado brings saffron, pink pepper, rose and leather over sandalwood and vetiver, while Plateado mixes citrus and pepper with lavender, cedar, cinnamon leaf and tobacco."},{"h3":"Fresh and intimate","p":"Gris balances citrus and pink pepper with florals and an amber-musk base. Fragrance Affair is rich and spicy, with jasmine sambac, clove, saffron, tonka bean and vanilla."},{"p":"Some scents are listed more than once at different prices, so check each product page for the version you want. To compare Hemel with similar styles, browse [unisex perfume](#k-unisex-perfume), [amber fragrances](#scent-amber) and [niche perfume](#k-niche-perfume). Every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-joop":{"h2":"Joop! Homme perfume","blocks":[{"p":"Joop Homme is one of the most recognisable warm, sweet scents for men, and we stock it in two versions, starting at £32.99."},{"p":"The Joop! Homme Eau de Toilette 200ml, at £34.99, is bold and distinctive. Bright citrus and orange blossom meet cinnamon and jasmine, then vanilla, tonka bean and sandalwood give it a warm finish. The large 200ml bottle is good value if this is your signature scent."},{"p":"Joop! Homme Le Parfum 75ml, at £32.99, is richer and more sensual. Lavender and cinnamon blend with orange blossom, tonka bean and vanilla for a smooth, lasting Joop Homme perfume for evenings. Both versions share the same sweet, spicy signature, so you can pick by size and strength."},{"p":"Shopping for Joop! Homme in the UK as a present? See [gifts for him](#k-gifts-for-him), or compare similar warm bottles in [amber fragrances](#scent-amber) and [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men). Both are 100% authentic and sent from our UK base, with free delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-mancera":{"h2":"Mancera perfume","blocks":[{"p":"Mancera perfume is rich, intense and made for people who like a scent with presence. We stock two unisex bottles from the house, both in a generous 120ml size, starting at £69.99."},{"p":"Mancera Intense Red Tobacco Extrait de Parfum 120ml, at £79.99, is smoky and richly spiced. Saffron, cinnamon, incense and nutmeg open it, and precious tobacco, leather, amber and warm woods follow through to a deep base."},{"p":"Mancera Black Noir Eau de Parfum 120ml, at £69.99, is dark and sophisticated. Pink and black pepper lead into Cambodian oud, Cuban tobacco, patchouli and tiare flower for a bold, warm character. Both scents are strong, so a light spray or two is often enough. If you are new to Mancera perfume, start with Black Noir for a darker woody style, or Red Tobacco for something warmer and spicier."},{"p":"If you like these, explore [oud fragrances](#scent-oud), [niche perfume](#k-niche-perfume) and [luxury gifts over £50](#k-gifts-over-50). Each bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and both qualify for free UK delivery."}]},"b-montale":{"h2":"Montale perfume: Aoud Safran and Aoud Damascus","blocks":[{"p":"Montale perfume is known for its love of oud, and our edit features two eaux de parfum from the house, starting at £52.99. Both come in 100ml bottles."},{"p":"Montale Aoud Safran Eau de Parfum 100ml, at £54.99, is a bold unisex scent that pairs rich oud with spicy saffron. Warm, woody and resinous, it has a deep and distinctive character."},{"p":"Montale Aoud Damascus Eau de Parfum 100ml, at £52.99, is described as a women's fragrance. Deep rose meets warm oud and sensual woods for a floral but intense scent. Both scents are rich and long-lasting, so a little goes a long way, and they suit cooler months well. If you are new to Montale perfume, Aoud Safran is the more unisex of the two, while Aoud Damascus leans more floral."},{"p":"For more bottles in this style, browse [oud perfume](#k-oud-perfume), [Arabian perfume](#k-arabian-perfume) and our [oud fragrances](#scent-oud) edit. Every Montale bottle we sell is 100% authentic, ships from the UK and qualifies for free UK delivery, as each is over £50."}]},"b-estee-lauder":{"h2":"Estée Lauder perfume: SpellBound","blocks":[{"p":"Estée Lauder perfume has a long tradition of rich, elegant scents for women. At Swansura we stock the Estée Lauder SpellBound Eau de Parfum 50ml, priced at £49.99."},{"p":"Estée Lauder SpellBound is warm and sensual, with spices, florals, amber and woods. Rose and jasmine sit alongside cardamom, while vanilla and sandalwood give it a smooth, lasting base. It suits cooler months and evenings out. The 50ml bottle is a practical size for daily wear and fits easily on a dressing table. It is also an elegant choice as a present for someone who likes warm, spiced florals with a classic feel. The rich, rounded style is a big part of why many people choose Estée Lauder perfume as a signature scent."},{"p":"Looking for more Estée Lauder perfume for women or a similar style? Explore [amber fragrances](#scent-amber), [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women) and [gifts £25 to £50](#k-gifts-25-to-50)."},{"p":"Your bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Add any small extra to pass £50 and UK delivery is free."}]},"b-jean-paul-gaultier":{"h2":"Jean Paul Gaultier Scandal Gold and Classique","blocks":[{"p":"Jean Paul Gaultier Scandal Gold is the warm, honeyed pick from the French designer's range at Swansura. The 80ml Eau de Parfum is £62.99. Saffron and cardamom open it, jasmine follows, and a deep base of patchouli, sandalwood and leather keeps it going. It is a rich women's fragrance with real presence for evenings and colder months."},{"h3":"Classique for every day","p":"If you love the powdery floral side of Jean Paul Gaultier Classique, the Classique Perfumed Shower Gel 200ml brings it into your routine for £22.99. The silky gel lathers softly and leaves skin lightly scented, so it works on its own or as a base before your favourite spray."},{"p":"Both sit in our [floral fragrances](#scent-floral) edit, and the shower gel also appears with our [amber fragrances](#scent-amber). Browse more [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women) if you want to compare. Every Jean Paul Gaultier perfume and body product we sell is 100% authentic, ships from the UK and comes with free UK delivery on orders over £50. Jean Paul Gaultier Scandal Gold also makes a generous gift."}]},"b-serge-lutens":{"h2":"Serge Lutens perfume: La Fille de Berlin","blocks":[{"p":"Our Serge Lutens perfume edit starts with one striking bottle from the French house. It suits you if you like fragrance with an edge rather than something safe and sweet. Think of it as a scent to wear when you want to be remembered."},{"h3":"A darker kind of rose","p":"Serge Lutens La Fille de Berlin Eau de Parfum 50ml is £44.99. It is built around a dark, velvety rose accord, sharpened with pepper and settled with musk and warm woods. The result feels spicy, floral and slightly metallic, a rose perfume that reads bold and grown up. The 50ml size is easy to carry and a sensible way to get to know the house. As a unisex fragrance it wears well on anyone who enjoys a little drama."},{"p":"If rose is your note, explore our [floral fragrances](#scent-floral). For more distinctive bottles from smaller and more creative houses, see [niche perfume](#k-niche-perfume), or browse our wider [unisex perfume](#k-unisex-perfume) edit."},{"p":"Each Serge Lutens perfume we sell is 100% authentic and sent from our UK base, with free delivery on UK orders over £50."}]},"b-giorgio-armani":{"h2":"Giorgio Armani perfume: Code Eau de Toilette","blocks":[{"p":"Our Giorgio Armani perfume pick comes from the Italian fashion house's best-known men's line. It is a polished, easy scent for workdays and evenings alike, and a reliable gift if you are unsure what someone wears."},{"h3":"Code, in a refillable bottle","p":"The Giorgio Armani Code Refillable Eau de Toilette 125ml is £66.99. Bright bergamot opens it, clary sage adds an aromatic, herbal middle, and smooth tonka bean gives a warm, woody finish. It is refined and masculine without feeling heavy. The refillable format means you can keep the bottle and top it up later. As an eau de toilette it sits close to the skin and feels fresh rather than heavy, so it is simple to wear from morning onwards."},{"p":"If you are shopping Giorgio Armani perfume for men, Code sits naturally beside the rest of our [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men). Its profile also fits our [woody fragrances](#scent-woody) and [fresh fragrances](#scent-fresh) edits, so you can compare it with similar scents."},{"p":"Every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Orders over £50 get free UK delivery, which this one clears on its own."}]},"b-guerlain":{"h2":"Guerlain perfume for women and men","blocks":[{"p":"Guerlain perfume brings French perfumery classics and richer modern blends to one shelf. Our edit has eight pieces, from £44.99 for a miniature set to £94.99 for a 125ml bottle, with something for every mood."},{"h3":"Timeless signatures","p":"Guerlain Samsara Eau de Parfum 75ml (£69.99) is warm and sensual, with jasmine and ylang-ylang over sandalwood, vanilla and amber. L'Instant de Guerlain Eau de Parfum 75ml (£64.99) leans softer, with magnolia, jasmine and a honeyed, vanilla-amber base. For something lighter and more playful, La Petite Robe Noire Ma Robe Cocktail Eau de Toilette 100ml (£49.99) mixes sparkling citrus and cherry with delicate florals."},{"h3":"For him and for sharing","p":"If you are looking for Guerlain perfume for men, Guerlain Habit Rouge Eau de Parfum 100ml (£64.99) pairs fresh citrus and warm spice with leather and vanilla. Three 125ml unisex blends go deeper. Guerlain Oud Essentiel (£94.99) wraps oud in leather, rose and smoky woods. Épices Exquises (£86.99) was inspired by cardamom coffee, with pepper, patchouli and sandalwood. Guerlain Musc Noble (£74.99) blends rose, saffron and geranium with amber, cedar and white musk."},{"p":"To try several at once, the Mon Guerlain Miniature Perfume Gift Set 4x5ml (£44.99) holds four women's fragrances and sits in our [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets). The deeper bottles also feature in [oud fragrances](#scent-oud) and [amber fragrances](#scent-amber). Every Guerlain perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery over £50."}]},"b-al-haramain":{"h2":"Al Haramain Amber Oud and L'Aventure","blocks":[{"p":"Al Haramain Amber Oud is the collection that made this Arabian perfume house famous, and you will find many of its editions here. These are warm, long-lasting eaux de parfum, each with its own twist on amber."},{"h3":"The Amber Oud editions","p":"The Al Haramain Amber Oud Gold Edition (£29.99) opens with melon and pineapple before a creamy amber and vanilla base. The Amber Oud Tobacco Edition 60ml (£34.99) is sweeter and spicier, with tobacco and woods. Ruby (£41.99) brings saffron and jasmine, Black (100ml, £41.99) is smoky with leather and resins, Bleu (£35.99) is fresh and aromatic, and Carbon (£34.99) is a clean, green take for men. White Edition, the original Amber Oud 60ml and Amber Musk 100ml are here too, plus the Extreme Gold Edition Extrait de Parfum at £37.99."},{"h3":"L'Aventure and Detour Noir","p":"The Al Haramain L'Aventure line offers fresher 100ml bottles from £24.99. The original L'Aventure (£27.99) is clean and citrusy, while Al Haramain L'Aventure Intense (£30.99) adds elemi, jasmine and patchouli. L'Aventure Gold and L'Aventure Femme suit women who like fruity florals, and L'Aventure Blanche is a crisp unisex option. Al Haramain Detour Noir 100ml (£19.99) is a warm blend of vanilla, lavender and almond."},{"p":"Compare these with other [Arabian perfume](#k-arabian-perfume) or browse the full [oud fragrances](#scent-oud) edit. If you enjoy this style, [Signature D'orient](#b-signature-d-orient) is worth a look. Every Al Haramain perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from our UK base, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-la-maison":{"h2":"La Maison perfume: La Maison de la Vanille","blocks":[{"p":"La Maison perfume at Swansura means the La Maison de la Vanille collection: warm, unisex scents that put vanilla at the centre. Three 100ml eaux de parfum cost £19.99 each, which makes them an easy way to try a new signature. Each one wears well on anyone, so they are simple to share."},{"h3":"Three ways with vanilla","p":"La Maison de la Vanille Absolu de Vanille Eau de Parfum is the richest of the three, a vanilla perfume that goes beyond simple sweetness. La Maison de la Vanille Ambre Secret opens with soft, powdered vanilla, moves into a sensual woody heart and finishes sweet and spicy. Royal Oud pairs precious oud with elegant florals, warm woods and musk for something deeper. It is the one to choose if you want vanilla with a smokier, more evening feel."},{"h3":"A boxed collection","p":"The Vanilles des Origines Wooden Coffret holds five 30ml bottles of Eau de Toilette for £84.99. It is a beautifully presented eau de toilette gift set for anyone who loves vanilla and wants to explore different takes on it. The 30ml bottles also travel well, so you can carry a favourite in your bag."},{"p":"All four sit comfortably in our [amber fragrances](#scent-amber), and the coffret also appears in [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets). Prefer something smokier? Try our [oud fragrances](#scent-oud). Every La Maison perfume is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery once your basket passes £50."}]},"b-gucci":{"h2":"Gucci perfume: Bloom, Flora, Guilty and Intense Oud","blocks":[{"p":"Gucci perfume from the Italian fashion house covers four well-loved lines at Swansura: Bloom, Flora, Guilty and Intense Oud. You will find 13 pieces, from pen sprays and miniatures at £16.95 to a full gift set at £84.99."},{"h3":"Bloom and Flora","p":"Much of the range is Gucci perfume for women. Gucci Flora Gorgeous Gardenia Eau de Parfum 50ml (£59.99) centres on white gardenia and jasmine, softened by pear blossom and brown sugar. Bloom is built around jasmine and tuberose. The Bloom Eau de Parfum Gift Set 100ml + 10ml + Body Lotion 100ml (£84.99) is the Gucci Bloom gift set to choose for a full ritual, while Bloom Parfum, Bloom Eau de Toilette and Bloom Profumo di Fiori come as 10ml sprays from £16.95."},{"h3":"Guilty and Intense Oud","p":"For Gucci perfume for men, Gucci Guilty Pour Homme Eau de Toilette 90ml (£59.99) blends lemon and pink pepper with lavender, orange blossom and cedarwood. Gucci Intense Oud Eau de Parfum Spray 90ml (£73.99) is a deep unisex blend of oud, leather, incense and amber. Guilty Pour Femme comes as a 10ml mini or a 50ml gift set with body lotion."},{"p":"The miniature sets are made for discovery. Compare them in [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis) and [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets), or find Intense Oud in our [oud fragrances](#scent-oud). Everything is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-dolce-gabbana":{"h2":"Dolce & Gabbana perfume: The One, Devotion and more","blocks":[{"p":"Dolce & Gabbana perfume from the Italian fashion house spans 12 bottles and sets at Swansura, priced from £34.99 to £69.99. The range leans warm and sensual, with a few bright, fruity choices too."},{"h3":"For him","p":"Dolce & Gabbana The One for Men Eau de Parfum blends grapefruit, cardamom and ginger with tobacco, amber and cedarwood. Choose 100ml at £54.99 or 150ml at £69.99. The One for Men Eau de Parfum Intense 100ml (£54.99) goes deeper with neroli, cashmeran, benzoin and leather, and The One Gold for Men Eau de Parfum Intense (£54.99) adds aromatic spice. The K Eau de Parfum Gift Set 50ml + 5ml (£54.99) is fresh, herbal and woody."},{"h3":"For her","p":"Dolce & Gabbana Devotion is a gourmand built on candied citrus, orange blossom and creamy vanilla, in a 100ml bottle or a 50ml + 10ml gift set, both £54.99. The One for Women Eau de Parfum Gift Set 50ml + 50ml (£64.99) mixes peach and lychee with vanilla and amber. Q Eau de Parfum 100ml (£53.99) is fruity and floral with cherry, and L'Imperatrice Eau de Toilette 100ml (£34.99) is a juicy blend of watermelon, kiwi and rhubarb."},{"p":"Not sure where to start? Each Dolce & Gabbana miniature fragrance set holds five scents, at £39.99 for women and £34.99 for men. See more in [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis) and [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men), or compare with fellow Italian house [Gucci](#b-gucci). Every Dolce & Gabbana perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery over £50."}]},"b-chopard":{"h2":"Chopard perfume: the Malaki collection and more","blocks":[{"p":"Chopard perfume comes from the Swiss jewellery house, and its scents carry the same taste for rich materials. Our edit has five pieces, from £42.99 to £59.99, most of them in 80ml bottles. Expect warm amber, smoky incense and polished florals rather than light, sporty freshness."},{"h3":"The Malaki trio","p":"Chopard Oud Malaki Eau de Parfum 80ml (£48.99) is a deep men's fragrance of warm spices, leather, tobacco and oud. Chopard Black Incense Malaki 80ml (£42.99) is smoky and unisex, with incense, resins and warm amber. Chopard Amber Malaki 80ml (£49.99) is built around golden amber, with incense, orange blossom, labdanum and Bourbon vanilla. If you have been searching for Chopard Oud Malaki in the UK, this is the bottle to start with."},{"h3":"Softer and to share","p":"Chopard Imperiale Iris Malika Eau de Parfum 100ml (£42.99) is a powdery, elegant women's fragrance centred on iris. The Gardens of Paradise Discovery Set 4x10ml (£59.99) holds four unisex fragrances inspired by the gardens of the Orient, a good gift for someone who likes to explore. Each 10ml bottle is big enough to wear for a while before you choose a favourite."},{"p":"Chopard perfume suits anyone drawn to deep, resinous blends, so browse our [oud perfume](#k-oud-perfume) and [amber fragrances](#scent-amber) edits next. The discovery set also sits in [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets). Every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-tom-ford":{"h2":"Tom Ford perfume: Black Orchid, Oud Wood and more","blocks":[{"p":"Tom Ford perfume is known for bold, luxurious signatures, and our edit brings together six of them from the American designer. Prices run from £115.99 to £184.99, so these are bottles for a special purchase or a gift. Five of the six are unisex, so you can choose by note rather than by label."},{"h3":"The signatures","p":"Tom Ford Black Orchid Parfum 100ml (£153.99) is rich and sensual, blending truffle, plum, rum, ylang-ylang, black orchid and patchouli. Tom Ford Oud Wood Eau de Parfum is smooth and understated, with oud, exotic woods, spice and soft amber, from £115.99 or £124.99 for the 50ml. Tom Ford Neroli Portofino Eau de Parfum 50ml (£164.99) takes the opposite route, bright citrus and aromatic florals inspired by the Italian Riviera."},{"h3":"Deeper and smokier","p":"Tom Ford Ébène Fumé Eau de Parfum 50ml (£184.99) combines smoky woods, warm spices and resins for a deep, unisex scent. If you want Tom Ford perfume for men, Tom Ford Noir Extreme Parfum 100ml for Men (£144.99) is warm and creamy, with spice and deep woody accords. It is intense and luxurious, a scent for evenings and colder weather."},{"p":"Most of the range is unisex, so explore our [unisex perfume](#k-unisex-perfume) edit or find Oud Wood among our [oud fragrances](#scent-oud). Noir Extreme also features in [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men). Each bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and every one qualifies for free UK delivery over £50."}]},"b-hermes":{"h2":"Hermès perfume: the Jardins miniatures","blocks":[{"p":"Hermès perfume at Swansura focuses on the Jardins collection from the French house: garden-inspired scents in small, beautifully made bottles. Our five pieces start at £24.99, so they are an affordable way into a famous house. The 15ml size suits travel, a gym bag or a desk drawer."},{"h3":"Three gardens","p":"Un Jardin sur le Toit Eau de Toilette 15ml (£24.99) opens with crisp apple and juicy pear before soft rose and green notes. Un Jardin en Méditerranée Eau de Toilette 15ml (£24.99) is fresh and elegant, inspired by Mediterranean gardens. Un Jardin à Cythère draws on the sunlit Greek island of Kythira, with bright citrus over a warm woody base. You will find it at £24.99, or at £25.99 in a second listing."},{"h3":"For gifting","p":"The Hermès Miniature EDT Gift Set 4 x 7.5ml (£64.99) brings together four Jardins scents inspired by nature and travel. Each one is a light, unisex fragrance that suits anyone, which makes the set an easy present. Inside, the scents move from green and fruity to citrus and woody, so the recipient can find their favourite."},{"p":"These minis fit neatly into a handbag, so compare them with our other [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis) or the wider [fresh fragrances](#scent-fresh) edit. At these prices they also work as [stocking fillers](#k-stocking-fillers). Every Hermès perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-bvlgari":{"h2":"Bvlgari perfume: Man in Black, Omnia and more","blocks":[{"p":"Bvlgari perfume comes from the Italian jewellery house, and our edit of eight pieces runs from £34.99 to £79.99. Half the range is gift sets, so it is a strong place to shop for presents. Each set pairs a full bottle with a smaller spray."},{"h3":"For men","p":"Bvlgari Man in Black Eau de Parfum 100ml (£64.99) is bold and warm, with rum, tobacco, leather, iris and tonka bean. The Man Essence gift sets each pair a 100ml Eau de Parfum with a 15ml travel spray. The Bvlgari Man Wood Essence Gift Set (£64.99) blends citrus with cedar, vetiver and benzoin. Terrae Essence (£69.99) is earthy, Rain Essence (£54.99) is clean with green tea and white lotus, and Glacial Essence (£69.99) is crisp with juniper. Together they make a generous choice of Bvlgari perfume for men."},{"h3":"For women","p":"For Bvlgari perfume for women, Bvlgari Omnia Amethyste Eau de Toilette 25ml (£34.99) is delicate, with iris, rose and soft woods. Bvlgari Splendida Tubereuse Mystique Eau de Parfum 100ml (£54.99) is rich and creamy, with tuberose, vanilla and myrrh. The Rose Goldea Blossom Delight Gift Set 75ml + 15ml (£79.99) is a radiant rose and peony floral."},{"p":"Browse more [gifts for him](#k-gifts-for-him) and [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets), or explore similar scents in our [woody fragrances](#scent-woody) edit. Every Bvlgari bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-tiziana-terenzi":{"h2":"Tiziana Terenzi perfume: Italian niche extraits","blocks":[{"p":"Tiziana Terenzi perfume comes from an Italian niche house known for rich, long-lasting extraits. We carry 22 of them, all in 100ml bottles, from £76.99 to £299.99. Every scent is unisex."},{"h3":"Where to start","p":"Tiziana Terenzi Kirke (£82.99) is sweet and fruity, with tropical fruits, soft florals, musk, vanilla and sandalwood. Tiziana Terenzi Andromeda (£109.99) is smooth and creamy, with fresh, floral and fruity notes. For something warmer, Tiziana Terenzi Gold Rose Oudh (£84.99) pairs Bulgarian rose with oud, spice, amber and honey. Kaff (£144.99) is aromatic and woody, and Orza (£164.99) is a fruity floral with a sensual amber and vanilla base."},{"h3":"Deeper blends","p":"Tiziana Terenzi Orion (£109.99) mixes citrus and pineapple with smoke, patchouli and oud. Tiziana Terenzi Caput Mundi, from the Luna Collection, layers rose, saffron and precious woods over oud, at £99.99 or £106.99. Dubhe Assoluto (£299.99) is the most opulent, with oud, rose, saffron and sandalwood. Porpora, Ecstasy, Draconis and Chimaera Anniversary complete the darker side."},{"h3":"Fresher choices","p":"White Fire (£76.99) is clean and musky, Akragas (£85.99) is marine and herbal, inspired by Sicily, and Deriva (£119.99) from the Sea Stars Collection is fresh and salty. If you are new to Tiziana Terenzi perfume, Kirke or White Fire are friendly first picks. Explore more [niche perfume](#k-niche-perfume) or our [oud fragrances](#scent-oud). Each extrait de parfum is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery over £50."}]},"b-dior":{"h2":"Dior perfume: Sauvage, Miss Dior and minis","blocks":[{"p":"Dior perfume from the French house is here in three forms: a men's gift set, a roll-on for women and a set of minis to share."},{"h3":"Sauvage and Miss Dior","p":"For Dior perfume for men, the Sauvage Eau de Parfum 100ml + 10ml Men's Gift Set (£144) is an amber fougère inspired by the desert at sundown, fresh and spicy with a warm finish. Dior Sauvage Eau de Parfum in this set comes with a travel spray for your bag. For Dior perfume for women, the Miss Dior Eau de Parfum Roller-Pearl 20ml (£51.99) is an amber floral you roll straight onto the skin."},{"p":"The Iconics Mini Perfume Discovery Set 5 x 5ml (£92.99) holds five of the house's best-known scents for women and men. Find more ideas in [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets), [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis) and [luxury gifts over £50](#k-gifts-over-50). All 100% authentic, sent from the UK, with free UK delivery over £50."}]},"b-acqua-di-parma":{"h2":"Acqua di Parma perfume in 20ml sizes and sets","blocks":[{"p":"Acqua di Parma perfume brings Italian elegance in handy sizes at Swansura. Most of our nine pieces are 20ml sprays at £40.99, with sets and grooming from £32.99, so you can try a scent before you commit to a big bottle."},{"h3":"The 20ml Eaux de Parfum","p":"Acqua di Parma Zafferano pairs luminous citrus with precious saffron and smooth woods. Acqua di Parma Sandalo is a woody aromatic centred on creamy sandalwood. Acqua di Parma Sakura, inspired by Japanese cherry blossom, opens with Calabrian bergamot. These three are unisex. Acqua di Parma Rosa Nobile is a women's fragrance that celebrates Italian rose, and Acqua di Parma Oud & Spice is a men's blend of bergamot, warm spice and deep oud."},{"h3":"Colonia and sets","p":"Acqua di Parma Colonia Pura Eau de Cologne 20ml (£32.99) is fresh and modern, with Italian bergamot and orange. The Colonia Essenza Deodorant Stick 75ml (£32.99) carries the citrus aromatic Colonia Essenza scent into your grooming routine. To explore, the Holiday Discovery Set 3x12ml (£54.99) holds Osmanthus, Yuzu and Lily of the Valley, and the Blu Mediterraneo Discovery Set 3x12ml (£44.99) brings three Blu Mediterraneo scents."},{"p":"Compare these with other [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis), browse [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets), or find the deodorant in [men's grooming](#k-mens-grooming). Every Acqua di Parma perfume is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-yves-saint-laurent":{"h2":"YSL perfume: Yvresse Eau de Toilette","blocks":[{"p":"Our YSL perfume pick is a fruity chypre from the French fashion house, made to celebrate elegance and feminine charm. It is a single, considered choice rather than a long list."},{"h3":"Yvresse at a glance","p":"Yves Saint Laurent Yvresse Eau de Toilette 80ml for Women costs £94.99. Inspired by the spirit of celebration, it opens with a sparkling, fruity lift before settling into a classic chypre character. As an eau de toilette it feels vibrant rather than heavy, so it suits both daytime and evening. It makes a memorable present for someone who loves timeless fragrance. The 80ml bottle also gives you plenty to wear through the year, and the classic chypre style rarely feels dated."},{"p":"Browse more [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women) or our [floral fragrances](#scent-floral) to compare. If you are buying a gift, see [luxury gifts over £50](#k-gifts-over-50)."},{"p":"Every YSL perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from our UK base. This bottle qualifies for free UK delivery on its own."}]},"b-the-woods-collection":{"h2":"The Woods Collection perfume: unisex eaux de parfum","blocks":[{"p":"The Woods Collection perfume range is simple to shop: 11 unisex eaux de parfum, each in a 100ml bottle at £44.99. The scents draw on nature, from greenery and woods to roses and golden amber. One fixed price makes it easy to pick by mood rather than budget."},{"h3":"Fresh and green","p":"The Woods Collection Eden opens with crisp bergamot, then moves to soft florals and earthy warmth. The Woods Collection Green Walk is inspired by greenery and aromatic woods, bright and clean from the first spray. The Woods Collection Azure captures crisp air and smooth woods. Pure Shine and Sunrise lean citrus and luminous, and Elysian balances fresh brightness with woody warmth."},{"h3":"Warm and evening","p":"The Woods Collection Twilight is inspired by the calm of the evening, with soft aromatic and spicy notes. Secret Source blends rich woods, warm spice and amber, and Timeless Sands settles into golden amber warmth. Mirage mixes airy freshness with woody depth. The Woods Collection Wild Roses gives rose a deeper, more modern character."},{"p":"Every bottle of The Woods Collection perfume is a unisex perfume, so you can share or swap. See our wider [unisex perfume](#k-unisex-perfume) edit, or compare with other [woody fragrances](#scent-woody) and [fresh fragrances](#scent-fresh). At £44.99 each, they also suit our [gifts from £25 to £50](#k-gifts-25-to-50). All 100% authentic and shipped from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-signature-d-orient":{"h2":"Signature D'orient perfume with travel sprays","blocks":[{"p":"Signature D'orient perfume is Arabian-inspired, and many of its eaux de parfum come with a 15ml travel spray for your bag. We stock 16 pieces, from £38.99 to £75.99. The style runs from clean musk and fresh citrus to warm amber and sandalwood."},{"h3":"Sets with a travel spray","p":"Most of the range pairs a 100ml bottle with a 15ml spray. Musk, Onyx and Sapphire (£64.99 each) include a funnel so you can refill. Musk is a soft, clean musk perfume, Onyx is smoky with amber depth, and Sapphire is bright and citrus. Santal and Ambre (£65.99) are built on creamy sandalwood and rich amber. Aura, Paradiso and Charm (£74.95) come with a refillable travel spray, and Charm opens with fig and jasmine. Diamond, Jade and Opal are £64.99, and Rose is £44.99."},{"h3":"Single bottles","p":"Le Femme Gold 100ml EDP Spray (£42.99) is a radiant feminine scent with fruity notes and white florals. Black Pour Homme 100ml (£38.99) is a warm, woody men's fragrance with citrus and spice, and Blue 100ml (£38.99) is fresh and aquatic. These are good value if you only need one bottle at home."},{"h3":"Try before you choose","p":"The Signature Discovery Set 10x10ml (£75.99) holds ten scents, fresh to rich. It is the easiest way into Signature D'orient perfume. Compare it with other [Arabian perfume](#k-arabian-perfume), browse [Al Haramain](#b-al-haramain), or see more [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets). Every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery over £50."}]},"b-deyga":{"h2":"Deyga natural skincare, hair and body care","blocks":[{"p":"Deyga makes natural skin, hair and body care from plant-based ingredients, many grown on its own farm in India. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga, so every product here is genuine and ships from the UK. We stock 73 Deyga products across face, lips, body, feet and hair."},{"h3":"Face care","p":"Deyga skincare covers each step of a simple routine. The Vitamin C Foaming Face Wash 100ML (£15.99) cleanses without over-drying, and the Tea Tree Facial Toner 100ML (£14.99) refreshes oily skin. For a Deyga face serum, choose the 2% Hyaluronic Acid Serum 20ML (£22.99) for hydration or the Rose Glow Serum 30ml (£17.99) for a softer, dewy look. The Charcoal Detox Face Mask 100G and the Spirulina Matcha Face Pack 150G help with deep cleansing, and the Sunscreen 50ML (£16.99) uses zinc oxide and plant oils."},{"h3":"Lips and body","p":"The Deyga beetroot lip balm is a cult favourite. Pair it with the Mint Lip Scrub in the Soft Lip Combo (£17.99), or choose the Natural Lip Balm 8G (£9.99) as an everyday Deyga lip balm. For the body, the Chocolate Body Butter 100G (£15.99) nourishes dry skin, the Body Scrub 100g (£16.99) uses fruit-derived exfoliants, and handmade bath bars such as Shea Saffron and Rose Pink Clay start at £14.99. The Mini Foot Spa Combo (£37.99) adds a foot soak, scrub and butter."},{"h3":"Shopping Deyga Organics","p":"If you know the brand as Deyga Organics, it is the same range. Browse the [Beetroot range](#range-beetroot) and [Charcoal range](#range-charcoal), or find more [body butter](#k-body-butter) and [lip scrub](#k-lip-scrub). All Deyga products qualify for free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-swansura-selection":{"h2":"Swansura Selection: goat milk soap bars and 24K gold skincare","blocks":[{"p":"A goat milk soap bar is the heart of the Swansura Selection, a small edit of skincare, body care and gifts chosen by our team. There are seven pieces, from £9.99."},{"h3":"Handmade soap bars","p":"Each handmade soap here weighs 115G or 125G and costs £9.99. The Classic Goatmilk Soap Bar nourishes dry skin and cleanses without stripping its natural moisture. The Charcoal Goatmilk Soap Bar is our charcoal soap, made with activated charcoal for a deep cleanse and suited to oily skin. The Classic Rose Goat Milk Soap Bar 125G is a gentle rose soap that leaves skin feeling refreshed. The Cucumber, Curd & Mint Soap Bar feels cool and fresh. All are free from sulfates and parabens."},{"h3":"24K gold skincare","p":"Two pieces use real 24K gold. The 24K Gold Hydrating Face Mask (£34.99) combines gold with hyaluronic acid and polyglutamic acid for a hydrated, radiant look. The Caviar Serum with 24K Gold (£34.99) is a face serum with tremella, beta-glucan and sodium hyaluronate to hydrate and plump the look of skin, plus aloe vera and oat extract to soothe."},{"p":"The selection also includes Roll It 1 Unisex Eau de Parfum 100ml from [Jo Milano](#b-jo-milano). Find more bars in our [Goat milk range](#range-goat-milk), or compare with other [face masks](#k-face-mask). Every goat milk soap bar ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-vilvah":{"h2":"Vilvah goat milk and botanical care in the UK","blocks":[{"p":"Vilvah is an Indian natural beauty brand known for goat milk and botanical formulas for face, hair and body. Swansura is an official UK partner of Vilvah, so every product is genuine and ships from the UK. We stock 72 Vilvah products, from single bottles to full kits."},{"h3":"Where to start","p":"Vilvah Milk Drops, the brightening serum, is the place most people begin. You will also find it in the Milk Face Kit (£45.99) with the Milk Mud Mask. For hair, the Vilvah Goat Milk Shampoo 250ML (£15.99) cleanses without stripping natural moisture and helps soften dry strands. Pair it with the Vilvah conditioner, the Cream Conditioner 250ML (£15.99), for smoother, more manageable hair. The Herbal Shampoo 250ML (£15.99) is made for a flaky scalp."},{"h3":"Face care","p":"Each Vilvah face wash suits a different skin. The Honey Face Wash 100ml (£12.99) contains 10% raw honey and fruit extracts, the Fragrance-Free Cream Face Wash 100ml (£9.99) is gentle and plant-based, and the Milk Powder Face Wash 50g (£13.99) is a water-free powder with hyaluronic acid. For a Vilvah face mask, choose Wild Rose with French pink clay (£11.99) or Charcoal with aloe vera (£12.99). Skin Finish Sunscreen SPF 50 PA+++ (£17.99) leaves a soft, natural finish."},{"h3":"Kits and extras","p":"Kits bundle a routine in one box, from the Lip Nourishing Kit (£13.99) to the Goat Milk Hair Kit (£34.99). Natural Deo Shots and the Natural Lip Scrub (£6.99) round out the range. Browse the [Goat milk range](#range-goat-milk), [shampoo](#k-shampoo), [face wash and cleanser](#k-face-wash) or [natural sunscreen](#k-natural-sunscreen). Every Vilvah UK order over £50 ships free."}]},"b-korloff":{"h2":"Korloff perfume from Paris","blocks":[{"p":"Korloff perfume brings Parisian elegance to nine bottles and sets at Swansura, from £19.99 to £82.99. The range moves from bright fruity florals to rose, oud and leather. Most bottles are 88ml or 100ml, so they last well, and every scent is listed as unisex."},{"h3":"Floral and romantic","p":"Korloff Un Soir à Paris Eau de Parfum 100ml (£25.99) captures a soft evening in Paris, opening with bergamot and grapefruit. Korloff Royal Rose 88ml (£47.99) contrasts sparkling bergamot, mandarin and pink pepper with smoky depth. Miss Korloff 88ml (£35.99) is a fruity floral with apple, mandarin, cassis and ylang-ylang, and Lady Intense 88ml (£35.99) balances pear and orange with creamy florals."},{"h3":"Warmer and darker","p":"Korloff In Love Eau de Parfum 100ml (£26.99) pairs rose and jasmine with oud, patchouli and tonka. Royal Oud 88ml (£47.99) opens with rose, incense and warm spice for a classic Middle Eastern style. Korloff Cuir Mythique Eau de Parfum 100ml (£82.99) explores leather through a smoky, modern lens. For a cleaner choice, Korloff In White Eau de Toilette 88ml (£32.99) is citrus and aromatic, made with the modern man in mind."},{"p":"To sample before choosing, the Paris Discovery Set 3x10ml (£19.99) holds three scents from the house's feminine range. Browse more [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets), [floral fragrances](#scent-floral) or [oud fragrances](#scent-oud). Every Korloff perfume is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-sap":{"h2":"SAP extrait de parfum: bold unisex scents","blocks":[{"p":"SAP extrait de parfum is made for people who like a fragrance with presence. Every bottle in this edit is a 100ml extrait, and every scent is unisex. You can shop five of them here, each at £37.95, so choosing comes down to mood rather than budget. Extrait is a concentrated format, so start with one or two sprays and build from there."},{"h3":"Fresh and fruity","p":"SAP Le Roi opens with pineapple, bergamot, blackcurrant and crisp apple, a bright and polished start with real character. If you prefer green notes, SAP Vert Club pairs citrus and aromatic notes with deep woods for a clean, modern feel. Both sit well in our [fresh fragrances](#scent-fresh) edit."},{"h3":"Oud, spice and patchouli","p":"SAP Saffron Oud blends rich oud with luminous saffron and aromatic spices for a smoky, opulent trail. Oud Leopard FR is darker still, opening with rich spices and smoky accords. For something earthy, SAP Patchouli Intense starts with warm spice and a touch of citrus before a deep patchouli heart. You will find more of this style among our [oud fragrances](#scent-oud)."},{"p":"Because every SAP extrait de parfum is unisex, they are easy to share or to give. Compare them with other [unisex perfume](#k-unisex-perfume) picks, or browse another bold house, [Fumeri](#b-fumeri). Every bottle we sell is 100% authentic and ships from our UK base, with free UK delivery on orders over £50. Saffron Oud and Oud Leopard FR suit cooler evenings, while Le Roi and Vert Club feel brighter for daytime."}]},"b-fumeri":{"h2":"Fumeri perfume: bold eaux de parfum at everyday prices","blocks":[{"p":"Fumeri perfume is about bold, long-lasting eaux de parfum at accessible prices, from amber nights to fresh blues. We stock 18 Fumeri scents, all in 100ml bottles, from £23, with most at £23.95 or £37.95. It is an easy brand to explore if you like a strong trail without a designer price tag."},{"h3":"Warm, smoky and amber","p":"Fumeri Ambre Night wraps rich amber in dark woods and subtle spice. Smokey Leather opens with warm spice before a leather heart, and Oud Saffron For Men layers saffron over smoky depth. Fumeri 540 contrasts luminous saffron and jasmine, while Elixir and Wild bring spice and smoky woods. See more in our [amber fragrances](#scent-amber)."},{"h3":"Fresh and clean","p":"Blue For Men and Victorious For Men both lead with bright citrus and smooth woods, and Victorious adds marine accords. Fumeri Style 33 balances crisp citrus and aromatic notes with warmth, and Gris is a quieter, minimal scent of citrus, soft spice and smooth woods."},{"h3":"Floral and sweet","p":"For a softer side, Rose Vetiver For Women sets rose petals against smoky vetiver, and Orchid Noir pairs velvety orchid with creamy woods. Angel For Women is gourmand, with vanilla and patchouli. Flirt opens with pink grapefruit and ripe peach before peony and jasmine, and Gabriella starts with mandarin and pink pepper. Peach, Adore and Orpheon complete the floral choices."},{"p":"Most of the range is unisex, so it suits anyone. Browse more [unisex perfume](#k-unisex-perfume) or compare with the extraits from [SAP](#b-sap). Every Fumeri perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and orders over £50 come with free UK delivery."}]},"b-jo-milano":{"h2":"Jo Milano perfume and the Game of Spades collection","blocks":[{"p":"Jo Milano perfume centres on the Game of Spades collection, a line of [unisex eaux de parfum](#k-unisex-perfume) and parfums in 100ml bottles. We carry 15 Jo Milano listings, priced from £73.99 to £109.99, so there is a card in the deck for most tastes."},{"h3":"Fresh and spiced","p":"Game Of Spades High Roller opens with grapefruit, bergamot and blackcurrant, then moves to a warm heart of ginger, cinnamon, cardamom and citron, with pink pepper in the base. Unisex Blind Bid P is fresh, spicy and woody. Wildcard starts with bergamot, florals and coriander before crisp apple, ambroxan and creamy vanilla, and the Wildcard parfum spray lists bitter almond and saffron among its top notes."},{"h3":"Floral and gem-named scents","p":"Game Of Spades Queen is a floral woody musk with mandarin and freesia at the top. The Moon edition opens with gardenia, clove and jasmine. The gem-named bottles, Game of Spades Yellow Sapphire, Ruby and Emerald, each balance freshness with woody or warm depth, and Royale mixes fresh, woody and oriental notes for day or night."},{"p":"Rouge and Full House come in more than one format, so check the title and size before you add one to your bag. If you like this style, compare our [niche perfume](#k-niche-perfume) edit or the wider [£50 and over](#price-50-9999) range. Every Jo Milano perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and each bottle qualifies for free UK delivery on its own."}]},"b-nina-ricci":{"h2":"Nina Ricci perfume: classic and fruity florals","blocks":[{"p":"Nina Ricci perfume brings French elegance to a feminine, often playful line-up. We have three Nina Ricci fragrances in stock, from £38.99 to £43.99. Each one leans floral, but they range from powdery and classic to juicy and sweet."},{"h3":"The classic","p":"Nina Ricci L'Air du Temps Eau de Toilette is a timeless women's scent. Carnation and rose blend with jasmine and ylang-ylang, while sandalwood, iris, musk and cedar give a graceful, powdery finish. It belongs in our [floral fragrances](#scent-floral) edit."},{"h3":"Fruity and sweet","p":"Nina Ricci Nina Illusion Eau de Parfum opens with bright citrus and apple, then softens into florals, creamy vanilla, musk and woods. Nina Precious Gold Eau de Parfum is richer, with juicy fruit and sparkling citrus over vanilla, amber and smooth woods. Both come in 50ml bottles. Illusion is the lighter, more playful of the two, and Precious Gold leans sweeter and warmer."},{"p":"If you are choosing Nina Ricci perfume for women as a present, see our [gifts for her](#k-gifts-for-her) or the [£25 to £50](#price-25-50) range. All three are 100% authentic and ship from the UK."}]},"b-paloma":{"h2":"Paloma Picasso perfume: a classic chypre","blocks":[{"p":"Paloma Picasso Eau de Toilette is a sophisticated, distinctive women's fragrance with floral, spicy and woody chypre accords. We stock the full 100ml bottle at £37.99. Its strong, grown-up character sets it apart from lighter, fruity scents."},{"h3":"How it smells","p":"Bright citrus and aromatic spices open the scent and lead into an elegant floral heart. In the base, patchouli, oakmoss, sandalwood and musk give the deep, polished finish that chypre lovers look for. If you have been searching for Paloma Picasso perfume 100ml, this is that size."},{"h3":"Who it suits","p":"It is a confident pick if you prefer classic, characterful scents to sweet ones. Pair it with other bottles from our [woody fragrances](#scent-woody) or browse more [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women). For another timeless house, see [Nina Ricci](#b-nina-ricci). It is also a thoughtful gift for someone who already loves heritage perfumes."},{"p":"Our Paloma perfume is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50. Add a second favourite to your bag to reach that threshold."}]},"b-trussardi":{"h2":"Trussardi perfume, minis and gift sets","blocks":[{"p":"Trussardi perfume from the Italian fashion house covers elegant florals for her and one bold scent for him. We stock six Trussardi pieces, from 7ml miniatures at £14.99 to the 90ml Pure Jasmine at £42.99."},{"h3":"Pure Jasmine","p":"Trussardi Pure Jasmine opens with bergamot, pistachio and neroli, then settles into a rich heart of jasmine and champaca over vanilla, sandalwood and patchouli. You can choose the 90ml Eau de Parfum, the 7ml miniature or the Pure Jasmine Lifestyle Mini Gift Set at £29.99. The miniature is a simple way to get to know the scent first."},{"h3":"Delicate Rose and Ruby Red","p":"Trussardi Delicate Rose Eau de Toilette is fresh and feminine, with kumquat and yuzu at the top, rose, lotus and jasmine at the heart and musk, cedarwood and sandalwood beneath. The Ruby Red Eau de Parfum Gift Set pairs a 60ml Ruby Red, with fruity florals, amber, vanilla and woods, with a 125ml Stardust Body Emulsion for £29.99."},{"h3":"For him","p":"Black Extreme Eau de Toilette 7ml Miniature is bold and masculine. Lemon and marine notes lead to plum and violet leaf, finishing with leather, patchouli and vetiver. The 7ml size slips easily into a jacket pocket or gym bag."},{"p":"The minis are easy to carry and make good [stocking fillers](#k-stocking-fillers), and both sets sit in our [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets) edit. For more jasmine and rose, see [floral fragrances](#scent-floral). Every Trussardi perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from the UK."}]},"b-lancome":{"h2":"Lancôme perfume: the Idôle edit","blocks":[{"p":"Lancôme perfume pairs French polish with modern, feminine scents. We stock two from the Idôle family, priced at £39.99 and £55.99."},{"h3":"Idôle Nectar","p":"Lancôme Idôle Nectar is a modern, sweet take on rose. A rich rose bouquet meets a distinctive popcorn accord, and vanilla gives a creamy, smooth finish. The 25ml Idôle Nectar Eau de Parfum is £39.99 and a handy size for your bag. If you like gourmand rose scents, it is the more unusual of the pair."},{"h3":"Idôle Now Florale","p":"Lancôme Idôle Now Florale is radiant and fresh, with rose and orchid at its floral heart and soft vanilla to finish. It comes as a 50ml Eau de Parfum at £55.99. It feels lighter and brighter, so it works well for daytime."},{"p":"Both are Lancôme perfume for women with a floral, vanilla character, so see our [floral fragrances](#scent-floral) and [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women) for more. Every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and orders over £50 qualify for free UK delivery. For another vanilla floral in mini form, try [Viktor & Rolf](#b-viktor-rolf)."}]},"b-kenneth-cole":{"h2":"Kenneth Cole perfume: Moonlight Blue","blocks":[{"p":"Kenneth Cole perfume at Swansura means Moonlight Blue Eau de Toilette, a fresh, modern men's fragrance in a 100ml bottle at £31.99. As an eau de toilette, it is a lighter concentration made for everyday wear."},{"h3":"The scent","p":"Kenneth Cole Moonlight Blue opens with bright citrus and clean herbs, then soft spices come through. Smooth woods, musk and amber create a refined, masculine finish that is easy to wear day to day. There is no heavy sweetness, so it sits comfortably in an office or on an evening out."},{"h3":"Who will like it","p":"If you enjoy fresh, aromatic scents with a warm base, this is a safe choice for work or weekends. It is the Kenneth Cole perfume for men we stock, and it makes a simple gift at a fair price. The 100ml bottle gives you plenty to wear through the seasons."},{"p":"Compare it with other [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men), browse [fresh fragrances](#scent-fresh), or try the Desire range from [Dunhill](#b-dunhill). Our bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK."}]},"b-juicy-couture":{"h2":"Juicy Couture perfume: Viva La Juicy Rosé","blocks":[{"p":"Juicy Couture perfume is playful and feminine, and Viva La Juicy Rosé Eau de Parfum shows that side well. We stock it at £39.99. The Rosé name hints at the pink, fruity mood of the scent."},{"h3":"The notes","p":"Fresh citrus and pear open the scent with sparkle. A delicate heart of rose, peony and jasmine follows, and amber, musk and warm woods give a smooth, elegant finish. It is a fruity floral with a soft, musky base."},{"h3":"When to wear it","p":"Viva La Juicy Rosé is an easy pick for daytime and warmer months, and for anyone who likes a pretty rose scent with a little warmth underneath. Spray it on pulse points and clothes for a gentle trail through the day."},{"p":"It also makes a thoughtful present, so see our [gifts for her](#k-gifts-for-her) and [floral fragrances](#scent-floral). For more fruity florals, try [Escada](#b-escada). Every Juicy Couture perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-jimmy-choo":{"h2":"Jimmy Choo perfume minis and gift set","blocks":[{"p":"Jimmy Choo perfume comes to Swansura in collectible miniature form. We stock two pieces: a single mini at £14.99 and a five-piece set at £42.99."},{"h3":"I Want Choo Forever","p":"The I Want Choo Forever Eau de Parfum 4.5ml Miniature is rich and feminine. Juicy cherry and rose lead into jasmine and vetiver, while vanilla, tonka bean, amber and oakmoss create a warm, sensual finish. At 4.5ml, it is small enough for a clutch bag."},{"h3":"Women's Miniature Fragrance Gift Set","p":"The gift set holds five popular Jimmy Choo fragrances in 4.5ml bottles, covering fruity, floral, amber and gourmand styles. It is a neat way to try the range before you choose a favourite, and it travels well. Five minis in one box make it a generous present."},{"p":"Both make easy presents of Jimmy Choo perfume for women. Browse more [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis) or our [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets), and see [Marc Jacobs](#b-marc-jacobs) for another mini set. Everything is 100% authentic and ships from the UK."}]},"b-escada":{"h2":"Escada perfume: fruity, sweet and playful","blocks":[{"p":"Escada perfume is sweet, fruity and fun. We stock three Escada fragrances, all Eau de Parfum, from £17.99."},{"h3":"Magnetism","p":"Escada Magnetism blends juicy berries and tropical fruit with delicate florals, then finishes with vanilla, caramel, amber and musk. The 25ml Magnetism Eau de Parfum is £17.99. The small bottle is handy for travel, or for finding out whether this sweet style is for you."},{"h3":"Party Love and Magnetic Dream","p":"Escada Party Love Eau de Parfum 100ml (£23.99) pairs cherry and pear with soft florals over vanilla, musk and creamy woods. Escada Magnetic Dream (75ml, £32.99) is softer, with blackcurrant, pear and mandarin, then peony, magnolia and jasmine on vanilla, musk and sandalwood. Party Love is the brightest and most playful of the three."},{"p":"Each is an Escada perfume for women with a sweet, gourmand side. Compare our [amber fragrances](#scent-amber), look through the [£15 to £25](#price-15-25) range, or try [Juicy Couture](#b-juicy-couture) for another fruity floral. All three are 100% authentic and ship from the UK."}]},"b-hollister":{"h2":"Hollister perfume: Festival Vibes for Him","blocks":[{"p":"Hollister perfume is easy-going and fresh, and Festival Vibes for Him Eau de Toilette is a good example. The 100ml bottle is £21.99. As an eau de toilette, it feels light and relaxed on the skin."},{"h3":"The scent","p":"Pineapple and sea notes create a bright, fruity opening. Ginger, bay leaf and green woods add an aromatic edge, and ambergris and oakmoss settle it at the base. The result is energetic and casual. It suits warm days, holidays and outdoor plans, which fits its name."},{"h3":"Good to know","p":"At this price it is a simple everyday scent or an easy gift. Hollister Festival Vibes sits well beside other [fresh fragrances](#scent-fresh) and the wider [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men) edit. For more choice at a similar price, browse [£15 to £25](#price-15-25)."},{"p":"Our Hollister perfume is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and orders over £50 get free UK delivery. Add a second favourite to your basket to reach that threshold."}]},"b-givenchy":{"h2":"Givenchy perfume for him and her","blocks":[{"p":"Givenchy perfume brings French couture style to two classics, one for her and one for him. Both come in 100ml Eau de Toilette bottles, at £49.99 and £52.99."},{"h3":"Amarige","p":"Givenchy Amarige is rich and elegant. Bright citrus and peach lead into an opulent bouquet of gardenia, tuberose, jasmine and ylang-ylang, with sandalwood beneath. If you want Givenchy perfume for women with a big floral heart, the Amarige Eau de Toilette is £52.99. It is a full, sunny floral for people who like a scent with presence."},{"h3":"Gentleman Originale","p":"Givenchy Gentleman Originale is classic and refined. Bergamot and tarragon open the scent, then patchouli, vetiver and cedarwood give it a distinctive woody depth. It is a smart choice for men at £49.99. It suits the office as well as dinner."},{"p":"Explore more in our [floral fragrances](#scent-floral) and [woody fragrances](#scent-woody), or see [Gifts for him](#k-gifts-for-him). Both bottles are 100% authentic and ship from the UK, and the Amarige qualifies for free UK delivery on its own."}]},"b-dunhill":{"h2":"Dunhill perfume: Desire and the Signature Collection","blocks":[{"p":"Dunhill perfume covers two very different moods, and we stock 14 men's scents in 100ml bottles. The four Desire eaux de toilette are £28.99 each, and the ten Signature Collection eaux de parfum are £45.99."},{"h3":"The Desire range","p":"Dunhill Desire Blue is the fresh one, with bergamot, citrus, lotus and marine nuances over amber, musk and soft woods. Dunhill Desire Black is bolder: black pepper, bergamot and grapefruit, then cypress, saffron and rose, with vetiver in the base. Desire Gold leans spicy and warm, and Desire Silver is clean citrus with musk and amber."},{"h3":"The Signature Collection","p":"Each Signature Collection scent takes its name from a place or material. Dunhill Signature Collection Agar Wood opens with pink pepper, ginger and bergamot before agarwood, saffron and black iris. Arabian Desert pairs saffron and pink pepper with rose, oud, amber, incense and leather. British Leather sets a deep leather heart against vetiver, patchouli and amber, while Egyptian Smoke brings incense and tobacco-like nuances."},{"h3":"Lighter picks","p":"For brighter days, Amalfi Citrus mixes lemon, bergamot and rosemary. Valensole Lavender and Nordic Fougère are aromatic and clean, Moroccan Amber is rich and resinous, and Indian Sandalwood and Mongolian Cashmere are smooth and warm."},{"p":"If you are buying Dunhill perfume for men as a present, see our [gifts for him](#k-gifts-for-him) and [woody fragrances](#scent-woody). For more oud-led scents, browse [oud fragrances](#scent-oud). Every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK."}]},"b-etienne-aigner":{"h2":"Etienne Aigner perfume for men","blocks":[{"p":"Etienne Aigner perfume at Swansura is two confident men's eaux de toilette, both in 100ml bottles. Each brings aromatic spice and warm woods, with a different level of freshness."},{"h3":"No. 1 Intense","p":"Etienne Aigner No. 1 Intense is bold and polished. Fresh opening notes lead into a warm heart of herbs and spices, while amber, musk and rich woods give a smooth, masculine finish. It is £27.99. Its warm, spicy profile works well in autumn and winter."},{"h3":"First Class Explorer","p":"First Class Explorer is fresher. Bright citrus and herbal notes lead into a refined heart of spices and woods, then musk and amber round it off. It is £32.99. It is the lighter choice for warmer days or the office."},{"p":"Both are easy everyday scents and good value gifts. Compare them with our wider [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men) and [woody fragrances](#scent-woody), or see [Dunhill](#b-dunhill) for similar spicy, woody styles. Our Etienne Aigner perfume is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and free UK delivery applies on orders over £50."}]},"b-s-t-dupont":{"h2":"S.T. Dupont perfume: amber, tobacco and bloom","blocks":[{"p":"S.T. Dupont perfume at Swansura is three 100ml eaux de parfum, each at £43.99. Two are warm and unisex, and one is a soft floral."},{"h3":"Royal Amber and Perfect Tobacco","p":"Royal Amber is a rich unisex fragrance of warm amber, aromatic spice and deep woods, with smooth resins and musk underneath. Perfect Tobacco is built around warm tobacco, spicy accords and smooth woods, with a sweet tobacco character and an amber-toned finish. Both are good picks for cooler months and evenings, and both can be worn by anyone."},{"h3":"Pure Bloom","p":"Pure Bloom is feminine and elegant. Juicy fruity notes open into delicate blossoms and a warm, musky base, so it feels fresh and easy to wear. It is the brighter, more daytime-friendly scent of the three."},{"p":"If you like the deeper two, see our [amber fragrances](#scent-amber) and [unisex perfume](#k-unisex-perfume) edits. For a floral alternative, try [floral fragrances](#scent-floral). Every S.T. Dupont perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Orders over £50 qualify for free UK delivery, so one bottle plus a small extra gets you there."}]},"b-shiseido":{"h2":"Shiseido: Zen perfume and Japanese skincare","blocks":[{"p":"Shiseido is a Japanese beauty house, and our edit covers one fragrance and two skincare essentials, from £29.99. It is a small, focused edit that covers fragrance and a simple face routine."},{"h3":"Shiseido Zen","p":"If you came looking for Shiseido perfume, Zen is the one. Grapefruit and bergamot open into a floral heart of freesia, lotus and rose, while amber, musk and patchouli give a warm finish. The Shiseido Zen Eau de Parfum is a 100ml bottle at £47.99."},{"h3":"Skincare","p":"Ultimune Power Infusing Concentrate Face Serum is a lightweight serum that helps boost hydration and leaves skin looking smoother and more radiant (30ml, £35.99). Complete Cleansing Microfoam is a fine foaming cleanser that lifts away impurities, excess oil and everyday residue, leaving skin feeling fresh and soft (180ml, £29.99). Use the cleanser first, then the serum, for an easy two-step routine."},{"p":"Find more in our [face serum](#k-face-serum) and [face wash and cleanser](#k-face-wash) edits, or browse [floral fragrances](#scent-floral). Shopping for Shiseido Zen in the UK? Every item is 100% authentic and ships from our UK base."}]},"b-viktor-rolf":{"h2":"Viktor & Rolf perfume: Good Fortune miniature","blocks":[{"p":"Viktor & Rolf perfume at Swansura is Good Fortune, a rich and feminine Eau de Parfum in a 10ml miniature at £19.99. It is a floral vanilla scent with an unusual aromatic edge."},{"h3":"The notes","p":"Fennel and gentian give Good Fortune a distinctive, slightly aromatic opening. Jasmine forms an elegant floral heart, and creamy bourbon vanilla gives a warm, smooth base. It feels warm and enveloping rather than fresh, so it lends itself to evenings and cooler days."},{"h3":"Why a mini","p":"A 10ml miniature lets you wear the scent for a while before you commit to a larger size. It fits in a handbag or travel kit and makes a thoughtful small present. It also lets you carry your fragrance for top-ups through the day."},{"p":"Browse more [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis) or find small treats among our [stocking fillers](#k-stocking-fillers). For another floral vanilla scent, see [Lancôme](#b-lancome). Our Viktor & Rolf perfume is 100% authentic and ships from the UK."}]},"b-marc-jacobs":{"h2":"Marc Jacobs perfume: Perfect, Honey and Daisy","blocks":[{"p":"Marc Jacobs perfume is bright, playful and feminine, and we stock seven pieces from £19.99. You will find full sizes, 10ml miniatures and a gift set."},{"h3":"Perfect","p":"Marc Jacobs Perfect comes in several forms. The Perfect Eau de Parfum 50ml (£52.99) opens with rhubarb and narcissus, then almond milk adds softness and cedarwood with cashmeran gives warmth. The Perfect Eau de Toilette 10ml Miniature is fresher, with rhubarb, pink pepper and narcissus over cedarwood. Perfect Elixir, also a 10ml mini, is warmer, with plum and rhubarb leading to vanilla, amber and smooth woods."},{"h3":"Honey","p":"Marc Jacobs Honey Eau de Parfum 100ml (£35.99) blends pear and mandarin with orange blossom, honeysuckle and peach, finished with honey, vanilla and smooth woods. It is cheerful and warm."},{"h3":"Daisy","p":"Daisy Love Eau de Toilette 10ml Miniature pairs sparkling cloudberry with daisy petals and cashmere musk. The Daisy Love Glow Limited Edition Eau de Toilette 50ml opens with lemon, cloudberry and bergamot before jasmine and lemon blossom."},{"p":"The Women's Miniature Fragrance Gift Set 2025 (£39.99) brings together four feminine scents, including Daisy, Daisy Eau So Fresh and Perfect, so it is a neat way to try the line. See more [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets), [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis) or [floral fragrances](#scent-floral). Every Marc Jacobs perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"b-elizabeth-arden":{"h2":"Elizabeth Arden perfume: Beauty Eau de Parfum","blocks":[{"p":"Elizabeth Arden perfume at Swansura is Beauty Eau de Parfum, an elegant feminine scent in a 100ml bottle at £16.99. That is a full-size bottle at an accessible price."},{"h3":"The notes","p":"Elizabeth Arden Beauty blends fresh green and floral notes. Delicate iris and rice flower meet lotus, lily and orchid, and sandalwood, amber and musk give a smooth, refined finish. It is a soft, polished floral rather than a sweet one, so it is easy to wear to work."},{"h3":"A generous gift","p":"At £16.99 for a full 100ml, it makes a generous present, or an everyday scent you can wear without saving it for best. If the person you are buying for likes classic floral scents, it is an elegant choice. It also suits anyone building a small fragrance wardrobe on a budget."},{"p":"Find similar ideas among our [gifts under £25](#k-gifts-under-25) and in [floral fragrances](#scent-floral), or see more [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women). This Elizabeth Arden perfume is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Orders over £50 qualify for free UK delivery."}]},"b-elie-saab":{"h2":"Elie Saab perfume: Le Parfum, Elixir and more","blocks":[{"p":"Elie Saab perfume is radiant and feminine, built around luminous white florals. We stock ten Elie Saab pieces, from £31.99 for Elixir to £52.99 for the Le Parfum gift set. The range runs from everyday eaux de parfum to gift sets and a unisex collection."},{"h3":"The Le Parfum family","p":"Le Parfum Eau de Parfum 50ml (£45.99) blends orange blossom and jasmine with cedar, patchouli and honey. Elie Saab Le Parfum Intense 90ml (£49.99) is richer, with ylang-ylang, rose, honey and patchouli. Le Parfum Bridal (90ml, £44.99) takes its cue from the house's bridal couture, with orange blossom, neroli and mandarin, then gardenia, ylang-ylang and vanilla."},{"h3":"Elixir and Nuit Noor","p":"Elie Saab Elixir Eau de Parfum 50ml mixes mandarin, neroli and rose with creamy woods, vanilla and musk. Nuit Noor Eau de Parfum 90ml (£37.99) is deep and sensual, with dark florals, warm resins, patchouli and musk, and suits the evening."},{"h3":"Gift sets and Essences","p":"The Elie Saab Le Parfum gift set pairs the 90ml with body lotion and shower gel. Le Parfum Lumière comes with a 10ml spray and body lotion (£48.99), and Girl of Now Lovely pairs a 50ml with body lotion (£38.99). For unisex wear, La Collection des Essences offers No. 1 Rose and No. 4 Oud, both 100ml."},{"p":"Browse more [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets), [floral fragrances](#scent-floral) or the [oud fragrances](#scent-oud) edit. Every Elie Saab perfume is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and orders over £50 qualify for free UK delivery."}]},"b-carolina-herrera":{"h2":"Carolina Herrera perfume: Good Girl, Bad Boy and 212","blocks":[{"p":"Carolina Herrera perfume is bold and glamorous, with scents for her and for him. We stock seven, from £19.99 for the 10ml Bad Boy Le Parfum up to £76.99 for the 150ml bottle. The line-up covers the Good Girl, Bad Boy and 212 families."},{"h3":"For her","p":"Very Good Girl Glam Parfum 50ml (£62.99) combines juicy cherry, rich rose and warm vanilla with a smooth woody finish. 212 VIP Rosé Eau de Parfum 125ml (£74.99) is chic and sparkling, with champagne rosé and pink pepper, then peach blossom, rose and soft woods. Very Good Girl Glam is the more glamorous evening choice, and 212 VIP Rosé feels lighter and celebratory."},{"h3":"For him","p":"212 VIP Men Eau de Toilette 100ml (£55.99) opens with lime and passion fruit, then vodka, ginger, mint and spice over warm amber. 212 Sexy Men (£54.99) is warmer, with citrus, cardamom, pepper, vanilla, sandalwood and musk. Bad Boy Le Parfum pairs grapefruit and hemp with black pepper, geranium, leather and vetiver. Bad Boy Extreme Eau de Parfum is the most intense, with ginger, bergamot, cacao, vetiver, patchouli and tonka bean. The 10ml Bad Boy Le Parfum is a handy travel size."},{"p":"Browse more [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men) and [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women), or see [£50 and over](#price-50-9999) for luxury gifts. Every Carolina Herrera perfume we sell is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and most of these qualify for free UK delivery on their own."}]},"k-body-butter":{"h2":"Body butter for soft, comfortable skin","blocks":[{"p":"A good body butter is thicker and richer than a lotion, so it suits skin that feels rough, tight or flaky. Our edit brings together six balms and butters made with shea, cocoa and natural oils, priced from £12.99. Smooth one over damp skin after a shower and it helps hold moisture in for hours."},{"h3":"Rich butters from Deyga and Highborn London","p":"Deyga's Chocolate Body Butter 100G (£15.99) blends cocoa with nourishing oils, and it is the pick if you love a warm, sweet scent. A chocolate body butter feels like a treat on cold UK evenings. The Rose & Geranium Body Butter 40G, also £15.99, uses a rich mix of natural butters and oils for long-lasting softness. For a more luxurious finish, Highborn London's Natural Luminosity Body Butter (£50) has a butter-soft texture made for dull, dry skin."},{"h3":"Feet and lips need care too","p":"Deyga's Foot Butter 40 g (£12.99) combines virgin coconut oil, olive oil, beeswax, vitamin E and vanilla to condition and smooth the skin on your feet, with a light, non-greasy feel. Highborn London's Superior Lip Butter comes in 15ml (£22.50) and Large 50ml (£29) sizes for lips that need extra comfort. You will find more lip picks in our [lip balm and lip care edit](#k-lip-balm)."},{"p":"If you are choosing a body butter for dry skin, start with the Deyga butters and use them morning and night on elbows, knees and shins. Pair your butter with a gentle [body scrub](#k-body-scrub) once or twice a week so it sinks in more easily. Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50. Looking for a natural body butter in the UK that is a little lighter? Browse our [deep hydration picks](#concern-hydration) too."}]},"k-shower-gel-body-wash":{"h2":"Shower gel and body wash, plus natural soap bars","blocks":[{"p":"Find your new everyday shower gel and body wash here, alongside handmade soap bars and bath oils. There are 15 products in this edit, from £9.99, covering charcoal, goat milk, rose, berry and herbal blends from Deyga, Vilvah, anatomē, Coach and our own Swansura Selection."},{"h3":"Natural body wash in a bottle","p":"If you prefer a liquid wash, Deyga's Wild Berry Body Wash 220ml (£16.99) is made with wild berry extracts and cleanses without stripping natural oils. The Activated Charcoal Body Wash 220ML (£15.99) adds cucumber to a deep-cleansing charcoal formula. Both suit anyone looking for a natural body wash with a fresh feel. Fans of fragrance can try the Coach Green Shower Gel 100ml (£13.99), a men's wash with citrus, green and woody accords."},{"h3":"Bars, from goat milk soap to charcoal","p":"Our Swansura Selection bars are handmade and free from sulphates and parabens, each £9.99 for 115G or 125G. The Classic Goatmilk Soap Bar is the gentle choice for dry or sensitive skin, while the Classic Rose Goat Milk Soap Bar adds rose extracts. If you want a charcoal soap, choose the Charcoal Goatmilk Soap Bar or Deyga's Charcoal Bath Bar 130 g (£10.99), made with coconut oil, shea butter and olive oil. Deyga also makes Neem & Turmeric, Shea Saffron, Spinach & Cucumber and Rose Pink Clay bath bars, from £14.99. See the full [charcoal range](#range-charcoal) and [goat milk range](#range-goat-milk)."},{"h3":"A spa moment","p":"For slower evenings, anatomē's Bath & Shower Oil with Roman Chamomile & Cornish Lavender (£68) brings jojoba, coconut and sunflower oils with a soft rose scent. Everything ships from the UK, is 100% authentic, and orders over £50 travel free across the UK. Explore more in [Bath & Body](#c-bath-body)."}]},"k-body-lotion":{"h2":"Body lotion that sinks in fast","blocks":[{"p":"A body lotion is the lighter, everyday way to keep skin soft from neck to toe. It spreads easily, absorbs quickly and leaves no heavy film, so you can dress straight away. We currently stock two favourites from the Indian natural brands Deyga and Vilvah, from £14.99."},{"h3":"Deyga Almond Milk Body Lotion","p":"The Almond Milk Body Lotion 100 ml (£14.99) is a nourishing formula with almond milk and natural oils. It is lightweight and fast-absorbing, so skin feels hydrated without any greasy residue. It is made for daily use and fits easily in a gym bag or travel kit."},{"h3":"Vilvah Milk Body Lotion","p":"Vilvah's Milk Body Lotion 250ml (£25.99) is the larger bottle, infused with oat milk, ceramides and olive squalane to moisturise and support the skin barrier. It is vegan, not tested on animals and gentle enough for the whole family. If you want a natural body lotion in the UK that lasts, this size is good value for daily use."},{"p":"When your skin feels very tight or rough, step up to a richer texture. Our [body lotion for dry skin](#k-body-lotion-for-dry-skin) edit adds Deyga's shea and cocoa butters, and the [body butter](#k-body-butter) page has more balm-like options. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, every product is 100% authentic, and we ship from the UK with free delivery on orders over £50. For a full routine, browse [Bath & Body](#c-bath-body)."}]},"k-body-scrub":{"h2":"Body scrub and exfoliators for smooth skin","blocks":[{"p":"A body scrub lifts away dull, dry surface skin so your moisturiser can do its job. This edit holds 11 scrubs, polishes and exfoliating tools, from £6.99, made with sugar, coffee, fruit and natural oils."},{"h3":"For the whole body","p":"Deyga's Body Scrub 100g (£16.99) uses fruit-derived exfoliants with papaya and pomegranate for visibly smoother skin. If you love a coffee body scrub, Vilvah's Cookie N Cream Body Polish 200ml (£22.99) combines coffee powder with almond milk, shea butter and argan oil, and the Body Polishing Kit (£48.99) pairs a coffee scrub with almond milk care. Deyga's Face & Body Exfoliator Powder 50 g (£15.99) mixes lemon, neem, matcha and black rice, and the Organic Loofah for Body Exfoliation (£12.99) is biodegradable."},{"h3":"Luxury and targeted picks","p":"Highborn London's Natural Luminosity Scrub (£50) is paraben and sulphate free in recyclable packaging, and the Scrub and Glow Luminosity Set (£89) pairs it with the matching body butter. For rough heels, Deyga's Foot Scrub 100 g (£17.99) softens tough skin with regular use."},{"h3":"Do not forget your lips","p":"A lip scrub keeps lips smooth under balm or lipstick. Choose Deyga's Mint Lip Scrub 16G (£12.99), the Strawberry Lip Scrub 16g (£10.99) or Vilvah's Natural Lip Scrub 10 g (£6.99). See them all on our [lip scrub](#k-lip-scrub) page."},{"p":"Scrub two or three times a week, then follow with a [body butter](#k-body-butter) to lock in softness. If you are after a natural body scrub in the UK, every product here is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery over £50. More ideas sit in [Glow & even tone](#concern-glow)."}]},"k-face-wash":{"h2":"Face wash and cleanser for every skin type","blocks":[{"p":"The right face wash sets up the rest of your routine. It should lift away dirt, oil and sunscreen without leaving your skin tight. We stock nine face washes and cleansers, from £9.99, including foams, creams, powders and a cleansing balm."},{"h3":"For dry and sensitive skin","p":"Vilvah's Fragrance-Free Cream Face Wash 100ml (£9.99) uses mild plant-based cleansers with banana fruit extract, which makes it a gentle face wash for sensitive skin. Deyga's Oat Milk Face Wash 100 ml (£12.99) is another soft oat milk face wash that helps skin keep its moisture. Vilvah's Milk Powder Face Wash 50g (£13.99) is a water-free powder with hyaluronic acid that you activate in your palm."},{"h3":"For oily skin and a brighter look","p":"The Charcoal Face Wash 100ml from Deyga (£25.99) uses activated charcoal to draw out excess oil. For a vitamin C face wash, Deyga's Vitamin C Foaming Face Wash 100ML (£15.99) has a micro-foam texture. Vilvah's Honey Face Wash 100ml (£12.99) contains 10% raw honey with papaya, blackberry and orange peel extracts."},{"h3":"Balms and luxury cleansers","p":"Deyga's Tangerine Cleansing Balm for Makeup Removal 30g (£15.99) melts away make-up and sunscreen. Highborn London's Crystal Cleanser (100ml, £24) contains Co-Enzyme Q10, and Shiseido's Complete Cleansing Microfoam 180ml (£29.99) offers a fine, light foam."},{"p":"Not sure which suits you? Try our guides to [face wash for dry skin](#k-face-wash-for-dry-skin) and [face wash for oily skin](#k-face-wash-for-oily-skin). Every natural face wash here is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery on orders over £50. Then follow with a [toner](#k-toner)."}]},"k-vitamin-c-serum":{"h2":"Vitamin C serum for a brighter-looking glow","blocks":[{"p":"A vitamin C serum is one of the simplest ways to add brightness to your morning routine. Our edit focuses on Deyga, the Indian natural skincare brand, with three products from £15.99. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga, so every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Deyga 10% Vitamin C Face Serum","p":"The 10% Vitamin C Face Serum 20ml (£16.99) is infused with Naranga (Citrus sinensis) extract and uses ascorbyl glucoside, a stable form of vitamin C. It is made to refresh dull-looking skin and help the look of uneven tone. Apply two or three drops after cleansing and toning, then follow with moisturiser and SPF during the day. Store the bottle away from direct sunlight and keep the cap closed tightly between uses. If your skin is new to vitamin C, start every other morning and build up to daily use."},{"h3":"Pair it with a vitamin C face wash","p":"Deyga's Vitamin C Foaming Face Wash 100ML (£15.99) has a micro-foam texture that cleanses without over-drying. Used before the serum, it keeps the whole routine bright and simple. If you would like both together, the Vitamin C Daily Glow Combo (£30.99) bundles Deyga's vitamin C care in one set."},{"p":"Vitamin C works well in a routine of skincare for dull skin, alongside gentle exfoliation and daily sun protection. Browse the full [Vitamin C range](#range-vitamin-c), compare other [face serums](#k-face-serum), and finish with a daily [sunscreen](#k-sunscreen). Orders over £50 ship free across the UK."}]},"k-face-serum":{"h2":"Face serum for glow, hydration and smoother-looking skin","blocks":[{"p":"A face serum delivers a concentrated dose of care between cleansing and moisturising. Our edit brings together 16 serums and face oils, from £16.99, from Indian natural brands Deyga and Vilvah, British brands Highborn London and anatomē, and Shiseido."},{"h3":"Hydration first","p":"Vilvah's Milk Drops Hydrating Serum 40ml (£30.99) is a milk-based serum with natural milk proteins for everyday radiance. Deyga's 2% Hyaluronic Acid Serum 20ML (£22.99) keeps skin soft and supple through the day. Highborn London's MOISTUREBURST Hydrating Glow Ceramide Serum (£85) is a vegan-friendly ceramide serum for dehydrated skin, and its Pre-Eminent Beauty Serum (£66) is a non-oily formula made in England."},{"h3":"For a face serum for glowing skin","p":"Deyga's Rose Glow Serum 30ml (£17.99) and 10% Vitamin C Face Serum 20ml (£16.99) are the brightening picks. anatomē's Illuminating Rose-hip, Grape Seed & Avocado Face Oil (£52) is rich in omega 3s and antioxidants. Vilvah's AM PM Serum Kit (£47.99) pairs a morning brightening serum with an evening one, a smart choice if you want a face serum for dull skin. See more in our [vitamin C serum](#k-vitamin-c-serum) edit."},{"h3":"Mature and sensitive skin","p":"Highborn London's Bakuchiol Youth Elixir (£99) is a plant-based alternative to retinol, and the YOUTHBOOST Anti-Ageing Peptide Serum (£94) combines several peptides to smooth the look of wrinkles. Vilvah's Better Ageing Serum 20ml (£28.99), Deyga's Beautifying Serum 30 ml (£17.99) and Shiseido's Ultimune Power Infusing Concentrate (£35.99) complete the line-up."},{"p":"Looking for a natural face serum in the UK? Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery on orders over £50. Browse [Glow & even tone](#concern-glow) for matching cleansers and masks."}]},"k-moisturiser":{"h2":"Face moisturiser for dry, oily and normal skin","blocks":[{"p":"Your face moisturiser is the step that keeps skin comfortable all day. Our edit has eight day creams, gels and night creams, from £18.99, so you can match the texture to your skin."},{"h3":"Light textures","p":"Deyga's Light Moisturising Face Cream 30G (£18.99) is fast-absorbing and made for oily and normal skin, so it is a good moisturiser for oily skin that wants hydration without shine. Highborn London's Organic Hydration Gel (£54) is a cooling gel texture that layers easily."},{"h3":"Richer creams","p":"For a moisturiser for dry skin, Deyga's Deep Moisturising Face Cream 30G (£18.99) is made with plant-based oils and is free from parabens, phthalates and artificial fragrances. Vilvah's Ultra Moisturising Cream 50ml (£25.99) uses olive squalane and white lily essential oil. Highborn London's Imperial Moisturiser (£46) is a nourishing face cream made in England for tight-feeling skin. You will find more on our [moisturiser for dry skin](#k-moisturiser-for-dry-skin) page."},{"h3":"Day protection and night care","p":"Highborn London's GLOWGUARD SPF30 Anti-Ageing Moisturiser (£68) combines broad-spectrum protection with hydration, so it can replace a separate morning step. If you want a night cream, Highborn London's Night Elixir (£56) has a comforting cream texture for evenings. The MOISTUREBURST Hydrating Glow Ceramide Serum (£85) layers neatly under any cream."},{"p":"Prefer a natural moisturiser? The Deyga and Vilvah creams come from Indian natural brands, and Swansura is their official UK partner. Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery over £50. Finish your morning with [sunscreen and SPF](#k-sunscreen), or browse all [Skincare](#c-skincare)."}]},"k-sunscreen":{"h2":"Sunscreen and SPF for everyday wear","blocks":[{"p":"Daily sunscreen is the last step of your morning skincare and one of the most important. Our edit has four SPF products, from £9.99, from Vilvah, Deyga and Highborn London, including face sunscreens, an SPF moisturiser and an SPF lip balm."},{"h3":"Face sunscreen","p":"Vilvah's Skin Finish Sunscreen SPF 50 PA+++ (£17.99) is a sunscreen SPF 50 with a smooth, soft, natural finish that feels comfortable without heaviness. Deyga's Sunscreen 50ML (£16.99) is lightweight and non-greasy, formulated with zinc oxide and plant oils such as raspberry and carrot seed oil. It blends in without a white cast or sticky feel."},{"h3":"SPF in your moisturiser","p":"Highborn London's GLOWGUARD SPF30 Anti-Ageing Moisturiser (£68) combines broad-spectrum SPF 30 with hydration. It is a good option if you like a simple routine with one cream in the morning."},{"h3":"Lips need SPF too","p":"Lips are easy to forget in the sun. Vilvah's Milk Lip Balm SPF 30 PA+++ (£9.99) is an SPF lip balm with soy milk, soy butter, shea butter and kokum butter, plus broad-spectrum UVA and UVB protection. Keep one in your bag for walks, holidays and bright winter days."},{"p":"Apply sunscreen generously as the final step and reapply through the day when you are outdoors. If you prefer mineral and plant-based formulas, see our [natural sunscreen](#k-natural-sunscreen) page or the wider [Sun care](#concern-sun) edit. Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"k-face-mask":{"h2":"Face mask for a weekly skin reset","blocks":[{"p":"A face mask gives your skin ten quiet minutes of extra care once or twice a week. This edit holds eight masks and face packs, from £11.99, from Vilvah, Deyga and Swansura Selection: clay, charcoal, powder packs, a gold hydrating mask and an under-eye mask."},{"h3":"Clay and charcoal for oily skin","p":"Vilvah's Wild Rose Face Mask 100ml (£11.99) is a clay face mask with French pink clay, wild rose extract and an aloe vera base. Vilvah's Charcoal Face Mask 100ml (£12.99) adds tea tree hydrosol, while Deyga's Charcoal Detox Face Mask 100G (£15.99) is made for oily, combination and blemish-prone skin. These make a good face mask for oily skin. Find more ideas on our [face mask for oily skin](#k-face-mask-for-oily-skin) page."},{"h3":"Powder packs and milk mud","p":"Deyga's Spirulina Matcha Face Pack 150G (£17.99) is rich in antioxidants, and the Orange & Almond Face Pack Powder 100G (£19.99) uses orange peel for a brighter look. Mix with water or rose water to a smooth paste. Vilvah's Milk Mud Mask 50ml (£19.99) is suitable for all skin types and free from sulphates, silicones and artificial fragrances."},{"h3":"Hydration and eyes","p":"Swansura Selection's 24K Gold Hydrating Face Mask (£34.99) combines real 24K gold with hyaluronic acid, polyglutamic acid, ceramides and shea. Deyga's Under Eye Mask 15G (£15.99) uses almond oil, chamomile and olive oil for a refreshed look."},{"p":"Apply a mask after cleansing, rinse, then follow with [toner](#k-toner) and moisturiser. Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery on UK orders over £50. Browse the [Acne & oil control](#concern-acne) edit for more."}]},"k-toner":{"h2":"Toner and face mist to refresh and prep","blocks":[{"p":"A toner is the quick step between cleansing and serum. It refreshes skin, removes the last traces of cleanser and helps your next products spread evenly. We stock five toners and mists, from £11.99, from Deyga, Vilvah and Highborn London."},{"h3":"Rose water toner","p":"Deyga's Pure Rose Water Toner 100 ml (£11.99) is a 100% natural rose water formula, free from alcohol and harsh chemicals. It gives light hydration and is easy to mist through the day. Vilvah's Rosewater Facial Toner 100ml (£16.99) is 100% natural rose hydrosol. If you love rose, see the full [Rose range](#range-rose)."},{"h3":"Toner for oily skin","p":"Deyga's Tea Tree Facial Toner 100ML (£14.99) is the pick when your skin gets shiny by lunchtime, as it helps balance excess oil. Highborn London's Diamond Toner (100ml, £25) completes the cleansing process, removes excess oil and helps regulate the skin's pH while hydrating."},{"h3":"Milk toner","p":"Vilvah's Milk Face Toner 100ml (£19.99) is infused with rice milk and glycolic acid for a hydrated, brighter look, and Earth Marine Water for smoother-looking pores. It is a good option for normal and combination skin that looks a little dull."},{"p":"To apply, sweep over the face with a cotton pad or press in with your palms, then follow with a [face serum](#k-face-serum). Dry skin? Try our [toner for dry skin](#k-toner-for-dry-skin) edit. Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery over £50."}]},"k-lip-balm":{"h2":"Lip balm and lip care for soft, smooth lips","blocks":[{"p":"A lip balm is the small essential you reach for every day. Our lip care edit has 17 balms, scrubs, butters and kits, from £6.99, including Deyga's beetroot lip balm, Vilvah's fruit balms and a balm with SPF."},{"h3":"Beetroot lip balm from Deyga","p":"Deyga's Beetroot Lip Balm Classic 10 g (£10.99) is crafted with beetroot extract and natural butters for nourishment and a subtle, natural tint. It is free from parabens, artificial colours, petroleum jelly and synthetic fragrances. The Beetroot Lip Balm Stick 5.5 g (£26.99) adds almond, avocado and jojoba oils. Shop the full [Beetroot range](#range-beetroot)."},{"h3":"Tinted, natural and SPF","p":"The Vilvah Tinted Lip Balm Kit (£17.99) gives a natural hint of colour, so it is a nice tinted lip balm for everyday wear. For a natural lip balm, choose Deyga's Natural Lip Balm 8G (£9.99) or Vilvah's Natural Lemon Lip Balm and Grape Fruit Lip Balm (both £6.99). Vilvah's Milk Lip Balm SPF 30 PA+++ (£9.99) is an SPF lip balm with broad-spectrum protection."},{"h3":"Scrubs and kits","p":"Smooth lips first with a lip scrub: Deyga's Mint Lip Scrub 16G (£12.99), Strawberry Lip Scrub 16g (£10.99) or Vilvah's Natural Lip Scrub 10 g (£6.99). Kits combine both steps, such as Deyga's Soft Lip Combo (£17.99), Nourished Lip Care Kit (£25.99) and Nourished Lips Stick Kit (£27.99), and Vilvah's Lip Lightening Kit and Lip Nourishing Kit (£13.99 each). For a richer treat, Highborn London's Superior Lip Butter comes in 15ml and 50ml."},{"p":"Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, so every balm is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Orders over £50 travel free. If your lips feel chapped, see our [lip balm for dry lips](#k-lip-balm-for-dry-lips) guide."}]},"k-eye-cream":{"h2":"Under eye cream for a fresher look","blocks":[{"p":"The skin around your eyes is thinner than the rest of your face, so an under eye cream with a light texture makes sense. We stock four eye creams, gels and masks, from £14.99, from Deyga, Vilvah and Highborn London."},{"h3":"Creams for the eye contour","p":"Deyga's Under Eye Cream 15 g (£14.99) is formulated with organic aloe vera and cucumber for gentle hydration and a cooling feel, plus potato extract to soften the look of fine lines. Vilvah's Natural Under Eye Cream 20 ml (£19.99) uses bamboo extract and goji berry, with witch hazel and plant extracts. If you are shopping for an under eye cream for dark circles, it is made to brighten the look of the under-eye area."},{"h3":"Gel and mask","p":"Highborn London's Imperial Eye Gel (£59) gives the delicate skin around your eyes lightweight moisture with a cooling feel, and helps soften the look of fine lines with moisture. Deyga's Under Eye Mask 15G (£15.99) is made with almond oil, chamomile extract, olive oil and wheat germ for a refreshed appearance after a late night."},{"h3":"How to use it","p":"Take a rice-grain amount and tap it gently along the orbital bone with your ring finger, morning and night. Keep it away from the lash line. A cooling gel works well in the morning, while a richer cream suits the evening."},{"p":"Build the rest of your routine with a [face serum](#k-face-serum) and a [face moisturiser](#k-moisturiser). Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah."}]},"k-shampoo":{"h2":"Shampoo with rice water, goat milk and herbs","blocks":[{"p":"A shampoo that suits your scalp makes every hair day easier. Our edit has seven natural shampoos and a shampoo kit, from £12.99, all from the Indian natural brands Vilvah and Deyga. Swansura is their official UK partner, so every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Goat milk shampoo for softness","p":"Vilvah's Goat Milk Shampoo (£12.99) is made with goat milk rich in fatty acids, plus pea protein to help reduce frizz and flyaways. The newer Goat Milk Shampoo 250ML (£15.99) cleanses without stripping natural moisture and helps soften dry strands, so it is a good shampoo for dry hair. Explore the [Goat milk range](#range-goat-milk) for matching care."},{"h3":"Rice water shampoo for shine","p":"Deyga's Rice Water Shampoo (£13.99) is formulated with rice water extract to improve hair texture and manageability. It is lightweight enough for daily use on all hair types and adds shine and smoothness. See the [Rice water range](#range-rice-water)."},{"h3":"For a balanced scalp","p":"Vilvah's Herbal Shampoo 250ML (£15.99) and Herbal Shampoo for Dandruff Control (£12.99) use herbal ingredients such as neem, tea tree and rosemary. Deyga's Anti Dandruff Shampoo 220ml (£14.99) has a mild surfactant system for frequent use. Our [shampoo for dandruff](#k-shampoo-for-dandruff) page covers them in more detail."},{"p":"Want to tame frizz too? The Shampoo & Hair Serum Kit (£25.99) pairs a gentle shampoo with a lightweight serum. Follow any wash with a [conditioner](#k-conditioner), and remember UK orders over £50 ship free."}]},"k-conditioner":{"h2":"Conditioner for soft, easy-to-comb hair","blocks":[{"p":"A good conditioner detangles, softens and adds slip without weighing hair down. Our edit has three creamy conditioners from the Indian natural brands Vilvah and Deyga, from £12.99. Swansura is their official UK partner, so each bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Vilvah Cream Conditioner","p":"The Cream Conditioner (£12.99) is enriched with tucuma butter and broccoli oil to restore moisture and soften frizzy hair. It is silicone-free, so it leaves no heavy residue. The larger Cream Conditioner 250ML (£15.99) restores moisture and shine and helps improve manageability, leaving hair silky. Either makes a dependable conditioner for dry hair."},{"h3":"Deyga Soy Milk Conditioner","p":"Deyga's Soy Milk Conditioner (£14.99) is formulated with soy protein and botanical oils to bring softness back to dry, rough hair. Its lightweight texture is ideal for daily use and helps detangle and smooth strands."},{"h3":"How to use it","p":"After shampoo, squeeze out excess water and work conditioner through the lengths and ends. Leave it for two to three minutes, then rinse with cool water. Fine hair needs only a little; thick or curly hair can take more."},{"p":"If you want a natural conditioner in the UK as part of a full routine, pair it with a [natural shampoo](#k-natural-shampoo), and add a weekly [hair mask for dry hair](#k-hair-mask-for-dry-hair). Orders over £50 ship free across the UK. Browse all [Haircare](#c-haircare) for oils and serums."}]},"k-hair-oil":{"h2":"Hair oil for nourished, shiny hair","blocks":[{"p":"Hair oil is a long-standing part of Indian haircare, and it is an easy weekly ritual to bring home. Our edit has six oils, serums and kits from Vilvah and Deyga, from £9.99. Swansura is the official UK partner of both brands, so each bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Hair growth oil blends","p":"Vilvah's Hair Growth Oil (£9.99) is an alcohol-free blend of pumpkin seed, kalonji, castor and grapeseed oils. Deyga's Hair Growth Oil 100 ml (£14.99) blends coconut, amla, hibiscus, castor and fenugreek in a light, non-greasy formula for daily or pre-wash use. Read more on our [hair growth oil](#k-hair-growth-oil) page."},{"h3":"Hair oil for dandruff","p":"Vilvah's Anti-Dandruff Hair Oil 100ml (£19.99) combines tea tree, neem, peppermint and amla oils to nourish the scalp and help it feel calm. Pair it with a herbal wash from our [shampoo for dandruff](#k-shampoo-for-dandruff) edit."},{"h3":"Ayurvedic herbs and smoothing serums","p":"Deyga's Premature Greying Hair Oil 100ML (£18.99) is an ayurvedic hair oil with traditional herbs such as henna and bhringraj in coconut, castor and moringa oils. For frizz, Vilvah's Anti-Frizz Hair Serum 30ml (£28.99) uses curry leaf, black seed and hibiscus oils, and the Shampoo & Hair Serum Kit (£25.99) pairs a serum with a gentle shampoo."},{"p":"Warm a few drops between your palms, massage into the scalp and lengths, and leave for an hour or overnight before washing. Every natural hair oil here ships free across the UK on orders over £50. Browse all [Haircare](#c-haircare) for more."}]},"k-deodorant":{"h2":"Natural deodorant and fragranced deodorants","blocks":[{"p":"Our natural deodorant edit brings together six options, from £9.99. You will find Vilvah's aluminium-free Deo Shots alongside three men's deodorants inspired by well-known fragrances."},{"h3":"Vilvah Deo Shots","p":"Vilvah's solid Deo Shots melt with the warmth of your fingertips, so there is no spray and no mess. The Lavender & Sage Deo Shot 20g (£9.99) is free from alcohol, silicones and synthetic fragrances, and the Deo Shot Rose & Vanilla 20g (£9.99) is made with virgin coconut oil, shea butter and jojoba oil. If you want an aluminium free deodorant with a soft floral or herbal scent, these are the place to start. The Deo Shot Kit (£17.99) includes both scents."},{"h3":"Fragranced deodorants for men","p":"For a signature scent from head to toe, choose a deodorant that matches a fragrance. The Acqua di Parma Colonia Essenza Deodorant Stick 75ml (£32.99) carries a citrus aromatic scent. The Philipp Plein No Limits Deodorant Stick 75g (£16.99) leaves a warm, spicy and woody trail with leather, amber and vanilla. The Azzaro Pour Homme Deodorant Spray 150ml (£22.99) mixes aromatic herbs, citrus, spices and warm woods. See more of the line in [Acqua di Parma](#b-acqua-di-parma) and [Philipp Plein](#b-philipp-plein)."},{"p":"Apply your Deo Shot to clean, dry skin. Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and orders over £50 enjoy free UK delivery. Building a gift? Browse our [men's grooming](#k-mens-grooming) edit for more ideas."}]},"k-moisturiser-for-dry-skin":{"h2":"Moisturiser for dry skin that feels soft all day","blocks":[{"p":"A good moisturiser for dry skin is rich enough to keep you comfortable but light enough to wear every day. Our edit has 11 creams, gels, serums and aloe gels, from £9.99, made with milk proteins, plant oils, butters and aloe."},{"h3":"Creams for everyday comfort","p":"Deyga's Deep Moisturising Face Cream 30G (£18.99) uses plant-based oils and is free from parabens, phthalates and artificial fragrances. Vilvah's Ultra Moisturising Cream 50ml (£25.99) uses olive squalane to lock in moisture. Highborn London's Imperial Moisturiser (£46) is made in England for tight-feeling skin and works as the moisturising step in your daily routine."},{"h3":"Aloe vera gel for lighter days","p":"Vilvah's Aloe Vera Gel 100ml (£9.99) is made with cold-stabilised aloe vera juice and absorbs quickly without a greasy residue. Deyga's Pure Aloe Vera Gel 100 g (£22.99) is 100% natural aloe leaf extract, and can double as a hair mask. Try layering aloe under cream on very dry days."},{"h3":"Serums and night care","p":"Highborn London's MOISTUREBURST Hydrating Glow Ceramide Serum (£85) layers under moisturiser to plump the look of thirsty skin. Night Elixir (£56) is a comforting night cream for evenings, and the Bakuchiol Youth Elixir (£99) suits mature, sensitive skin. Prefer one cream in the morning? The GLOWGUARD SPF30 Anti-Ageing Moisturiser (£68) adds sun protection."},{"p":"Apply to slightly damp skin after a [toner for dry skin](#k-toner-for-dry-skin) to hold in more moisture. For a whole routine, see our [skincare for dry skin](#k-dry-skin) guide. Looking for a natural moisturiser in the UK? Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery over £50."}]},"k-hair-mask-for-dry-hair":{"h2":"Hair mask for dry hair, plus deep conditioners","blocks":[{"p":"A hair mask for dry hair gives your lengths a longer, richer dose of care than a daily conditioner. Our edit has four deep-conditioning picks from Vilvah and Deyga, from £12.99, for hair that feels dry, rough or brittle."},{"h3":"Vilvah Goat Milk Hair Mask","p":"The Goat Milk Hair Mask 200g (£31.99) is enriched with goat milk and ceramides to support the hair's barrier and help reduce breakage. Its formula is lightweight yet nourishing, so it smooths frizz and flyaways without weighing hair down. Use it once or twice a week as a hair treatment for dry hair."},{"h3":"Everyday deep conditioners","p":"Between masks, a rich conditioner keeps ends soft. Vilvah's Cream Conditioner (£12.99) is silicone-free and enriched with tucuma butter and broccoli oil. The Cream Conditioner 250ML (£15.99) restores moisture and shine. Deyga's Soy Milk Conditioner (£14.99) uses soy protein and botanical oils for dry, rough hair. Our [conditioner](#k-conditioner) page has more detail on each."},{"h3":"How to use a hair mask","p":"After shampoo, squeeze out excess water and smooth the mask from mid-lengths to ends. Comb it through, leave for ten to fifteen minutes, then rinse well. For extra softness, wrap your hair in a warm towel while it works."},{"p":"For the full routine, start with a gentle wash from our [goat milk range](#range-goat-milk) and finish with a few drops of [hair oil for dry hair](#k-hair-oil-for-dry-hair). Swansura is an official UK partner of Vilvah and Deyga, so every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Orders over £50 ship free."}]},"k-hair-oil-for-dry-hair":{"h2":"Hair oil for dry hair and frizzy ends","blocks":[{"p":"Hair oil for dry hair works best as a pre-wash treatment or a light finishing touch on the ends. Our edit has six oils, serums and kits from Vilvah and Deyga, from £9.99, with blends of coconut, castor, amla and hibiscus."},{"h3":"Rich pre-wash oils","p":"Deyga's Hair Growth Oil 100 ml (£14.99) blends coconut, amla, hibiscus, castor and fenugreek and absorbs easily into the scalp. It is a good hibiscus hair oil for a weekly overnight treatment. Vilvah's Hair Growth Oil (£9.99) is an alcohol-free blend with pumpkin seed, kalonji and castor oils, if you want to try castor oil for hair in a lighter mix. Deyga's Premature Greying Hair Oil 100ML (£18.99) adds coconut, castor and moringa oils with traditional herbs."},{"h3":"Lightweight serum for the ends","p":"Vilvah's Anti-Frizz Hair Serum 30ml (£28.99) is infused with curry leaf, black seed and hibiscus oils. A drop or two on dry ends adds smoothness and polish. Pair it with a gentle wash in the Shampoo & Hair Serum Kit (£25.99). Browse more on our [hair serum for frizzy hair](#k-hair-serum-for-frizzy-hair) page."},{"h3":"For a dry, flaky scalp","p":"Vilvah's Anti-Dandruff Hair Oil 100ml (£19.99) brings tea tree, neem, peppermint and amla oils to nourish the scalp and help it feel balanced."},{"p":"Massage oil into the scalp and lengths, leave for an hour or overnight, then shampoo twice. For more moisture, follow with a [hair mask for dry hair](#k-hair-mask-for-dry-hair). Shopping for a natural hair oil in the UK? Swansura is an official UK partner of Vilvah and Deyga, so every bottle is 100% authentic, and orders over £50 ship free."}]},"k-face-wash-for-dry-skin":{"h2":"Face wash for dry skin that never feels tight","blocks":[{"p":"A face wash for dry skin should cleanse gently and leave your skin soft, not squeaky. Our edit has six creamy, milky and balm cleansers, from £9.99, with milk, oat and plant oils."},{"h3":"Milk and oat cleansers","p":"Deyga's Oat Milk Face Wash 100 ml (£12.99) uses oat milk to lift away dirt and oil without stripping your skin's natural moisture, and it is made to soothe and calm. Vilvah's Milk Powder Face Wash 50g (£13.99) is a milk face wash in a water-free powder, with hyaluronic acid and a skin-friendly pH of 6 to 7. It is fragrance-free and talc-free, and you activate it with water in your palm."},{"h3":"For dry, sensitive skin","p":"Vilvah's Fragrance-Free Cream Face Wash 100ml (£9.99) uses mild plant-based cleansers with banana fruit extract for hydration. It is a natural face wash that suits skin that reacts easily to scented products."},{"h3":"Balm and foam options","p":"Deyga's Tangerine Cleansing Balm for Makeup Removal 30g (£15.99) melts away make-up, sunscreen and dirt with tangerine butter, coconut oil, almond oil and vitamin E. Use it first in the evening, then follow with a cream wash. Highborn London's Crystal Cleanser (100ml, £24) cleanses and moisturises with Co-Enzyme Q10, and Deyga's Vitamin C Foaming Face Wash 100ML (£15.99) cleanses without over-drying."},{"p":"Rinse with lukewarm water, pat dry and apply your [moisturiser for dry skin](#k-moisturiser-for-dry-skin) straight away. Our [skincare for dry skin](#k-dry-skin) guide has more steps. Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"k-face-wash-for-oily-skin":{"h2":"Face wash for oily skin and a fresh, clear feel","blocks":[{"p":"A good face wash for oily skin clears away excess oil and the day's grime while keeping skin comfortable. Our edit has five clarifying cleansers, from £12.99, from Deyga, Vilvah and Highborn London."},{"h3":"Charcoal face wash","p":"Deyga's Charcoal Face Wash 100ml (£25.99) uses activated charcoal to deeply cleanse and draw out impurities and excess oil. It is suitable for all skin types and gentle enough for daily use, so it makes a dependable morning and evening wash when your T-zone gets shiny. See the whole [charcoal range](#range-charcoal) for matching masks and bars."},{"h3":"Honey and milk powder","p":"Vilvah's Honey Face Wash 100ml (£12.99) contains 10% raw honey plus papaya, blackberry and orange peel extracts to gently exfoliate and brighten, with witch hazel and gotu kola. It is pH-balanced. The Milk Powder Face Wash 50g (£13.99) is a water-free powder with hyaluronic acid, so it keeps oily skin hydrated rather than stripped."},{"h3":"Balm and luxury picks","p":"Even oily skin benefits from a double cleanse at night. Deyga's Tangerine Cleansing Balm for Makeup Removal 30g (£15.99) dissolves waterproof make-up and sunscreen in one step. Highborn London's Crystal Cleanser (100ml, £24) cleanses and moisturises with Co-Enzyme Q10."},{"p":"Cleanse twice a day, avoid very hot water, and follow with a light gel or cream. A weekly clay mask from our [face mask for oily skin](#k-face-mask-for-oily-skin) page helps too. For more ideas see [skincare for oily and acne-prone skin](#k-oily-skin). Every natural face wash here is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery over £50."}]},"k-shampoo-for-dandruff":{"h2":"Shampoo for dandruff with neem, tea tree and herbs","blocks":[{"p":"A shampoo for dandruff should cleanse the scalp thoroughly while keeping it calm and comfortable. Our edit has six natural options from Vilvah and Deyga, from £12.99, made with herbal ingredients for a flake-free-looking scalp."},{"h3":"Herbal formulas","p":"Vilvah's Herbal Shampoo for Dandruff Control (£12.99) is crafted with neem, tea tree, rosemary and black pepper to help with visible flakes and soothe an itchy-feeling scalp. It is safe for daily use on all hair types, including colour-treated hair. The newer Herbal Shampoo 250ML (£15.99) is made to keep the scalp balanced and remove excess oil. Deyga's Anti Dandruff Shampoo 220ml (£14.99) uses botanical extracts with a mild surfactant system for daily or frequent use."},{"h3":"When your scalp is dry too","p":"Flakes can come with dry lengths. A goat milk shampoo such as Vilvah's Goat Milk Shampoo (£12.99) or Goat Milk Shampoo 250ML (£15.99) cleanses without stripping natural moisture. You can alternate it with a herbal wash. The Shampoo & Hair Serum Kit (£25.99) adds a lightweight serum for smoother ends."},{"h3":"Add a scalp oil","p":"For a fuller routine, Vilvah's Anti-Dandruff Hair Oil 100ml is a hair oil for dandruff made with tea tree, neem, peppermint and amla. Massage it in an hour before washing. Find it on our [hair oil](#k-hair-oil) page, or browse the [Dandruff](#concern-dandruff) edit."},{"p":"Massage shampoo into the scalp with your fingertips, leave for a minute and rinse well. Looking for a natural shampoo in the UK? Swansura is an official UK partner of Vilvah and Deyga, so every bottle is 100% authentic, ships from the UK, and orders over £50 go free. More herbal care sits in the [Neem & tea tree range](#range-neem)."}]},"k-body-lotion-for-dry-skin":{"h2":"Body lotion for dry skin, plus rich butters","blocks":[{"p":"When your skin feels tight after a shower, a body lotion for dry skin brings quick comfort. Our edit has five lotions and butters, from £14.99, made with milk, shea, cocoa and plant oils."},{"h3":"Lotions for daily use","p":"Vilvah's Milk Body Lotion 250ml (£25.99) is infused with oat milk, ceramides and olive squalane to moisturise and support the skin barrier. It is vegan and gentle enough for all ages. Deyga's Almond Milk Body Lotion 100 ml (£14.99) is a lightweight, fast-absorbing lotion with almond milk and natural oils that leaves no greasy feel. Use either morning and night as your everyday body care for dry skin."},{"h3":"Butters for very dry areas","p":"For elbows, knees and shins, a body butter for dry skin gives longer-lasting comfort. Deyga's Chocolate Body Butter 100G (£15.99) is formulated with cocoa and nourishing oils for deep hydration. The Rose & Geranium Body Butter 40G (£15.99) uses a rich blend of natural butters and oils for softness. Highborn London's Natural Luminosity Body Butter (£50) has a butter-soft formula for dull, dehydrated skin. See them all on our [body butter](#k-body-butter) page."},{"h3":"Simple tips","p":"Apply lotion within a few minutes of drying off, while your skin is still slightly damp. Keep showers warm rather than hot, and exfoliate once a week with a [body scrub](#k-body-scrub) so moisture sinks in."},{"p":"Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, so every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Orders over £50 travel free. Browse [Deep hydration](#concern-hydration) for more."}]},"k-hair-serum-for-frizzy-hair":{"h2":"Hair serum for frizzy hair and smoother routines","blocks":[{"p":"A hair serum for frizzy hair smooths flyaways and adds shine without making hair greasy. Our edit has 13 serums, kits, shampoos and conditioners from Vilvah and Deyga, from £11.99, so you can build a full smoothing routine."},{"h3":"Vilvah Anti-Frizz Hair Serum","p":"The Anti-Frizz Hair Serum 30ml (£28.99) is infused with curry leaf oil to smooth unruly hair, plus black seed and hibiscus oils to nourish. Use one or two drops on damp or dry lengths, focusing on the ends. It is a lightweight natural hair serum, ideal for UK humidity."},{"h3":"Kits for the whole routine","p":"If you like a ready-made routine, a kit is good value and makes a thoughtful hair care gift set. Vilvah's Shampoo & Hair Serum Kit (£25.99) pairs gentle cleansing with the serum. The Frizz Free Hair Kit (£35.99) and Goat Milk Hair Kit (£34.99) are made for dry, frizzy hair, and the Bestseller Hair Kit (£27.99) is sulphate-free with tucuma butter and broccoli oil. Deyga's Hair Care Kit (£18.99) uses rice water and soy milk conditioner, and the Daily Use Healthy Hair Kit (£11.99) is a simple shampoo and conditioner combo."},{"h3":"Wash and condition","p":"Frizz often starts with dryness, so choose a shampoo for dry hair. Vilvah's Goat Milk Shampoo (£12.99 or £15.99 for 250ML) helps soften dry strands, and the Cream Conditioner (£12.99 or £15.99 for 250ML) restores moisture and shine. Once a week, add the Goat Milk Hair Mask 200g (£31.99)."},{"p":"Explore our [hair mask for dry hair](#k-hair-mask-for-dry-hair) and [hair oil for dry hair](#k-hair-oil-for-dry-hair) pages for more. Swansura is an official UK partner of Vilvah and Deyga, so every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Orders over £50 ship free."}]},"k-lip-balm-for-dry-lips":{"h2":"Lip balm for dry lips and chapped days","blocks":[{"p":"A lip balm for dry lips with rich butters and oils brings back comfort fast when cold winds, central heating and long days outdoors leave lips rough. Our edit has 13 balms, scrubs, butters and kits, from £6.99."},{"h3":"Rich, nourishing balms","p":"Deyga's Natural Lip Balm 8G (£9.99) has a rich, creamy texture that melts on contact to lock in moisture. Vilvah's Natural Lemon Lip Balm 10g (£6.99) uses unrefined shea butter and avocado oil to seal in hydration, and the Grape Fruit Lip Balm 10g is also £6.99. For a deeply cushioning feel, Highborn London's Superior Lip Butter comes in 15ml (£22.50) and Large 50ml (£29)."},{"h3":"A touch of colour","p":"Deyga's beetroot lip balm gives a natural rosy tint. Choose the Beetroot Lip Balm Classic 10 g (£10.99) or the Beetroot Lip Balm Stick 5.5 g (£26.99) with almond, avocado and jojoba oils. The Vilvah Tinted Lip Balm Kit (£17.99) adds a natural hint of colour. Vilvah's Milk Lip Balm SPF 30 PA+++ (£9.99) brings soy, shea and kokum butters with sun protection."},{"h3":"Scrub, then balm","p":"Flaky lips take balm better after a gentle polish. Deyga's Mint Lip Scrub 16G (£12.99) and Strawberry Lip Scrub 16g (£10.99), and Vilvah's Natural Lip Scrub 10 g (£6.99), use sugar with nourishing oils. Deyga's Nourished Lip Care Kit (£25.99) pairs scrub and balm. Read more on our [lip scrub](#k-lip-scrub) page."},{"p":"Apply balm before bed and before going out. Looking for a natural lip balm in the UK? Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, so every balm is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery on orders over £50. Explore the [Lip care](#concern-lips) edit too."}]},"k-toner-for-dry-skin":{"h2":"Toner for dry skin: alcohol-free and hydrating","blocks":[{"p":"A toner for dry skin should add a layer of hydration, not take it away. That means alcohol-free formulas, rose waters and milky toners that prep skin for serum and moisturiser. Our edit has five options, from £11.99."},{"h3":"Rose water toners","p":"Deyga's Pure Rose Water Toner 100 ml (£11.99) is a 100% natural rose water toner, free from alcohol and harsh chemicals. It gives light hydration, helps maintain your skin's natural pH and leaves skin feeling refreshed. Vilvah's Rosewater Facial Toner 100ml (£16.99) is pure rose hydrosol that restores moisture and gives a cooling feel. More rose care sits in the [Rose range](#range-rose)."},{"h3":"Milky and moisturising","p":"Vilvah's Milk Face Toner 100ml (£19.99) is infused with rice milk for hydration and a brighter look. Highborn London's Diamond Toner (100ml, £25) is a moisturising toner that completes cleansing and soothes and hydrates your skin."},{"h3":"If you have combination skin","p":"Deyga's Tea Tree Facial Toner 100ML (£14.99) helps balance excess oil, so it suits an oily T-zone. Use it only where you need it and a rose water on drier cheeks."},{"p":"Press toner in with your palms rather than rubbing, then apply serum while skin is still damp and seal with a [moisturiser for dry skin](#k-moisturiser-for-dry-skin). This simple layering is the heart of good skincare for dry skin; see our [dry skin guide](#k-dry-skin) for the full routine. Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free UK delivery over £50."}]},"k-natural-sunscreen":{"h2":"Natural sunscreen from plant-powered skincare brands","blocks":[{"p":"A natural sunscreen gives you daily protection with a formula built around mineral filters and plant oils. Our edit has four SPF products from Deyga, Vilvah and Highborn London, from £9.99, light enough to wear under make-up."},{"h3":"Deyga Sunscreen 50ML","p":"Deyga's Sunscreen 50ML (£16.99) is formulated with zinc oxide and antioxidant-rich plant oils such as raspberry seed and carrot seed oil. It has a smooth, breathable texture that blends easily without a white cast or sticky feel, so it works well for everyday wear in the UK."},{"h3":"Vilvah Skin Finish Sunscreen","p":"Vilvah's Skin Finish Sunscreen SPF 50 PA+++ (£17.99) is a lightweight, smooth sunscreen SPF 50 with a soft, natural finish. It feels comfortable on the skin without heaviness, which makes it easy to wear every morning. Vilvah's Milk Lip Balm SPF 30 PA+++ (£9.99) is an SPF lip balm with mineral-based filters and soy milk, soy butter, shea butter and kokum butter."},{"h3":"One-step moisturiser with SPF","p":"Highborn London's GLOWGUARD SPF30 Anti-Ageing Moisturiser (£68) combines broad-spectrum SPF 30 with hydration, a useful pick if you want fewer steps."},{"p":"Apply a generous layer as the last step of your morning routine and top up when you are outdoors. Compare all options on our [sunscreen and SPF](#k-sunscreen) page or browse [Sun care](#concern-sun). Shopping for natural sunscreen in the UK? Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, so every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery on orders over £50."}]},"k-natural-shampoo":{"h2":"Natural shampoo from Vilvah and Deyga","blocks":[{"p":"A natural shampoo cleanses with gentle, plant-based ingredients and leaves your hair soft rather than squeaky. Our edit has seven shampoos and kits from the Indian natural brands Vilvah and Deyga, from £12.99, made with rice water, goat milk and herbs and free from harsh sulphates and parabens."},{"h3":"Gentle formulas for every hair type","p":"Deyga's Rice Water Shampoo (£13.99) provides a gentle, natural cleanse without harsh chemicals and adds shine and smoothness. Vilvah's Goat Milk Shampoo (£12.99) uses goat milk and pea protein to soften hair and reduce frizz, and the Goat Milk Shampoo 250ML (£15.99) cleanses without stripping natural moisture. If you are after a paraben free shampoo or a sulphate free shampoo in the UK, these Indian-made formulas are a good place to start."},{"h3":"Herbal care for the scalp","p":"Vilvah's Herbal Shampoo 250ML (£15.99) and Herbal Shampoo for Dandruff Control (£12.99) bring neem, tea tree, rosemary and black pepper for a balanced-feeling scalp. Deyga's Anti Dandruff Shampoo 220ml (£14.99) uses botanical extracts. See our [shampoo for dandruff](#k-shampoo-for-dandruff) page for more."},{"h3":"Shampoo and serum together","p":"The Vilvah Shampoo & Hair Serum Kit (£25.99) pairs gentle cleansing with a lightweight serum to help with frizz and dullness. It is a neat starter set if you are new to the brand."},{"p":"Swansura is an official UK partner of Vilvah and Deyga, so every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery on orders over £50. Browse the [Vilvah](#b-vilvah) and [Deyga](#b-deyga) brand pages, or add a matching [conditioner](#k-conditioner)."}]},"k-body-butter-for-dry-skin":{"h2":"Body butter for dry skin","blocks":[{"p":"A good body butter for dry skin gives rough, tight areas a thick layer of comfort that a light lotion often can't. This edit brings together four rich formulas from Deyga and Highborn London, made with natural butters and nourishing oils, from £12.99."},{"h3":"Rich butters to choose from","p":"Deyga's Chocolate Body Butter is a favourite for anyone who loves a sweet, cosy scent. It is made with cocoa and nourishing oils to keep skin feeling moisturised through the day, so it suits you if you like the idea of a cocoa butter body lotion but want something richer. The Rose & Geranium Body Butter blends natural butters and oils for long-lasting softness, with a gentle floral note. Both cost £15.99. For a more luxurious choice, Highborn London's Natural Luminosity Body Butter (£50) has a butter-soft texture that seals in moisture and leaves dull, dry skin with a radiant glow."},{"h3":"Don't forget your feet","p":"Heels and soles are often the driest skin of all. Deyga's Foot Butter (£12.99) combines virgin coconut oil, olive oil, beeswax, vitamin E and vanilla essential oil to condition and smooth the look of rough feet. Its non-greasy texture sinks in without a heavy residue."},{"p":"For simple body care for dry skin, apply your body butter straight after a bath or shower while skin is still slightly damp, then massage it in until absorbed. Pair it with a gentle [body scrub](#k-body-scrub) once or twice a week, or switch to a lighter [body lotion for dry skin](#k-body-lotion-for-dry-skin) on warmer days. You can also browse every [body butter](#k-body-butter) we stock, or the wider [deep hydration edit](#concern-hydration)."},{"p":"Looking for a natural body butter in the UK? Every product here is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga. Delivery is free on orders over £50."}]},"k-hair-growth-oil":{"h2":"Hair growth oil with traditional Indian ingredients","blocks":[{"p":"A hair growth oil is a simple way to give your scalp and lengths a regular dose of nourishment. These four blends from Deyga and Vilvah draw on the Indian tradition of oiling hair before washing, with plant oils and herbs, from £9.99."},{"h3":"The oils in this edit","p":"Vilvah's Hair Growth Oil (£9.99) is a natural, alcohol-free blend of pumpkin seed, kalonji, castor and grapeseed oils. Castor oil for hair is a long-standing favourite because its thick texture coats the strands and helps them feel stronger. Deyga's 100 ml blend (£14.99) mixes coconut, amla, hibiscus, castor and fenugreek in a light, non-greasy formula you can use daily or before washing. If you have been searching for an amla hair oil or a hibiscus hair oil, this one covers both."},{"h3":"For scalp and colour care","p":"Deyga's Premature Greying Hair Oil (£18.99) is an ayurvedic hair oil made with henna and bhringraj, along with coconut, castor and moringa oils to nourish hair and scalp. It is a good pick if bhringraj oil is already part of your routine. Vilvah's Anti-Dandruff Hair Oil (£19.99) blends tea tree, neem, peppermint and amla to soothe an itchy, flaky-feeling scalp."},{"p":"To use, warm a few drops between your palms, massage into the scalp with your fingertips and work the rest through your lengths. Leave it for at least an hour, or overnight, then wash out with a mild [natural shampoo](#k-natural-shampoo). Results vary from person to person, so think of oiling as steady care rather than a quick fix. You can also browse our full [hair oil](#k-hair-oil) range or the [hair fall](#concern-hairfall) edit."},{"p":"Every bottle is 100% authentic and sent from the UK. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, making this an easy place to find natural hair oil in the UK, with free delivery when you spend over £50."}]},"k-face-mask-for-oily-skin":{"h2":"Face mask for oily skin","blocks":[{"p":"A face mask for oily skin is the quickest way to give your pores a proper clean once or twice a week. This edit gathers five clay, charcoal and mud masks from Deyga and Vilvah that absorb excess oil and leave skin feeling fresh, from £11.99."},{"h3":"Charcoal and green masks","p":"Activated charcoal is popular with oily and combination skin because it draws dirt and impurities out of the pores. Deyga's Charcoal Detox Face Mask (£15.99) helps control excess oil for a clear, refreshed look. Vilvah's Charcoal Face Mask (£12.99) pairs charcoal with aloe vera and tea tree hydrosol for a brighter-looking, more even tone. For something green, Deyga's Spirulina Matcha Face Pack (£17.99) is rich in antioxidants and helps keep shine and clogged pores in check."},{"h3":"Clay and mud masks","p":"If you prefer a clay face mask, Vilvah's Wild Rose Face Mask (£11.99) combines French pink clay with wild rose extract and rose hydrosol. It gently exfoliates and purifies without over-drying, on a soothing aloe vera base. Vilvah's Milk Mud Mask (£19.99) brightens dull skin, helps control oil and unclogs pores. It is free from sulfates, silicones and artificial fragrance and suits all skin types, including sensitive skin."},{"p":"Apply a thin, even layer to clean skin, avoiding the eyes and lips, and rinse with lukewarm water before the mask dries completely. Follow with a light [moisturiser](#k-moisturiser) so skin stays balanced. To build a full routine of skincare for oily skin, add a [face wash for oily skin](#k-face-wash-for-oily-skin) and explore our [acne and oil control](#concern-acne) edit, or browse every face mask we stock on the [face mask](#k-face-mask) page."},{"p":"All products are 100% authentic and dispatched from within the UK. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, and delivery is free on orders over £50."}]},"k-lip-scrub":{"h2":"Lip scrub for soft, smooth lips","blocks":[{"p":"A lip scrub is the simplest way to lift dry, flaky skin so your lips feel smooth again. We stock three natural sugar-based exfoliators from Deyga and Vilvah, from £6.99, each small enough to keep in a bag or bedside drawer."},{"h3":"Three scrubs to choose from","p":"Deyga's mint scrub (16 g, £12.99) is a gentle exfoliator that buffs away dead skin and leaves lips feeling cool and fresh. The strawberry version from Deyga (16 g, £10.99) uses granulated sugar to polish away rough patches, with a fruity scent that makes the routine feel like a small pleasure. Vilvah's Natural Lip Scrub (10 g, £6.99) is the lightest of the three, with lemon essential oil to brighten the look of your lip tone."},{"h3":"How to use it","p":"Use a small amount on clean, dry lips. Massage in slow circles for 30 seconds, then wipe away with a damp cloth or rinse off. Two or three times a week is plenty for most people, and a little more often in cold weather when lips tend to feel tight. Go gently if your lips are chapped or cracked."},{"p":"Always follow your scrub with a nourishing balm to seal in moisture. A natural lip balm such as Deyga's beetroot lip balm adds a soft flush of colour, while an SPF lip balm is a good daytime choice. You'll find them all in our [lip balm for dry lips](#k-lip-balm-for-dry-lips) edit and the wider [lip care](#concern-lips) collection. Small scrubs also make easy [stocking fillers](#k-stocking-fillers)."},{"p":"Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah. Every product is 100% authentic, posted from the UK, and delivery is free when you spend over £50."}]},"k-shampoo-for-hair-loss":{"h2":"Gentle shampoo for hair loss and breakage","blocks":[{"p":"If you're looking for a shampoo for hair loss, it helps to start with a cleanser that is kind to your scalp and lengths. These three gentle formulas from Vilvah and Deyga use rice water, goat milk and herbal extracts for hair that feels weak, dry or prone to breakage, from £12.99."},{"h3":"The shampoos","p":"Deyga's Rice Water Shampoo (£13.99) is made with rice water extract to improve the texture and manageability of your hair, with a gentle, natural clean. Vilvah's Goat Milk Shampoo (£12.99) is rich in fatty acids and moisturises the hair shaft and scalp, so it suits dry, brittle hair that snaps easily. For a flaky or itchy scalp, Vilvah's Herbal Shampoo for Dandruff Control (£12.99) blends neem, tea tree, rosemary and black pepper."},{"h3":"Getting the most from your wash","p":"Shedding has many causes, and no shampoo can change what happens at the root. What a mild cleanser can do is keep your scalp clean and comfortable and leave strands softer, which means less breakage when you brush and style. Wash with lukewarm water, massage the scalp with your fingertips rather than your nails, and squeeze hair dry instead of rubbing it with a towel."},{"p":"Many people pair their wash with a weekly oiling routine. Our [hair growth oil](#k-hair-growth-oil) page has blends with castor, amla and pumpkin seed oils, and the [hair fall](#concern-hairfall) collection brings together oils, combs and kits. You can also browse every [natural shampoo](#k-natural-shampoo) we stock."},{"p":"Looking for a natural shampoo in the UK? Swansura is an official UK partner of Vilvah and Deyga, every bottle is 100% authentic, and orders ship from within the UK with free delivery over £50."}]},"k-dry-skin":{"h2":"Skincare for dry skin","blocks":[{"p":"The right skincare for dry skin cleanses without stripping, adds water back in and then seals it with a richer cream. This page brings together more than 120 hydrating cleansers, serums, creams and body care from Deyga, Vilvah, Highborn London and anatomē, so you can build a routine for tight, dehydrated skin."},{"h3":"Cleanse and tone gently","p":"Start with a cleanser that leaves skin soft. anatomē's Botanical Balm (£39) melts away makeup and pollution, and Deyga's Tangerine Cleansing Balm for Makeup Removal (£15.99) dissolves sunscreen and waterproof makeup. Highborn London's Crystal Cleanser (£24) is a gentle cream wash. Follow with a toner for dry skin such as the moisturising Diamond Toner (£25)."},{"h3":"Serums and creams","p":"Deyga's 2% Hyaluronic Acid Serum (£22.99) attracts and holds moisture, which makes it an easy first step before cream. For your moisturiser for dry skin, Deyga's Deep Moisturising Face Cream (£18.99) gives long-lasting comfort to flaky areas, and Highborn London's Imperial Moisturiser (£46) is a rich face cream for skin that feels tight. In the evening, Highborn's Night Elixir (£56) is a comforting night cream that leaves skin soft and supple by morning."},{"p":"Dry skin rarely stops at the face. Deyga's Spinach & Cucumber Bath Bar (£14.99) hydrates in the shower, and our [body butter for dry skin](#k-body-butter-for-dry-skin) edit has rich cocoa and rose butters. For more ideas, browse the full [moisturiser for dry skin](#k-moisturiser-for-dry-skin) page or the [deep hydration](#concern-hydration) collection."},{"p":"Everything here is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, and delivery is free on orders over £50."}]},"k-oily-skin":{"h2":"Skincare for oily skin and acne-prone skin","blocks":[{"p":"Good skincare for oily skin keeps shine in check without leaving your face tight or dry. This edit gathers 42 charcoal, neem and tea tree products from Deyga, Vilvah and Swansura Selection for oily, combination and acne-prone skin, from £9.99."},{"h3":"Cleanse","p":"Activated charcoal draws dirt and excess oil out of the pores. Deyga's Charcoal Face Wash (£25.99) is a deep-cleansing charcoal face wash for daily use, and Vilvah's Honey Face Wash (£12.99) uses 10% raw honey with papaya, blackberry and orange peel extracts to cleanse gently. On the body, Deyga's Charcoal Bath Bar (£10.99) is a simple charcoal soap that lifts away dirt and surface oil, and the Charcoal Goatmilk Soap Bar (£9.99) pairs charcoal with nourishing goat milk."},{"h3":"Tone, mask and moisturise","p":"Deyga's Tea Tree Facial Toner (£14.99) is a refreshing toner for oily skin that keeps your face feeling clean between washes. Once or twice a week, a charcoal mask such as Vilvah's Charcoal Face Mask (£12.99) gives pores a deeper clean. Oily skin still needs moisture, so finish with a light layer: Deyga's Light Moisturising Face Cream (£18.99) is a fast-absorbing moisturiser for oily skin, and Vilvah's Aloe Vera Gel (£9.99) feels cool and weightless."},{"p":"Prefer a ready-made routine? Vilvah's Oil Control Kit (£32.99) is designed for oily and combination skin. You can also explore our [face wash for oily skin](#k-face-wash-for-oily-skin) and [face mask for oily skin](#k-face-mask-for-oily-skin) pages, or the [Neem & tea tree range](#range-neem)."},{"p":"All products are 100% authentic and sent from the UK. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, with free UK delivery on orders over £50."}]},"k-sensitive-skin":{"h2":"Skincare for sensitive skin","blocks":[{"p":"When your skin reacts easily, skincare for sensitive skin should be simple, mild and soothing. This small edit of 14 gentle, fragrance-free and calming formulas from Vilvah, Deyga and Swansura Selection starts at £9.99."},{"h3":"Gentle cleansers","p":"A face wash for sensitive skin should clean without stripping. Vilvah's Fragrance-Free Cream Face Wash (£9.99) uses mild plant-based cleansers, and Deyga's Oat Milk Face Wash (£12.99) lifts away dirt and oil while keeping skin's natural moisture. In the shower, the Classic Goatmilk Soap Bar (£9.99) is a soft goat milk soap that hydrates and calms, and Vilvah's Goat Milk Body Wash (£15.99) adds virgin coconut oil for extra comfort."},{"h3":"Soothing moisture","p":"Aloe vera gel is a light, cooling layer for skin that feels hot or irritated. Vilvah's Aloe Vera Gel (£9.99) is made with cold-stabilised aloe juice, and Deyga's Pure Aloe Vera Gel (£22.99) contains aloe leaf extract with no synthetic colours or fragrances. Apply after cleansing, or on its own as a light moisturiser."},{"h3":"Ready-made kits","p":"If you'd rather not choose step by step, Deyga's Sensitive Skin Kit (£16.99) pairs the oat milk wash with gentle care, and Vilvah's Sensitive Skin Kit (£29.99) includes a steam-distilled Rose Toner and Aloe Vera Gel. A sensitive scalp can benefit too: Vilvah's Goat Milk Shampoo (£12.99) cleanses without stripping."},{"p":"Always patch test a new product on your inner arm first. For more calming picks, see our [calm](#concern-calm) collection, the [Goat milk range](#range-goat-milk) and our [face wash and cleanser](#k-face-wash) page. Swansura is an official UK partner of Vilvah and Deyga, every product is 100% authentic and shipped from the UK, and delivery is free over £50."}]},"k-dull-skin":{"h2":"Skincare for dull skin","blocks":[{"p":"Skincare for dull skin is all about clearing away build-up and adding back moisture, so light reflects off a smoother surface. This edit gathers 65 brightening cleansers, masks, serums and kits from Deyga, Vilvah, Highborn London and anatomē for tired, uneven or tanned-looking skin."},{"h3":"Cleanse and exfoliate","p":"A vitamin C face wash is an easy daily step. Deyga's Vitamin C Foaming Face Wash (£15.99) removes dirt and oil with a micro-foam that keeps skin soft. For the body, Deyga's Body Scrub (£16.99) uses fruit-derived exfoliants to buff away dead skin, and the Shea Saffron Bath Bar (£15.99) is made with saffron and shea butter for a natural glow. Once or twice a week, mix up Deyga's Orange & Almond Face Pack Powder (£19.99), a natural face pack with orange peel and vitamin C."},{"h3":"Serums and moisture","p":"Deyga's Rose Glow Serum (£17.99) is a light face serum for glowing skin that hydrates and nourishes. For a more luxurious option, Highborn London's Pre-Eminent Beauty Serum (£66) combines hyaluronic acid and vitamin C. Finish with a cream that suits your skin, because dehydrated skin often looks flat and grey."},{"h3":"Kits for radiance","p":"Vilvah's AM Brightening Kit (£39.99) is a fresh, lightweight morning routine for dull-looking skin, and Deyga's glow kit (£19.99) pairs a rose and mulethi face pack with rose toner."},{"p":"Explore more in our [glow and even tone](#concern-glow) collection, the [Vitamin C range](#range-vitamin-c) and our [vitamin C serum](#k-vitamin-c-serum) page. Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, and orders over £50 travel free."}]},"k-hair-fall":{"h2":"Hair fall care with natural oils and shampoos","blocks":[{"p":"Hair fall can be worrying, and a steady, gentle routine is the kindest place to start. This edit of 12 oils, shampoos, combs and kits from Vilvah and Deyga, from £9.99, focuses on nourishing the scalp and keeping lengths strong so they break less."},{"h3":"Oils for the scalp","p":"Regular oiling is a long-standing Indian hair ritual. Vilvah's Hair Growth Oil (£9.99) blends pumpkin seed, kalonji, castor and grapeseed oils, and Deyga's 100 ml blend (£14.99) mixes coconut, amla, hibiscus, castor and fenugreek. If you are searching for a hair oil for hair loss with an itchy scalp too, Vilvah's Anti-Dandruff Hair Oil (£19.99) adds tea tree, neem and peppermint. Deyga's Neem Seed Oil (£14.99) is a pure cold-pressed natural hair oil you can mix into your usual blend."},{"h3":"Kits that pair oil and shampoo","p":"A hair care gift set saves you choosing each step. Vilvah's Hairfall Control Kit (£34.99) pairs the oil with the Herbal Shampoo, and the Hair Strengthening Kit (£34.99) pairs it with Goat Milk Shampoo. Deyga's Hair Nourishment Kit (£25.99) combines Aloe Vera Gel with oil, and the Hair Care Kit (£18.99) brings rice water shampoo and soy milk conditioner together."},{"p":"How you handle wet hair matters too. A wide-tooth neem wood comb, such as Vilvah's Neem Wood Comb (Fine & Wide Tooth) at £9.99, glides through without snagging. Results from any routine vary, and if you notice sudden or patchy shedding it is worth speaking to your GP."},{"p":"For more, see our [shampoo for hair loss](#k-shampoo-for-hair-loss) page and the full [hair oil](#k-hair-oil) collection. Swansura is an official UK partner of Vilvah and Deyga. Everything is 100% authentic, ships from the UK and travels free on orders over £50."}]},"k-natural-skincare":{"h2":"Natural skincare from Deyga and Vilvah","blocks":[{"p":"Natural skincare from India has a long tradition of using plants, clays and oils, and that is the heart of this edit. Here you'll find around 145 plant-based cleansers, serums, masks, bath bars and kits from Deyga and Vilvah, two Indian brands for which Swansura is an official UK partner."},{"h3":"Everyday essentials","p":"For a natural face wash, Deyga's Vitamin C Foaming Face Wash (£15.99) cleans with a soft micro-foam. Deyga's Rose Glow Serum (£17.99) hydrates and adds glow, and the Light Moisturising Face Cream (£18.99) suits oily and normal skin. Deyga's Sunscreen (£16.99) is lightweight and blends without a white cast. Keep a natural lip balm close too: Deyga's Natural Lip Balm (£9.99) is light enough to wear under lipstick."},{"h3":"Rooted in Ayurveda","p":"Many products draw on traditional Ayurvedic ingredients, which is why this page is popular with shoppers looking for ayurvedic skincare in the UK. Deyga's Neem & Turmeric Bath Bar (£14.99) is a natural bathing bar made with neem and turmeric, and the Orange & Almond Face Pack Powder (£19.99) is mixed fresh with water or rose water."},{"h3":"Kits and routines","p":"Vilvah's kits make it easy to start. The Oil Control Kit (£32.99) suits oily and combination skin, the AM Brightening Kit (£39.99) is a fresh morning routine, and the Everyday Care Milk Kit (£48.99) keeps things gentle. Deyga's Vitamin C Daily Glow Combo (£30.99) pairs vitamin C care for brighter-looking skin."},{"p":"Shop natural skincare in the UK knowing every product is 100% authentic, shipped from our UK base, with free delivery over £50. Browse by brand on our [Deyga](#b-deyga) and [Vilvah](#b-vilvah) pages, or build a regimen with our [routines and sets](#rituals)."}]},"k-oud-perfume":{"h2":"Oud perfume from Arabian, niche and designer houses","blocks":[{"p":"Oud perfume is built around agarwood, a dark, resinous material with a smoky, woody depth that lasts for hours on skin. This edit brings together 27 oud fragrances from Arabian, niche and designer houses, from £19.99, so you can find the style that suits you."},{"h3":"Arabian classics","p":"Al Haramain's Amber Oud family is the easiest way in. Amber Oud Gold Edition (£29.99) is rich and sweet, the Tobacco Edition (£34.99) is warm and smoky, and Amber Oud Black Edition (£41.99) is deep and bold. La Maison de la Vanille Royal Oud (£19.99) adds a soft vanilla side, and Fumeri Oud Saffron for Men (£23.95) and SAP Saffron Oud (£37.95) pair the resin with spicy saffron."},{"h3":"Niche and designer oud","p":"For something rarer, Montale's Aoud Safran (£54.99) and Aoud Damascus (£52.99) blend oud with saffron and rose, while Mancera Black Noir (£69.99) is dark and rich. Tiziana Terenzi's Gold Rose Oudh Extrait (£84.99) is a concentrated rose and oud. From the designer houses, Gucci Intense Oud (£73.99), Guerlain Oud Essentiel (£94.99) and Tom Ford Oud Wood (from £115.99) are smoother takes on the note. Acqua di Parma Oud & Spice (20 ml, £40.99) comes in a handy smaller size."},{"p":"Oud is strong, so start with one or two sprays on the wrists or neck. Most of these scents are unisex, and many pair oud with amber, rose or spices. Explore the [Oud fragrances](#scent-oud) scent family, our [Arabian perfume](#k-arabian-perfume) page or the [Al Haramain](#b-al-haramain) collection."},{"p":"Every bottle is 100% authentic. We dispatch from within the UK, which makes this a simple place to buy oud perfume online in the UK, with free delivery when you spend over £50."}]},"k-arabian-perfume":{"h2":"Arabian perfume: oud, amber and musk","blocks":[{"p":"Arabian perfume is known for rich, long-lasting blends of oud, amber, musk and rose. This edit gathers 33 fragrances from Al Haramain, Signature D'orient and Armaf, from £19.99, ranging from fresh everyday scents to deep evening blends."},{"h3":"Al Haramain","p":"Al Haramain's L'Aventure (£27.99) is fresh and confident, L'Aventure Blanche (£24.99) is crisp and clean, and L'Aventure Intense (£30.99) is bolder. Detour Noir (£19.99) is warm and smooth. For a softer, skin-like scent, Amber Musk (£39.99) blends warm amber with musk, and the Amber Oud editions bring in the resinous side of the house."},{"h3":"Signature D'orient","p":"Signature D'orient has a wide line of 100 ml eaux de parfum, many sold with a 15 ml travel spray. Signature Blue (£38.99) is fresh and modern, Signature Aura (£74.95) is soft and radiant with a refillable travel spray, and Black Pour Homme (£38.99) is smooth and masculine. If you prefer a clean musk perfume, Musk Eau De Parfum (£64.99) comes with a 15 ml spray and funnel. Not sure where to start? The Signature Discovery Set (10 x 10 ml, £75.99) lets you try ten scents before choosing a full bottle."},{"p":"Rounding out the edit, Armaf Hunter (£22.99) is a fresh, confident scent for men, and Signature Le Femme Gold (£42.99) is radiant and feminine. Explore our [oud perfume](#k-oud-perfume) page, the [Amber fragrances](#scent-amber) family or the full [Signature D'orient](#b-signature-d-orient) range."},{"p":"All fragrances are 100% authentic and sent from the UK, and delivery is free on orders over £50."}]},"k-perfume-for-women":{"h2":"Perfume for women","blocks":[{"p":"Choosing a perfume for women starts with the mood you want: soft florals, warm amber or something fresh and bright. This edit brings together 67 eaux de parfum, eaux de toilette and gift sets from designer and niche houses, including Chloé, Burberry, Guerlain, Gucci and DKNY."},{"h3":"Florals and fresh scents","p":"If you love a floral perfume, UK favourites here include Chloé Nomade (50 ml, £51.99) and the fresh but sophisticated Chloé Rose Naturelle Intense (£43.99). My Burberry Eau de Parfum (50 ml, £48.99) is an elegant floral, and DKNY Be Delicious Orchard Street (£28.99) is bright and lively. Anna Sui Sky (30 ml, £18.99) is playful and airy, and Ariana Grande Thank U, Next (£43.99) is sweet and fun."},{"h3":"Warm and sensual","p":"For evenings, Guerlain Samsara (£69.99) is warm and elegant, and L'Instant de Guerlain (£64.99) is soft and feminine. Searching for a Jean Paul perfume for women? Jean Paul Gaultier Scandal Gold (£62.99) is rich and sensual. Estée Lauder SpellBound (£49.99) and My Burberry Black Parfum (50 ml, £48.99) are deep and sophisticated, and Montale Aoud Damascus (£52.99) pairs oud with rose."},{"h3":"Try before you commit","p":"A miniature perfume set is a lovely way to explore. Mon Guerlain Miniature Perfume Gift Set (4 x 5 ml, £44.99) and the Burberry Women's Miniature Perfume Set (£45.99) each hold four scents, and Gucci Guilty Pour Femme comes as a 10 ml miniature (£19.99)."},{"p":"Find more in our [Floral fragrances](#scent-floral) family, the [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets) page or our [gifts for her](#k-gifts-for-her). Every bottle is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery over £50."}]},"k-perfume-for-men":{"h2":"Perfume for men and aftershave","blocks":[{"p":"A good perfume for men can be fresh and clean for the office or warm and woody for evenings. This edit gathers 59 eaux de parfum, eaux de toilette and grooming extras from houses such as Dolce & Gabbana, Guerlain, Giorgio Armani, Gucci, Calvin Klein and Azzaro."},{"h3":"Warm and woody","p":"Dolce & Gabbana The One for Men Eau de Parfum (100 ml, £54.99) is warm and elegant, and The One Gold Intense (£54.99) is richer still. Guerlain Habit Rouge (£64.99) is refined and timeless, and Azzaro The Most Wanted Parfum (£60.99) is bold and warm. Joop Homme Le Parfum (£32.99) is rich and sensual."},{"h3":"Fresh everyday scents","p":"For a fresh perfume, UK shoppers will find plenty of choice. Giorgio Armani Code Eau de Toilette (125 ml, refillable, £66.99) is refined, Gucci Guilty Pour Homme (£59.99) is fresh and aromatic, and Azzaro Chrome Legend (75 ml, £27.99) is energetic. Bentley Momentum Unlimited (£31.99) and Davidoff Champion (£23.99) are easy daytime picks. Calvin Klein Eternity for Men Eau de Toilette (£38.99) is a classic, and Armaf Hunter (£22.99) and Antonio Banderas Power of Seduction (£16.99) keep the price down."},{"h3":"Minis and grooming","p":"Calvin Klein Defy Parfum is available full size (£22.99) or as a 10 ml miniature (£18.99), and the Dolce & Gabbana Men's Miniature Fragrance Set (£34.99) holds five scents. To complete the ritual, Philipp Plein No Limits After Shave Balm (£23.99) is a soothing aftershave step."},{"p":"Explore our [Woody fragrances](#scent-woody), the [men's grooming](#k-mens-grooming) edit or [gifts for him](#k-gifts-for-him). Every fragrance is 100% authentic and posted from the UK, and delivery is free on orders over £50."}]},"k-unisex-perfume":{"h2":"Unisex perfume to share","blocks":[{"p":"A unisex perfume is made for anyone who loves it, and many of the most interesting scents in our range sit outside the 'for him' or 'for her' labels. This edit gathers more than 230 shareable fragrances, from fresh herbal blends to deep oud and tobacco."},{"h3":"anatomē","p":"The London house anatomē makes a collection of eaux de parfum named Balance, Energy, Focus, Order, Expression and Support. Each comes in a smaller size at £28 or a larger bottle at £125. Expression is oceanic, Support is herbaceous and green, and Energy is bright and fresh, so they are easy to wear every day."},{"h3":"Niche houses","p":"Hemel's line includes Rosado (£49.99), a refined rose, and Patchouli For All (£61.99), rich and sophisticated. Mancera Intense Red Tobacco Extrait (£79.99) is powerful and smoky. Serge Lutens La Fille de Berlin (£44.99) is bold and elegant. Boucheron Rose d'Isparta (£63.99) is a full, elegant rose."},{"h3":"Oud, amber and musk","p":"Guerlain Musc Noble (£74.99) is a smooth musk perfume, and Guerlain Épices Exquises (£86.99) adds warm spice. For oud, Montale Aoud Safran (£54.99) is bold and saffron-rich, and Al Haramain Amber Oud Tobacco Edition (£34.99) is rich and warm. Al Haramain Detour Noir (£19.99) is a smooth, low-cost way to start."},{"p":"Scents don't belong to anyone, so follow your nose. Explore our [niche perfume](#k-niche-perfume) edit, the [oud perfume](#k-oud-perfume) page or the [Fresh fragrances](#scent-fresh) family. Every bottle is 100% authentic and dispatched from the UK, and orders over £50 ship free."}]},"k-niche-perfume":{"h2":"Niche perfume houses","blocks":[{"p":"Niche perfume comes from smaller, specialist houses that focus on unusual materials and bold compositions. This edit brings together 73 fragrances from Tiziana Terenzi, Hemel, anatomē, Montale, Mancera and Serge Lutens, most of them unisex."},{"h3":"Tiziana Terenzi extraits","p":"Tiziana Terenzi makes its scents as extrait de parfum, a concentration richer than an eau de parfum. White Fire (£76.99) is clean and elegant, Kirke (£82.99) is bold and captivating, and Porpora (£99.99) is rich. Moro di Venezia (£99.99) is sophisticated, Orion (£109.99) is bold and refined, and Caput Mundi (£99.99) is warm with oud. The Linea TT bottles include Borelli (£132.99) and Orza (£164.99), and Deriva (£119.99) belongs to the Sea Stars Collection."},{"h3":"Hemel, Montale and Mancera","p":"Hemel's 100 ml eaux de parfum include Valley of Diamond (£61.99), a sophisticated blend, and Amethyst Dream (£61.99), vibrant and floral. Montale Aoud Safran (£54.99) is bold and spicy, and Mancera Black Noir (£69.99) is dark and rich. Serge Lutens La Fille de Berlin (£44.99) is a bold, elegant rose."},{"h3":"A gentle start","p":"If you're new to niche scents, anatomē's eaux de parfum start at £28 for a smaller size, with larger bottles at £125. Many niche houses work with amber, so our amber perfume edit is a good next step."},{"p":"Explore the [Amber fragrances](#scent-amber) family, our [unisex perfume](#k-unisex-perfume) page or the [Tiziana Terenzi](#b-tiziana-terenzi) brand page. Every bottle is 100% authentic and sent from the UK, and delivery is free on orders over £50."}]},"k-perfume-gift-sets":{"h2":"Perfume gift sets and discovery sets","blocks":[{"p":"Perfume gift sets make giving easy: a full bottle with a travel spray, a matching body lotion or a box of minis to explore. This edit brings together 72 sets and miniatures from Gucci, Dolce & Gabbana, Chloé, Bvlgari, Guerlain and more."},{"h3":"Full bottles with extras","p":"The Gucci Bloom Eau de Parfum Gift Set (£84.99) pairs a 100 ml bottle with a 10 ml spray and body lotion, and Guilty Pour Femme comes with a matching body lotion (£47.99). Chloé Nomade (£66.99) adds a 20 ml travel spray to a 75 ml bottle. For him, the Dolce & Gabbana K gift set (£54.99) and Bvlgari Man Wood Essence (£64.99) both include a travel size. For her, Bvlgari Rose Goldea Blossom Delight (£79.99) is radiant and feminine, and the Dolce & Gabbana The One gift set for women (£64.99) holds two 50 ml bottles."},{"h3":"Minis and discovery sets","p":"A discovery set is perfect when you're not sure of someone's taste. Chopard Gardens of Paradise (4 x 10 ml, £59.99) holds four unisex scents, and Mon Guerlain (4 x 5 ml, £44.99) offers four women's fragrances. The Gucci Flora Gorgeous Miniature Perfume Set (3 x 5 ml, £44.99) and the Dolce & Gabbana Men's Miniature Fragrance Set (£34.99) are lovely to unwrap. anatomē's Parfum Travel (£125) is a discovery set for travel."},{"h3":"Small but special","p":"Single minis work as add-ons or stocking fillers. Calvin Klein My Euphoria (10 ml, £18.99) and Gucci Flora Gorgeous Orchid (10 ml, £17.99) both start under £20."},{"p":"For more ideas, see [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis), [Christmas gifts](#k-christmas-gifts) and [Gifts & Sets](#c-gifts). Every set is 100% authentic and shipped from within the UK, with free delivery over £50."}]},"k-travel-size-minis":{"h2":"Travel size perfume and miniatures","blocks":[{"p":"Travel size perfume is perfect for your handbag, your gym kit or a weekend away, and a mini lets you live with a scent before buying the full bottle. This edit gathers 82 miniatures, pen sprays and discovery sets from Gucci, Calvin Klein, Dior, Hermès and more."},{"h3":"10 ml minis","p":"Gucci Bloom Profumo di Fiori comes as a 10 ml pen spray (£16.95), and Gucci Flora Gorgeous Orchid (£17.99) and Bloom Eau de Toilette (£18.95) come as 10 ml minis too. From Calvin Klein, Defy Eau de Parfum, Eternity Parfum and My Euphoria are each £18.99 at 10 ml. Hermès Un Jardin à Cythère (15 ml, £25.99) is a fresh, distinctive unisex scent in a handy size."},{"h3":"Sets of minis","p":"A Dolce & Gabbana miniature set is a smart way to compare the house's scents: the Women's Miniature Fragrance Set (£39.99) holds five feminine fragrances, and the Men's set (£34.99) does the same for him. The Burberry Women's Miniature Perfume Set (4 x 5 ml, £45.99) is another good pick. For something special, the Dior Iconics Mini Perfume Discovery Set (5 x 5 ml, £92.99) brings together five of the house's well-known scents."},{"h3":"Bottles with a travel spray","p":"Several gift sets pair a full bottle with a travel spray, such as Bvlgari Man Rain Essence (100 ml + 15 ml, £54.99) and Chloé Nomade (75 ml + 20 ml, £66.99). That gives you one bottle for home and one for your bag."},{"p":"Remember that liquids in hand luggage have size limits, so check before you fly. Explore our [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets), [gifts under £25](#k-gifts-under-25) and [stocking fillers](#k-stocking-fillers). Everything is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, with free delivery over £50."}]},"k-gifts-for-her":{"h2":"Gifts for her","blocks":[{"p":"Finding gifts for her is easier when everything is ready to wrap. This edit gathers 112 skincare sets, perfumes and calming extras for birthdays, anniversaries and thank-yous, from designer fragrance to natural skincare."},{"h3":"Skincare sets","p":"A skincare gift set feels personal and gets used every day. Highborn London's Ultimate Day & Night Moisture Set (£95) covers morning and evening, the Scrub and Glow Luminosity Set (£89) brings two natural products for brighter-looking skin, and the Revive and Defy Starter Set (£78) pairs two of the brand's original formulas."},{"h3":"Perfume she'll reach for","p":"A perfume gift set adds a little extra. Chloé Nomade comes with a 20 ml travel spray (£66.99), and the DKNY Be Delicious & Be Delicious Fresh Blossom set (2 x 30 ml, £41.99) gives her two scents. If you're not sure of her taste, the Calvin Klein Women's Miniature Fragrance Set (4 x 15 ml, £33.99) lets her explore. Single bottles to consider include My Burberry Black Parfum (50 ml, £48.99), Ariana Grande Thank U, Next (£43.99) and Anna Sui Sky (30 ml, £18.99)."},{"h3":"Rest and relaxation","p":"anatomē's The Little Gift of Good Sleep (£35) features a 10 ml Somali Frankincense sleep oil, and The Gift of Good Sleep (£68) adds a Somali Frankincense pillow spray. For a small luxury, Jean Paul Gaultier Classique Perfumed Shower Gel (£22.99) brings a favourite scent to the shower."},{"p":"Browse more in [perfume for women](#k-perfume-for-women), [skincare](#c-skincare) and [luxury gifts over £50](#k-gifts-over-50). Every gift is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Delivery is free on orders over £50."}]},"k-gifts-for-him":{"h2":"Gifts for him","blocks":[{"p":"Good gifts for him are the ones he'll actually use, from a signature scent to the grooming basics he keeps running out of. This edit gathers 66 perfumes, gift sets and practical extras for birthdays, Father's Day and every occasion in between."},{"h3":"Fragrance gift sets","p":"A men's gift set gives him more than one bottle to enjoy. The Azzaro The Most Wanted Eau de Toilette Intense Gift Set (100 ml + 2 x 10 ml, £68.99) is fresh and sensual, and the Dolce & Gabbana K Eau de Parfum Gift Set (50 ml + 5 ml, £54.99) is confident and modern. The Dolce & Gabbana Men's Miniature Fragrance Set (£34.99) holds five scents, ideal if you're not sure what he wears."},{"h3":"Signature scents","p":"For a full bottle, Dolce & Gabbana The One for Men Eau de Parfum Intense (£54.99) is deep and warm, Chopard Oud Malaki (£48.99) is rich and sophisticated, and John Varvatos Artisan (£32.99) is fresh and refined. Joop Homme Le Parfum (£32.99) is rich and sensual. Calvin Klein Eternity Parfum comes as a 10 ml miniature (£18.99), a nice small extra."},{"h3":"Practical extras","p":"Grooming gifts don't need to be boring. Philipp Plein No Limits After Shave Balm (£23.99) is a smooth aftershave balm, and the matching Deodorant Stick (£16.99) completes the set. Coach Green Shower Gel (£13.99) is a refreshing men's shower gel, and Azzaro Pour Homme Deodorant Spray (£22.99) is a classic."},{"p":"Find more ideas in [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men), [men's grooming](#k-mens-grooming) and [gifts £25 to £50](#k-gifts-25-to-50). Every gift is 100% authentic and sent from the UK, with free delivery over £50."}]},"k-gifts-under-25":{"h2":"Gifts under £25","blocks":[{"p":"Gifts under £25 can still feel generous. This edit brings together 41 lip kits, perfume minis and natural care, ideal for Secret Santa, teachers, colleagues or a little something for yourself."},{"h3":"Mini perfumes","p":"A mini perfume lets her try a designer scent without the full-bottle price. Gucci Bloom Eau de Toilette (10 ml, £18.95), Marc Jacobs Perfect Elixir (10 ml, £19.99) and Viktor & Rolf Good Fortune (10 ml, £19.99) are all pretty to unwrap. Trussardi Pure Jasmine and Jimmy Choo I Want Choo Forever cost £14.99 each, and three Hermès Un Jardin minis, all unisex, are £24.99. The Korloff Paris Discovery Set (3 x 10 ml, £19.99) offers three scents in one box."},{"h3":"Lip care","p":"Lip gifts are small and easy to love. The Vilvah Tinted Lip Balm Kit (£17.99) gives a soft wash of colour, and Deyga's Soft Lip Combo (£17.99) pairs a mint scrub with beetroot lip balm. Vilvah's Milk Lip Balm (£9.99) is an SPF lip balm with SPF 30, and Vilvah's Lip Nourishing Kit (£13.99) includes a grapefruit balm with a natural tint."},{"h3":"Natural care","p":"For something practical, Vilvah's Deo Shot Kit (£17.99) is a natural deodorant duo with Rose & Vanilla and Lavender scents. Deyga's Hair Care Kit (£18.99) pairs rice water shampoo with soy milk conditioner, and Deyga's £19.99 glow kit brings a rose face pack and toner. Vilvah's Neem Wood Comb Set of 3 (£13.99) is handcrafted from neem wood."},{"p":"Need more ideas? See [stocking fillers](#k-stocking-fillers), [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis) and our [Under £15](#price-0-15) range. Every gift is 100% authentic and posted from the UK, and orders over £50 travel free. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah."}]},"k-gifts-25-to-50":{"h2":"Gifts £25 to £50","blocks":[{"p":"Our gifts £25 to £50 edit is the sweet spot for birthdays and thank-yous: enough for a full bottle or a proper set without going over budget. There are more than 190 perfumes, minis and gift sets to choose from."},{"h3":"For her","p":"Calvin Klein Eternity Eau de Parfum (£28.99) is a timeless women's scent, and DKNY Be Tempted (£39.99) is bold and feminine. Estée Lauder SpellBound (50 ml, £49.99) is rich and sensual. A miniature perfume set lets her explore several scents: the Burberry Women's Miniature Perfume Set (£45.99), the Chloé Women's Miniature Eau de Parfum Gift Set (£48.99) and Mon Guerlain (4 x 5 ml, £44.99) all fit the budget."},{"h3":"For him","p":"Azzaro Chrome Legend (125 ml, £33.99) is fresh and energetic, and Bentley Become (£40.99) is modern and refined. Joop Homme Eau de Toilette comes in a generous 200 ml bottle (£34.99), and John Varvatos Artisan (£32.99) is fresh and refined."},{"h3":"To share","p":"Unisex picks include Hemel Gris and Dorado (£49.99 each) and Serge Lutens La Fille de Berlin (50 ml, £44.99). anatomē's eaux de parfum cost £28 in the smaller size, and The Little Gift of Good Sleep (£35) includes a 10 ml Somali Frankincense sleep oil."},{"p":"Explore our [unisex perfume](#k-unisex-perfume) edit, [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets) or the [£25 to £50](#price-25-50) price range. Everything is 100% authentic and ships from the UK. Add another small item and your order passes £50, which means free delivery."}]},"k-gifts-over-50":{"h2":"Luxury gifts over £50","blocks":[{"p":"Luxury gifts are for the moments that matter: milestone birthdays, anniversaries and the people who deserve something special. This edit gathers 140 fragrances and skincare collections over £50, from niche extraits to designer classics."},{"h3":"Luxury perfume","p":"Guerlain Oud Essentiel (125 ml, £94.99) is deep and elegant, Épices Exquises (£86.99) is warm and spicy, and Musc Noble (£74.99) is a smooth musk. Gucci Intense Oud (£73.99) is luxurious, Mancera Intense Red Tobacco Extrait (£79.99) is powerful and smoky, and Jean Paul Gaultier Scandal Gold (£62.99) is rich and sensual. Giorgio Armani Code Eau de Toilette (125 ml, refillable, £66.99) and Chloé Nomade Nuit d'Égypte (£55.99) round out the designer picks."},{"h3":"Sets to unwrap","p":"La Maison de la Vanille's wooden coffret, Vanilles Des Origines (5 x 30 ml, £84.99), holds five vanilla scents in a keepsake box. anatomē's Parfum Travel (£125) is a discovery set made for travel, and The Gift of Good Sleep (£68) pairs a Somali Frankincense pillow spray with sleep care."},{"h3":"Skincare","p":"A skincare gift set feels luxurious but practical. Highborn London's Ultimate Day & Night Moisture Set (£95) covers morning and night, and the Scrub and Glow Luminosity Set (£89) brings two natural products for brighter-looking skin."},{"p":"Explore our [niche perfume](#k-niche-perfume) edit, the [oud perfume](#k-oud-perfume) page or the [£50 and over](#price-50-9999) range. Every gift is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and because it's over £50, delivery is free."}]},"k-diwali-gifts":{"h2":"Diwali gifts: perfume and natural Indian skincare","blocks":[{"p":"Diwali gifts are about light, warmth and sharing something beautiful with the people you love. This edit gathers 92 perfumes and gift sets with rich oud, amber and rose notes, alongside natural Indian skincare from Deyga and Vilvah."},{"h3":"Warm, festive fragrance","p":"Oud and amber feel right for the festival of lights. Al Haramain's Amber Oud Gold Edition (£29.99) is rich and sweet, the Ruby Edition (£41.99) is elegant, and Amber Musk (£39.99) is warm and smooth. Chopard Amber Malaki (£49.99) is a refined amber, and Chopard Oud Malaki (£48.99) is rich and sophisticated. For a showpiece, Tom Ford Oud Wood (£115.99) and Tiziana Terenzi Gold Rose Oudh (£84.99) are memorable gifts. La Maison de la Vanille Royal Oud (£19.99) is a thoughtful, lower-cost choice."},{"h3":"Rose and floral","p":"Rose is a lovely festive note. The Woods Collection Wild Roses (£44.99) is floral and woody, and the Bvlgari Rose Goldea Blossom Delight Gift Set (£79.99) comes ready to give with a 15 ml travel spray. Boucheron Rose d'Isparta (£63.99) is rich and elegant."},{"h3":"Natural skincare from India","p":"A natural skincare gift set from Deyga or Vilvah brings the plants and rituals of Indian beauty to family and friends in the UK. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah. Browse their kits in our [routines and sets](#rituals) or on the [Deyga](#b-deyga) brand page."},{"p":"See also our [Oud fragrances](#scent-oud) family. Every gift is 100% authentic and posted from the UK, and delivery is free on orders over £50. Order early so your gifts arrive before the celebrations."}]},"k-ramadan-eid-gifts":{"h2":"Ramadan and Eid gifts: oud, musk and amber","blocks":[{"p":"Ramadan and Eid gifts often centre on fragrance, from rich oud to soft musk. This edit brings together 64 perfumes from Arabian, niche and designer houses, chosen for warm, long-lasting notes that suit gatherings and visits."},{"h3":"Arabian houses","p":"Al Haramain is a natural starting point. L'Aventure (£27.99) is fresh and confident, L'Aventure Blanche (£24.99) is crisp and clean, and L'Aventure Gold (£28.99) is elegant. Al Haramain Amber Musk (£39.99) is a smooth musk perfume, and Amber Oud Ruby Edition (£41.99) is rich and floral. La Maison de la Vanille Royal Oud (£19.99) is a thoughtful smaller gift."},{"h3":"Oud for him and her","p":"For an oud perfume for men, Chopard Oud Malaki (£48.99) is rich and sophisticated, and Acqua di Parma Oud & Spice (20 ml, £40.99) comes in a compact size. For an oud perfume for women, Montale Aoud Damascus (£52.99) pairs oud with rose. Gucci Intense Oud (£73.99) and Tom Ford Oud Wood (50 ml, £124.99) are unisex showpieces."},{"h3":"Soft and refined","p":"Not everyone loves heavy oud. Guerlain Musc Noble (£74.99) is a rich, smooth musk, Chopard Amber Malaki (£49.99) is warm amber, and Hemel Dorado (£49.99) is rich and sophisticated. Guerlain Habit Rouge (£64.99) is a timeless choice for men."},{"p":"Explore our [Arabian perfume](#k-arabian-perfume) page, the [Oud range](#range-oud) or the [Al Haramain](#b-al-haramain) brand page. Every bottle is 100% authentic and sent from the UK, with free delivery over £50. Order in good time so gifts arrive before Eid."}]},"k-christmas-gifts":{"h2":"Christmas gifts for everyone on your list","blocks":[{"p":"Christmas gifts are easier when they arrive ready to wrap. This edit gathers 101 perfume sets, skincare collections and small extras, so you can tick off parents, partners, friends and colleagues in one order."},{"h3":"Perfume sets","p":"The Gucci Bloom Eau de Parfum Gift Set (£84.99) pairs a 100 ml bottle with a 10 ml spray and body lotion, and the Guilty Pour Femme set (£47.99) adds a matching lotion. The Dolce & Gabbana Devotion gift set (50 ml + 10 ml, £54.99) is warm and sweet. For him, Bvlgari Man Terrae Essence (£69.99) is warm and earthy, and the Azzaro The Most Wanted Gift Set (£68.99) is fresh and sensual. Browse all our perfume gift sets for more."},{"h3":"Discovery and miniature sets","p":"Chopard Gardens of Paradise (4 x 10 ml, £59.99) is a discovery set of four unisex scents. Mon Guerlain (4 x 5 ml, £44.99), Gucci Flora Gorgeous (3 x 5 ml, £44.99) and the DKNY Women's Miniature Eau de Parfum Set (£35.99) all make pretty presents. Single minis like Gucci Flora Gorgeous Orchid (10 ml, £17.99) work well as extras."},{"h3":"Skincare and calm","p":"A skincare gift set is a thoughtful alternative to perfume. Highborn London's Ultimate Day & Night Moisture Set (£95) is a generous choice, and anatomē's The Little Gift of Good Sleep (£35) includes a Somali Frankincense sleep oil for quiet winter evenings."},{"p":"See also [stocking fillers](#k-stocking-fillers), [gifts for her](#k-gifts-for-her) and [gifts for him](#k-gifts-for-him). Every gift is 100% authentic and sent from the UK, and delivery is free on orders over £50. Order early in December so presents arrive in time."}]},"k-stocking-fillers":{"h2":"Stocking fillers under £15","blocks":[{"p":"Stocking fillers should be small, useful and a little bit lovely. This edit gathers 49 lip balms, soaps, scrubs and mini essentials, all under £15, so you can fill a stocking without going over budget."},{"h3":"Lips and face","p":"Lip care is the classic small gift. Deyga's Beetroot Lip Balm Classic (£10.99) gives a soft tint with natural butters, Vilvah's Grape Fruit Lip Balm costs £6.99, and the Strawberry Lip Scrub (£10.99) buffs lips smooth. For the face, Deyga's Pure Rose Water Toner (£11.99) is a gentle rose water toner free from alcohol, and Vilvah's Wild Rose Face Mask (£11.99) uses French pink clay."},{"h3":"Bath and body","p":"A goat milk soap is a simple, pretty gift. The Classic Goatmilk Soap Bar (£9.99) hydrates dry skin, and the Cucumber, Curd & Mint Soap Bar (£9.99) feels cool and refreshing. Deyga's Organic Loofah (£12.99) is a natural exfoliating tool, and Coach Green Shower Gel (£13.99) is a refreshing men's body wash."},{"h3":"Handy extras","p":"Vilvah's Deo Shot comes in Lavender & Sage and Rose & Vanilla (£9.99 each), a natural deodorant in a compact 20 g size. Deyga's Hair Removal Powder (£13.99) is a natural hair removal powder, and Vilvah's Men's Neem Wood Comb (£9.99) is handmade from neem wood."},{"p":"For bigger budgets, see [gifts under £25](#k-gifts-under-25) and [Christmas gifts](#k-christmas-gifts), or shop the full [Under £15](#price-0-15) range. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah. Every product is 100% authentic and ships from the UK, and orders over £50 get free delivery."}]},"k-mens-grooming":{"h2":"Men's grooming: fragrance, body wash and care","blocks":[{"p":"Men's grooming doesn't need to be complicated: a good shower gel, a deodorant you trust, a smooth finish after shaving and a scent that feels like you. This edit gathers 67 fragrances and grooming essentials from houses such as Dolce & Gabbana, Azzaro, Philipp Plein, Calvin Klein and Hugo Boss."},{"h3":"Daily basics","p":"Coach Green Shower Gel (100 ml, £13.99) is a refreshing start to the day. Azzaro Pour Homme Deodorant Spray (150 ml, £22.99) is a classic, and the Philipp Plein No Limits Deodorant Stick (£16.99) is a bold, easy alternative. After shaving, the No Limits After Shave Balm (150 ml, £23.99) leaves skin feeling smooth and comfortable."},{"h3":"A signature scent","p":"Finish with fragrance. Dolce & Gabbana The One Intense for men (100 ml, £54.99) is deep and warm, Hugo Boss BOSS The Scent (£58.99) is smooth, and Bentley For Men Absolute (£31.99) is deep and refined. Davidoff Champion (90 ml, £23.99) is fresh and masculine. Calvin Klein Defy Parfum comes in a 10 ml miniature (£18.99) for the gym bag."},{"h3":"Building a routine","p":"Shower, then deodorant, then fragrance on pulse points, so the scent sits on clean skin and lasts longer. Matching ranges, such as Philipp Plein No Limits, keep your scent consistent from shower to aftershave."},{"p":"Explore [perfume for men](#k-perfume-for-men), [gifts for him](#k-gifts-for-him) and our [natural deodorant](#k-deodorant) page. Every product is 100% authentic and posted from the UK, and delivery is free on orders over £50."}]},"c-all":{"h2":"Ayurvedic skincare and niche and designer perfume in the UK","blocks":[{"p":"If you are looking for Ayurvedic skincare UK delivery and niche, Arabian and designer fragrance in one place, this is the full Swansura catalogue. This page shows all 545 products we stock, from a £6.99 Vilvah lip scrub to Tiziana Terenzi extraits. Every item is 100% authentic and sent from our UK base."},{"h3":"Skincare, haircare and body care","p":"The care side of the catalogue is led by Deyga and Vilvah, two Indian brands built on plant oils, milks, clays and herbs, and a natural first stop for Ayurvedic skincare in the UK. Swansura is an official UK partner of both. You will find gentle face washes, serums, face packs, lip balms and kits, plus luxury English formulas from Highborn London such as Imperial Moisturiser and Night Elixir. For hair, Vilvah Goat Milk Shampoo and Deyga Rice Water Shampoo sit in our range of [natural shampoo and haircare](#c-haircare), and if you want a natural shampoo UK delivery can bring to your door, start there. Bath bars, body butters and scrubs live in [Bath & Body](#c-bath-body), including natural body wash for daily use, such as Deyga Wild Berry Body Wash. Lip care runs from Deyga Natural Lip Balm at £9.99 to Highborn London Superior Lip Butter, so a natural lip balm UK order is easy to add."},{"h3":"Fragrance for every taste","p":"The fragrance shelf holds 357 perfumes. There are designer names such as Calvin Klein Eternity, Chloé Nomade and DKNY Be Delicious, Arabian houses such as Al Haramain with its Amber Oud editions, and niche extraits from Tiziana Terenzi. If you are looking for oud perfume, the [oud fragrance family](#scent-oud) gathers every smoky, resinous scent in one list. Minis and discovery sets let you try a scent before a full bottle."},{"p":"Use the filters to narrow by brand, price, concern or scent family, or browse [routines and sets](#rituals) if you would rather start from a ready-made combination. Orders over £50 get free UK delivery."}]},"c-skincare":{"h2":"Natural skincare from Deyga, Vilvah and Highborn London","blocks":[{"p":"Our natural skincare edit brings together 109 face and lip products from Indian brands Deyga and Vilvah and from luxury English label Highborn London. Prices start at £6.99, so you can try a single cleanser or build a full routine. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, and every order ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Cleanse, tone and moisturise","p":"Start with a wash suited to your skin: Deyga Vitamin C Foaming Face Wash, Vilvah Honey Face Wash or the Fragrance-Free Cream Face Wash. Next comes a face serum, such as Deyga 2% Hyaluronic Acid Serum, Rose Glow Serum or the 10% Vitamin C Face Serum, a vitamin c serum at £16.99. For a moisturiser for dry skin, Deyga Deep Moisturising Face Cream is a rich option, while Highborn London Imperial Moisturiser gives a richer, more luxurious texture. Oilier skin may prefer Deyga Light Moisturising Face Cream, made for oily and normal skin."},{"h3":"Masks, eyes and sun care","p":"Face packs such as Spirulina Matcha Face Pack and Orange & Almond Face Pack Powder are mixed fresh for a weekly mask. Around the eyes, try Deyga Under Eye Mask or Highborn London Imperial Eye Gel, a lightweight alternative to a heavy under eye cream. Finish your morning with Vilvah Skin Finish Sunscreen SPF 50 PA+++, a sunscreen spf 50 with a light finish, or browse the full [sun care edit](#concern-sun)."},{"p":"Not sure where to begin with natural skincare? Shop by concern, from [glow and even tone](#concern-glow) to [deep hydration](#concern-hydration), or pick one of our three-step [skincare routines](#rituals). Spend over £50 and UK delivery is free."}]},"c-haircare":{"h2":"Natural shampoo, conditioner and hair oil","blocks":[{"p":"Find a natural shampoo, conditioner or hair oil from our 29 haircare products by Vilvah and Deyga, with prices from £9.99. These Indian brands work with rice water, goat milk, soy milk, neem and traditional herbs. Swansura is an official UK partner of both, and we ship every order from the UK."},{"h3":"Wash and condition","p":"Vilvah Goat Milk Shampoo is a gentle goat milk shampoo that cleanses without stripping, and pairs with Vilvah Cream Conditioner. Deyga Rice Water Shampoo, the rice water shampoo in our range, is made to improve hair texture and manageability, with Deyga Soy Milk Conditioner as its partner. For flakes, Vilvah Herbal Shampoo and Deyga Anti Dandruff Shampoo sit in our [dandruff edit](#concern-dandruff). Choosing a natural shampoo comes down to your scalp, so read each description before you buy."},{"h3":"Oils and treatments","p":"Oiling before you wash is a long Indian tradition. Deyga Hair Growth Oil blends coconut, amla, hibiscus, castor and fenugreek, which makes it a good pick if you want an amla hair oil. Vilvah Hair Growth Oil uses pumpkin seed, kalonji and castor oils. Both are a popular hair growth oil choice for a weekly scalp massage, and you can see more in our [hair fall edit](#concern-hairfall). Deyga Premature Greying Hair Oil uses henna and bhringraj. For dry ends, Vilvah Goat Milk Hair Mask and Anti-Frizz Hair Serum add softness and smoothness."},{"h3":"Kits for an easy start","p":"Vilvah's Goat Milk Hair Kit, Frizz Free Hair Kit and Anti-Dandruff Haircare Kit put matching products together, and any of them makes a thoughtful hair care gift set. Deyga's Daily Use Healthy Hair Kit is the lowest-priced kit at £11.99. You can also follow our [Smooth & Shine and Hair Fall routines](#rituals). Free UK delivery applies on orders over £50."}]},"c-bath-body":{"h2":"Body butter, scrubs, bath bars and sleep rituals","blocks":[{"p":"Pick up a body butter, scrub, bath bar or pillow spray from our 50 bath and body products, with prices from £6.99. The range mixes Indian natural care from Deyga and Vilvah with luxury English formulas from Highborn London and calming sleep products from anatomē. Every item is authentic and posted from the UK."},{"h3":"Wash, scrub and moisturise","p":"Deyga bath bars come in Spinach & Cucumber, Rose Pink Clay, Shea Saffron and Neem & Turmeric, and each bath bar costs £15.99 or less. Our Swansura Selection goat milk soap range includes Classic Goatmilk and Classic Rose bars at £9.99. Follow with Deyga Body Scrub, a body scrub at £16.99 made with papaya and pomegranate, or Highborn London Natural Luminosity Scrub for a richer treat. Then seal in moisture with Deyga Chocolate Body Butter, a chocolate body butter at £15.99, or the Rose & Geranium version. Our [Body Polish Ritual](#rituals) puts all three steps together."},{"h3":"Fresh all day","p":"Vilvah Deo Shots in Lavender & Sage and Rose & Vanilla are a natural deodorant at £9.99 each, and the Deo Shot Kit brings both together. For men, Coach Green Shower Gel and Acqua di Parma Colonia Essenza Deodorant Stick add a scented finish that pairs well with your fragrance."},{"h3":"Wind down","p":"anatomē's sleep range includes Relax + Sleep Chamomile Bath Salts, Sleep Oil for Restless Sleep and Somali Frankincense Sleep Pillow Spray, with gift sets such as The Gift of Good Sleep. See the full [calm and sleep edit](#concern-calm) for more ideas. Orders over £50 ship free across the UK."}]},"c-fragrance":{"h2":"Perfume in the UK: niche, Arabian and designer","blocks":[{"p":"Our perfume edit starts here: 357 authentic scents, from minis at £14.99 to rare extraits, all shipped from our UK base. You will find European fashion houses, Arabian perfumers and niche labels side by side, so it is easy to compare styles and price points in one place."},{"h3":"Designer favourites","p":"Designer names include Calvin Klein Eternity and Defy, Chloé Nomade, DKNY Be Delicious, Burberry, Gucci Bloom and Flora, Bvlgari and Hermès. Fans of Jean Paul Gaultier can pick up Scandal Gold Eau de Parfum, and the Jean Paul perfume line also includes a perfumed shower gel. The Dolce & Gabbana perfume range covers The One for Men, Devotion and K, with gift sets for both."},{"h3":"Arabian and niche","p":"Al Haramain's Amber Oud editions, Hemel, Signature D'orient, Fumeri and Korloff bring rich oud, amber and spice. Signature D'orient Blue, a signature blue scent at £38.99, takes a fresher route. Niche houses include Tiziana Terenzi extraits, Jo Milano, whose Game of Spades Full House is a warm unisex Eau de Parfum, plus Mancera, Montale and Serge Lutens. If you want every oud perfume in one list, browse the [oud family](#scent-oud) or our [Arabian perfume edit](#k-arabian-perfume)."},{"h3":"Find your scent","p":"Shop by family to narrow the field: [warm amber](#scent-amber), [woody](#scent-woody), floral and fresh. Miniatures, discovery sets and 10ml sprays let you test a scent before committing to a full bottle. Free UK delivery applies to orders over £50."}]},"c-gifts":{"h2":"Skincare gift set, perfume sets and kits to give or keep","blocks":[{"p":"Choose a skincare gift set, a perfume set or a ready-made kit from our 116 gifts, with prices from £11.99. Everything here is boxed or grouped to give, though plenty of people buy for themselves. Every item is authentic and ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Natural skincare and hair kits","p":"Deyga and Vilvah, the two Indian brands Swansura is an official UK partner of, offer kits that pair two or three matching products. A Deyga or Vilvah natural skincare gift set, such as the Vitamin C Daily Glow Combo or Vilvah Sensitive Skin Kit, works well for someone new to Indian care. For hair, the Vilvah Goat Milk Hair Kit is a hair care gift set at £34.99. Highborn London adds luxury options, including the Ultimate Day & Night Moisture Set and Scrub and Glow Luminosity Set, and anatomē's The Gift of Good Sleep suits anyone who loves a bedtime ritual."},{"h3":"Perfume gift sets and minis","p":"Gucci, Chloé, Burberry and Guerlain offer miniature perfume sets of four 5ml bottles, ideal for trying a house. From Dolce & Gabbana, The One gift set for women pairs two 50ml items at £64.99, the Devotion gift set brings 50ml and 10ml at £54.99, and the Dolce & Gabbana miniature set comes in women's and men's versions. Bvlgari Man Essence gift sets and Chopard Gardens of Paradise Discovery Set add more choice. See our [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets) or [gifts for her](#k-gifts-for-her) for focused lists."},{"p":"Planning for a date? Browse [Christmas gifts](#k-christmas-gifts) or [Diwali gifts](#k-diwali-gifts). Orders over £50 travel free across the UK."}]},"concern-acne":{"h2":"Face wash for oily skin and oil-control care","blocks":[{"p":"If your skin runs shiny or breaks out easily, a face wash for oily skin is the first step. This edit gathers 42 products for oily and blemish-prone skin, mostly from Deyga and Vilvah, with prices from £9.99. Charcoal, neem and tea tree lead the ingredient list. Swansura is an official UK partner of both brands and ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Cleanse and tone","p":"Deyga Charcoal Face Wash uses activated charcoal to lift dirt and excess oil, and is the charcoal face wash most people start with. Vilvah Honey Face Wash, pH-balanced for normal to oily skin, is a softer option. After cleansing, Deyga Tea Tree Facial Toner is a toner for oily skin and combination skin that helps balance shine. For the body, Deyga Charcoal Bath Bar and the Swansura Selection Charcoal Goatmilk Soap Bar are a charcoal soap option at £9.99 to £10.99."},{"h3":"Weekly masks and moisturiser","p":"Once or twice a week, use a face mask for oily skin: Deyga Spirulina Matcha Face Pack, Charcoal Detox Face Mask or Vilvah Charcoal Face Mask. Deyga Neem Seed Oil is a cold-pressed oil for targeted use. Do not skip moisture. Deyga Light Moisturising Face Cream is a moisturiser for oily skin, made to absorb fast without a greasy finish."},{"h3":"Kits and routines","p":"Kits such as Vilvah Oil Control Kit, Deyga Clear Skin Kit and Deyga ABC Kit group matching steps. Our [Clear Skin Routine](#rituals) pairs the charcoal wash, tea tree toner and neem oil. For more, see [skincare for oily and acne-prone skin](#k-oily-skin) and our [face wash for oily skin guide](#k-face-wash-for-oily-skin). Spend over £50 for free UK delivery."}]},"concern-glow":{"h2":"Face serum for glowing skin and an even-looking tone","blocks":[{"p":"A good face serum for glowing skin is the heart of this edit, which gathers 65 products for dullness and uneven-looking tone, with prices from £6.99. You will find Indian natural care from Deyga and Vilvah, luxury English skincare from Highborn London and a few Swansura Selection treats, all sent from the UK."},{"h3":"Serums and cleansers","p":"Deyga Rose Glow Serum and the Vitamin C Daily Glow Combo suit everyday use, while Highborn London Pre-Eminent Beauty Serum pairs hyaluronic acid and vitamin C. If you need a face serum for dull skin with a richer feel, Highborn London MOISTUREBURST Hydrating Glow Ceramide Serum is made for dry and dehydrated skin. Whichever face serum for glowing skin you choose, apply it after cleansing and before moisturiser. Start the routine with Deyga Vitamin C Foaming Face Wash, a vitamin c face wash at £15.99, or Highborn London Crystal Cleanser with its matching Diamond Toner."},{"h3":"Masks and kits","p":"Skincare for dull skin often includes a weekly mask. Deyga Orange & Almond Face Pack Powder and Spirulina Matcha Face Pack are mixed fresh, and the Swansura Selection 24K Gold Hydrating Face Mask adds a golden finishing touch. Vilvah's AM Brightening Kit, AM PM Serum Kit and Skin Radiance Large Kit put serum and care steps together."},{"h3":"Body glow","p":"Glow is not only for the face. Deyga Body Scrub uses fruit-derived exfoliants for smoother-looking skin, a body scrub to pair with Deyga Shea Saffron Bath Bar or Highborn London Natural Luminosity Body Butter. See our [Vitamin C range](#range-vitamin-c), the [Vitamin C Glow Routine](#rituals) and [skincare for dull skin](#k-dull-skin) for more ideas. Free UK delivery starts at £50."}]},"concern-hydration":{"h2":"Moisturiser for dry skin and deep hydration care","blocks":[{"p":"Finding the right moisturiser for dry skin is easier when everything sits in one place. This edit gathers 121 products for dry, tight-feeling skin, from face creams and serums to body butters and bath oils, with prices from £6.99. Brands include Deyga, Highborn London and anatomē, and every order is sent from the UK."},{"h3":"Face care for dry skin","p":"Deyga Deep Moisturising Face Cream is a natural moisturiser made with plant-based oils, at £18.99. Highborn London Imperial Moisturiser offers rich moisture for dry, tight-feeling skin. Layer a serum underneath: Deyga 2% Hyaluronic Acid Serum or Highborn London MOISTUREBURST Hydrating Glow Ceramide Serum. In the evening, Highborn London Night Elixir works as a comforting night cream, and Four Phase Day and Night brings serum, eye gel, day cream and night cream together. For the eye area, Imperial Eye Gel is a lighter choice than a classic under eye cream."},{"h3":"Body and bath","p":"Skincare for dry skin carries on below the neck. Deyga Chocolate Body Butter and Rose & Geranium Body Butter are each a body butter for dry skin at £15.99, and Highborn London Natural Luminosity Body Butter is the luxury pick. anatomē Bath & Shower Oil with Roman Chamomile & Cornish Lavender turns a bath into a moisturising ritual. Bath bars such as Deyga Spinach & Cucumber and Shea Saffron cleanse without a tight feel."},{"p":"Our [Deep Hydration Routine](#rituals) pairs Vilvah Honey Face Wash, the hyaluronic acid serum and the deep moisturising cream. For focused lists, see [moisturiser for dry skin](#k-moisturiser-for-dry-skin) and [body butter for dry skin](#k-body-butter-for-dry-skin). Orders over £50 get free UK delivery."}]},"concern-lips":{"h2":"Tinted lip balm, lip scrubs and lip care","blocks":[{"p":"A tinted lip balm, a gentle scrub and a little SPF are all most lips need. This edit gathers 17 lip care products from Deyga, Vilvah and Highborn London, with prices from £6.99. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, and orders ship from the UK."},{"h3":"Scrub first","p":"A lip scrub buffs away dry flakes so balm can sink in. Deyga Strawberry Lip Scrub uses granulated sugar, Deyga Mint Lip Scrub is a fresh alternative, and Vilvah Natural Lip Scrub with lemon essential oil costs £6.99. Our [lip scrub guide](#k-lip-scrub) has more detail."},{"h3":"Tint and nourish","p":"Deyga Beetroot Lip Balm Classic is a beetroot lip balm with natural butters and a subtle tint, and the Beetroot Lip Balm Stick adds almond, avocado and jojoba oils in a tube. Vilvah Grape Fruit Lip Balm gives a soft natural tint, and the Vilvah Tinted Lip Balm Kit pairs tint with hydration. For a plain natural lip balm, Deyga Natural Lip Balm is lightweight and non-greasy, good under lipstick. Highborn London Superior Lip Butter, in 15ml and 50ml, is a rich lip balm for dry lips."},{"h3":"Protect","p":"Vilvah Milk Lip Balm SPF 30 PA+++ is an spf lip balm made with soy milk, shea and kokum butter, at £9.99. Kits such as Deyga Soft Lip Combo and Vilvah Lip Nourishing Kit pair scrub and balm, and our [Lip Wardrobe routine](#rituals) brings scrub, tint and SPF together. See the full [beetroot range](#range-beetroot) too. Free UK delivery applies over £50."}]},"concern-sun":{"h2":"Sunscreen SPF 50 and daily sun care","blocks":[{"p":"A daily sunscreen SPF 50 is one of the simplest steps in any routine. This small edit gathers 9 sun care products from Vilvah, Deyga and Highborn London, with prices from £9.99. Swansura is an official UK partner of Vilvah and Deyga, and every order is sent from the UK."},{"h3":"Face sunscreen","p":"Vilvah Skin Finish Sunscreen SPF 50 PA+++ is lightweight and smooth, wears well under makeup and leaves minimal white cast, at £17.99. Deyga Sunscreen 50ML is a natural sunscreen made with zinc oxide and plant oils such as raspberry and carrot seed, with no artificial fragrance, at £16.99. If you are looking for a natural sunscreen UK delivery can bring quickly, these two are the place to start, and our [natural sunscreen page](#k-natural-sunscreen) has more."},{"h3":"Lips and kits","p":"Lips need cover too. Vilvah Milk Lip Balm SPF 30 PA+++ is an spf lip balm with mineral filters, soy milk and shea butter, at £9.99. The Vilvah Sun Protection Kit pairs the SPF 50 face sunscreen with the SPF 30 lip balm for £28.99, and the Skin Brightening Kit adds a serum to the routine."},{"h3":"Luxury and finishing steps","p":"Highborn London GLOWGUARD SPF30 Anti-Ageing Moisturiser combines moisture and SPF 30 in one step. At the end of the day, Deyga Tangerine Cleansing Balm lifts sunscreen and makeup before you cleanse. Pair your SPF with the [Vitamin C Glow Routine](#rituals) or browse all [skincare](#c-skincare). Orders over £50 ship free in the UK."}]},"concern-hairfall":{"h2":"Hair growth oil and care for hair fall","blocks":[{"p":"A weekly massage with a hair growth oil is a traditional Indian ritual, and this edit gathers 12 products for hair fall from Deyga and Vilvah, with prices from £9.99. Swansura is an official UK partner of both brands and ships every order from the UK. These are cosmetic products to nourish your scalp and hair; if you are worried about sudden hair loss, speak to your GP."},{"h3":"Oils for the scalp","p":"Deyga Hair Growth Oil 100 ml blends coconut, amla, hibiscus, castor and fenugreek, so it covers anyone searching for an amla hair oil or a hibiscus hair oil in one bottle, at £14.99. Vilvah Hair Growth Oil is alcohol-free, with pumpkin seed, kalonji, castor and grapeseed oils, at £9.99. Deyga Premature Greying Hair Oil uses henna and bhringraj, a bhringraj oil blend with a long history in Indian hair care. People often look for a hair oil for hair loss; these oils are made to nourish the scalp and lengths."},{"h3":"Wash and comb","p":"Vilvah Herbal Shampoo for Dandruff Control, made with neem, tea tree and rosemary, keeps the scalp feeling clean. If you are searching for a shampoo for hair loss, our [shampoo for hair loss page](#k-shampoo-for-hair-loss) compares gentle cleansing options. Vilvah Neem Wood Comb (Fine & Wide Tooth) is a gentle, eco-friendly tool for detangling."},{"p":"Kits such as Deyga Hair Care Kit pair a rice water shampoo with soy milk conditioner. Our [Hair Fall Rescue routine](#rituals) brings oil, wash and condition together, and you can see the rest in [Haircare](#c-haircare). Free UK delivery starts at £50."}]},"concern-dandruff":{"h2":"Shampoo for dandruff and calm-scalp care","blocks":[{"p":"A gentle shampoo for dandruff, a scalp oil and the right comb make a simple routine for a flaky, itchy-feeling scalp. This edit holds 9 products from Vilvah and Deyga, priced from £9.99 to £27.99. Swansura is an official UK partner of both brands, and orders ship from the UK."},{"h3":"Wash","p":"Vilvah Herbal Shampoo for Dandruff Control is made with neem, tea tree, rosemary and black pepper, at £12.99, and the larger Vilvah Herbal Shampoo 250ML removes excess oil, flakes and buildup without leaving hair dry. Deyga Anti Dandruff Shampoo 220ml uses botanical extracts and a mild cleansing system for frequent use, and is safe for colour-treated hair. If you want a natural shampoo UK delivery can bring to your door, any of these three is a good start. Compare more in our [shampoo for dandruff guide](#k-shampoo-for-dandruff)."},{"h3":"Oil","p":"Vilvah Anti-Dandruff Hair Oil 100ml combines tea tree, neem, peppermint and amla oils, a hair oil for dandruff-prone scalps that you massage in before washing. Deyga Neem Seed Oil 30ML is a pure, cold-pressed option for the scalp."},{"h3":"Comb and kit","p":"Vilvah neem wood combs come in three styles, each £9.99: Fine & Wide Tooth, With Handle and Men's. Made from Indian neem wood, a neem wood comb glides through hair gently. The Vilvah Anti-Dandruff Haircare Kit puts shampoo and oil together for £27.99. Our [Calm Scalp Duo](#rituals) pairs Vilvah's oil with Deyga's shampoo, and the [neem and tea tree range](#range-neem) shows more. Free UK delivery applies on orders over £50."}]},"concern-calm":{"h2":"Aloe vera gel, gentle skincare and sleep rituals","blocks":[{"p":"Vilvah Aloe Vera Gel is a pure, cold-stabilised aloe vera gel at £9.99, and it is a good place to start this edit of 36 calming products. You will find gentle skincare from Vilvah and Deyga, sleep rituals from anatomē and Swansura Selection treats, all shipped from the UK."},{"h3":"Gentle skincare","p":"Sensitive skin likes simple steps. Vilvah Fragrance-Free Cream Face Wash is a face wash for sensitive skin, made with mild plant-based cleansers and coconut milk extract, at £9.99. Deyga Oat Milk Face Wash is an oat milk face wash for dry or easily irritated skin. Follow with Vilvah Rosewater Facial Toner, a rose water toner made from rose hydrosol, then the aloe vera gel. The Deyga Sensitive Skin Kit and Vilvah Sensitive Skin Kit pair these steps for you."},{"h3":"Body and bath","p":"Vilvah Goat Milk Body Wash is a low-foam natural body wash with a vanilla scent, pH-balanced at 5.5. Swansura Selection Classic Goatmilk Soap Bar and Classic Rose bar are each a goat milk soap at £9.99. Deyga Foot Soak Powder and Under Eye Mask add small moments of care."},{"h3":"Wind down for sleep","p":"anatomē makes the sleep side of this page. Relax + Sleep Chamomile Bath Salts, Sleep Oil for Restless Sleep, Sleep Oil for an Overactive Mind and the Somali Frankincense and Roman Chamomile pillow sprays build a bedtime ritual. The Little Gift of Good Sleep pairs a 10ml roller ball with a 10ml spray. Try our [Sleep Ritual](#rituals), browse [Bath & Body](#c-bath-body) or see [skincare for sensitive skin](#k-sensitive-skin). Orders over £50 ship free across the UK."}]},"scent-oud":{"h2":"Oud perfume in the UK: smoky, resinous and regal","blocks":[{"p":"Our oud perfume edit gathers 37 fragrances built on smoky, resinous agarwood, from £19.99 to £299.99. Arabian perfumers, European fashion houses and niche labels all interpret oud in their own way, so this page lets you compare them side by side. Every bottle is authentic and posted from the UK."},{"h3":"Arabian oud","p":"Al Haramain is the largest name here, with its Amber Oud family: Gold Edition at £29.99, Ruby, Black, Carbon, Bleu, Tobacco and White editions, and Extreme Gold Edition Extrait de Parfum. Amber Oud White Edition is a lighter, women's take with citrus and soft florals. SAP Saffron Oud and Oud Leopard extraits, Fumeri Oud Saffron For Men and Korloff Royal Oud add more Arabian-style choice. Try our [Amber Oud Discovery routine](#rituals) to compare three editions."},{"h3":"Niche and designer","p":"Tiziana Terenzi brings extraits such as Gold Rose Oudh, Caput Mundi, Orion and the rare Dubhe Assoluto. Montale Aoud Damascus, a deep rose and oud women's fragrance, is a natural pick if you want an oud perfume for women, while Aoud Safran is bolder. Designer options include Tom Ford Oud Wood, Gucci Intense Oud, Guerlain Oud Essentiel and Chopard Oud Malaki. Whatever your budget, you can compare every style of oud perfume here, from a £19.99 La Maison de la Vanille Royal Oud to rare niche extraits."},{"p":"Oud sits close to warm resins and spice, so you may also enjoy our [amber fragrances](#scent-amber) or the [Arabian perfume edit](#k-arabian-perfume). Spend over £50 and UK delivery is free."}]},"scent-amber":{"h2":"Amber perfume: warm, sweet and golden","blocks":[{"p":"Our amber perfume edit gathers warm, sweet and golden scents that suit cooler evenings and close-to-skin wear. There are 34 fragrances from £19.99, mixing niche houses, Arabian perfumers and designer names. Every bottle is authentic and shipped from the UK."},{"h3":"Niche amber","p":"Jo Milano has the deepest selection here. Game of Spades Full House is a unisex Eau de Parfum, Game of Spades Rouge comes in Parfum and Eau de Parfum, and Wildcard and Ruby complete the set. Swansura Selection Roll It 1 is a unisex Eau de Parfum at £99.99. Hemel Dorado brings spice, leather and florals, and Favourite Black adds citrus and aromatics."},{"h3":"Arabian and designer","p":"Al Haramain Amber Musk is a warm, smooth unisex scent and a good choice if you want a musk perfume to wear daily, alongside Detour Noir. Signature D'orient Ambre, Fumeri Ambre Night and Chopard Amber Malaki also sit in this family. From the fashion houses, Dolce & Gabbana Devotion, Guerlain Habit Rouge, Joop! Homme Le Parfum and S.T. Dupont Royal Amber cover both men's and unisex styles. La Maison de la Vanille Ambre Secret and Absolu de Vanille are sweet vanilla ambers at £19.99."},{"p":"If you love amber perfume, it pairs naturally with oud, so explore our [oud fragrances](#scent-oud) next, or warm up a gift with the [Amber Oud Evening routine](#rituals). Orders over £50 travel free in the UK."}]},"scent-floral":{"h2":"Floral perfume: rose, jasmine and white flowers","blocks":[{"p":"Floral is the biggest family on our shelf, and this floral perfume edit gathers 166 fragrances built around rose, jasmine and white flowers. Prices start with miniatures under £20, and every bottle is authentic and sent from our UK base. Use the filters to narrow by brand, price or size."},{"h3":"Rose and jasmine","p":"Chloé leads with Rose Naturelle Intense, a natural rose accord with citrus and neroli, and Nomade Jasmin Naturel Intense, which pairs luminous jasmine with sweet date. Burberry My Burberry Black Parfum blends jasmine and peach with a rose heart and warm amber. For a richer take, Jean Paul Gaultier Scandal Gold mixes honey, saffron and jasmine over patchouli and leather, a Jean Paul perfume for women who like depth. Estée Lauder SpellBound pairs rose and jasmine with cardamom and vanilla."},{"h3":"Fruity and playful florals","p":"If you prefer something lighter, Ariana Grande Thank U, Next brings pear, raspberry and rose with a creamy finish. Anna Sui Sky blends pear, lily of the valley and lotus, and Antonio Banderas Her Secret Temptation adds rose, jasmine and iris over vanilla at £20.99. DKNY Be Delicious Orchard Street and Calvin Klein Eternity are fresher everyday choices. Each is an easy floral perfume for every day, and a fine perfume for women. Our [perfume for women page](#k-perfume-for-women) has more."},{"h3":"Unisex florals and minis","p":"Hemel Valley of Diamond and Rosado offer unisex florals with woods and amber, ideal if you want a unisex perfume to share. To try several houses at once, a miniature perfume set from Chloé, Burberry or Calvin Klein is a smart start. Explore the [rose range](#range-rose) or our [travel size and mini perfumes](#k-travel-size-minis). Orders over £50 ship free across the UK."}]},"scent-woody":{"h2":"Woody perfume: sandalwood, cedar and patchouli","blocks":[{"p":"A woody perfume rests on sandalwood, cedar, vetiver and patchouli, giving a scent warmth and staying power. This edit gathers 95 woody fragrances, from miniatures and grooming extras under £20 to luxury unisex bottles. Every bottle is authentic and shipped from the UK."},{"h3":"Men's woody classics","p":"Dolce & Gabbana The One for Men Eau de Parfum blends grapefruit, cardamom and ginger with tobacco, amber and cedarwood, and comes in 100ml and 150ml plus the Intense and Gold versions. If you like Dolce & Gabbana The One, the K Eau de Parfum Gift Set is worth a look too. Gucci Guilty Pour Homme pairs lemon and pink pepper with patchouli and cedarwood, and Giorgio Armani Code Eau de Toilette Refillable mixes bergamot, clary sage and tonka bean. Bentley, John Varvatos Artisan and Calvin Klein Defy add more choice, and you can find each perfume for men in our [men's fragrance edit](#k-perfume-for-men)."},{"h3":"Unisex woods","p":"Hemel Patchouli For All is built on earthy patchouli and smooth amber, while Hemel Gris balances citrus and pink pepper with woods and an amber-musk base. Guerlain Musc Noble and Épices Exquises bring spice, cedar and precious woods in 125ml bottles. Each is a woody perfume made to share. anatomē Focus and Expression add a mindful twist."},{"h3":"Grooming and gifts","p":"Philipp Plein No Limits comes as a deodorant stick and after shave balm, and Bvlgari Man Wood Essence and Terrae Essence gift sets pair 100ml with a 15ml travel spray. For darker woods, see our [oud fragrances](#scent-oud) or [amber family](#scent-amber). Free UK delivery applies on orders over £50."}]},"scent-fresh":{"h2":"Citrus perfume: bergamot, sea air and green notes","blocks":[{"p":"Our citrus perfume edit gathers 25 bright, clean and easy-to-wear fragrances from £16.99, with bergamot, lemon, sea notes and green herbs. Every bottle is authentic and posted from the UK."},{"h3":"Italian freshness","p":"Acqua di Parma has the largest selection here. Colonia Pura Eau de Cologne opens with Italian bergamot, orange and petitgrain, and the Blu Mediterraneo Discovery Set brings three 12ml bottles to try. The 20ml EDPs, including Sakura and Rosa Nobile, are a neat way to try the house. For a fresh perfume to reach for daily, Dunhill Signature Collection Amalfi Citrus pairs lemon and bergamot with rosemary."},{"h3":"Blue and aquatic","p":"Dunhill Desire Blue blends bergamot with lotus and marine notes over amber and musk, at £28.99. Kenneth Cole Moonlight Blue mixes citrus with clean herbs and soft spice. Signature D'orient Blue is a signature blue scent at £38.99, and Fumeri Blue For Men offers a fresh men's option at £23.95. Antonio Banderas Power of Seduction, at £16.99, is the lowest-priced bottle here."},{"h3":"Unisex and niche","p":"Jo Milano Game of Spades Emerald balances freshness and depth in a unisex Eau de Parfum, and anatomē Energy opens with bright citrus. Both make a good unisex perfume to share. If you want a citrus perfume with more warmth, explore [woody fragrances](#scent-woody), or see our [unisex perfume edit](#k-unisex-perfume). Orders over £50 travel free in the UK."}]},"range-beetroot":{"h2":"Beetroot lip balm by Deyga","blocks":[{"p":"Deyga's beetroot lip balm gives lips a soft rosy tint from beetroot extract, with no synthetic dyes. This range has two versions. Beetroot Lip Balm Classic 10 g, at £10.99, blends beetroot with natural butters in a compact size that slips into a pocket. Beetroot Lip Balm Stick 5.5 g, at £26.99, adds organic almond, avocado and jojoba oils with shea butter in an eco-friendly tube."},{"p":"Both are free from parabens, artificial fragrance and petroleum derivatives, so they suit anyone looking for a natural lip balm to wear every day. Use one as a tinted lip balm on its own or under lipstick. The compact 10 g classic is easy to carry, while the stick suits quick touch-ups. A beetroot lip balm also makes a small, thoughtful gift. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and ships every order from the UK."},{"p":"For the full routine, scrub first and finish with SPF in our [Lip Wardrobe routine](#rituals), or browse all [lip care](#concern-lips)."}]},"range-goat-milk":{"h2":"Goat milk soap, shampoo and milk-based care","blocks":[{"p":"Goat milk soap is just the start of this range. These 21 creamy, gentle products from Vilvah, Deyga and Swansura Selection use goat, oat, soy and almond milk for face, body and hair, with prices from £9.99. Swansura is an official UK partner of Vilvah and Deyga, and every order ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Face","p":"Vilvah Milk Powder Face Wash is a water-free milk face wash with hyaluronic acid, made for normal to oily skin, at £13.99. Deyga Oat Milk Face Wash is an oat milk face wash for dry or sensitive skin. If you were searching for a goat milk face wash, these two are the closest gentle cleansers in our range. Follow with Vilvah Milk Face Toner, Milk Drops Hydrating Serum and Milk Mud Mask, or buy them together in the Milk Face Kit. Our [Milk Glow Routine](#rituals) shows how they fit together."},{"h3":"Body","p":"Swansura Selection makes three goat milk soap bars at £9.99: Classic Goatmilk, Classic Rose and Charcoal Goatmilk. Vilvah Goat Milk Body Wash adds goat milk and virgin coconut oil, and Vilvah Milk Body Lotion uses oat milk, ceramides and olive squalane. Deyga Almond Milk Body Lotion is a lighter choice. The Milk Body Kit pairs wash and lotion."},{"h3":"Hair","p":"Vilvah Goat Milk Shampoo is a goat milk shampoo that cleanses without stripping, and Vilvah Goat Milk Hair Mask uses goat milk and ceramides to soften dry hair. Deyga Soy Milk Conditioner restores softness to rough lengths. The Goat Milk Hair Kit puts the set together. See more in [Haircare](#c-haircare) or [deep hydration](#concern-hydration). Free UK delivery applies over £50."}]},"range-charcoal":{"h2":"Charcoal face wash, masks and soap","blocks":[{"p":"A charcoal face wash is a favourite for oily skin, and this range gathers six activated charcoal products from Deyga, Vilvah and Swansura Selection, priced from £9.99 to £25.99. Activated charcoal helps lift dirt, excess oil and surface impurities, leaving skin feeling fresh. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah and ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Face","p":"Deyga Charcoal Face Wash 100ml cleanses deeply and is gentle enough for daily use on all skin types, at £25.99. Once or twice a week, add a charcoal face mask: Deyga Charcoal Detox Face Mask 100G at £15.99, or Vilvah Charcoal Face Mask 100ml at £12.99. Either works as a face mask for oily skin when your T-zone feels congested. Our [Clear Skin Routine](#rituals) pairs the face wash with a tea tree toner and neem oil."},{"h3":"Body","p":"Deyga Charcoal Bath Bar 130 g blends activated charcoal with coconut oil, shea butter and olive oil, at £10.99, and suits face or body. The Swansura Selection Charcoal Goatmilk Soap Bar adds goat milk for softness, at £9.99. Either is a charcoal soap you can use every day. For the shower, Deyga Activated Charcoal Body Wash 220ML is a natural body wash with a deep-cleansing feel, at £15.99."},{"p":"Charcoal pairs well with neem and tea tree, so see our [neem and tea tree range](#range-neem) or the wider [oil-control edit](#concern-acne). Spend over £50 for free UK delivery."}]},"range-vitamin-c":{"h2":"Vitamin C serum and brightening care by Deyga","blocks":[{"p":"Deyga's 10% Vitamin C Face Serum 20ml is the vitamin c serum at the centre of this small range, at £16.99. It uses ascorbyl glucoside, a stable form of vitamin C, with orange extract and ectoin for a brighter, more even-looking complexion. It is a simple face serum for glowing skin to use each morning."},{"p":"Start with Deyga Vitamin C Foaming Face Wash 100ML, a vitamin c face wash with a micro-foam that removes dirt and oil without over-drying, at £15.99. If you would like both steps together, the Vitamin C Daily Glow Combo is £30.99. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga, and orders ship from the UK."},{"p":"Vitamin C pairs well with daily SPF, so finish with a sunscreen SPF 50 from our [sun care edit](#concern-sun). Apply your vitamin c serum to clean, dry skin and let it absorb before the next step. Our [Vitamin C Glow Routine](#rituals) puts wash, serum and sunscreen in order, and the [glow and even tone edit](#concern-glow) has more brightening picks."}]},"range-rose":{"h2":"Rose water toner, rose skincare and rose perfume","blocks":[{"p":"A rose water toner is a gentle first step in this range of 21 rose products, which covers skincare, bath and fragrance, with prices from £9.99. Deyga Pure Rose Water Toner, at £11.99, is alcohol-free, gives light hydration and suits all skin types, including sensitive skin. Every item is authentic and sent from the UK."},{"h3":"Rose skincare and bath","p":"Deyga Rose Glow Serum adds lightweight hydration, and Vilvah Wild Rose Face Mask pairs wild rose with French pink clay and aloe vera. Deyga Rose & Mulethi Skin Brightening Pack mixes rose and mulethi powders with oatmeal. In the bath, Deyga Rose Pink Clay Bath Bar and the Swansura Selection Classic Rose goat milk soap cleanse gently, and Deyga Rose & Geranium Body Butter is a rich body butter for dry skin. Vilvah Deo Shot Rose & Vanilla rounds off the routine."},{"h3":"Rose perfume","p":"Rose fragrances range from fresh to deep. Chloé Rose Naturelle Intense pairs rose with citrus and neroli, and Trussardi Delicate Rose adds kumquat and yuzu. Signature Rose from Signature D'orient comes with a 15ml travel spray, at £44.99. For darker roses, try Serge Lutens La Fille de Berlin, Boucheron Rose d'Isparta, Korloff Royal Rose, Montale Aoud Damascus or Tiziana Terenzi Gold Rose Oudh, which blends Bulgarian rose with oud."},{"p":"For more floral perfume, see every rose-led scent in our [floral fragrances](#scent-floral), or more gentle care in the [calm edit](#concern-calm). Orders over £50 get free UK delivery."}]},"range-neem":{"h2":"Neem and tea tree: a toner for oily skin, neem oil and combs","blocks":[{"p":"Deyga Tea Tree Facial Toner 100ML is a toner for oily skin and combination skin, and it leads this range of seven clarifying neem and tea tree products from Deyga and Vilvah, priced from £9.99 to £14.99. Swansura is an official UK partner of both brands, and orders ship from the UK."},{"h3":"Skin","p":"As a toner for oily skin, it helps balance shine and keeps skin fresh through the day, at £14.99. Deyga Neem Seed Oil 30ML is a pure, cold-pressed neem oil for skin and scalp, at £14.99. Deyga Neem & Turmeric Bath Bar 100G is an Ayurvedic bath bar that cleanses deeply, also £14.99."},{"h3":"Hair tools","p":"Vilvah's neem wood combs are handcrafted from Indian neem wood and biodegradable. Choose the Fine & Wide Tooth comb, the comb with handle or the Men's Neem Wood Comb at £9.99 each, or the Set of 3 at £13.99. A neem wood comb is a gentle tool for daily detangling."},{"p":"Pair this range with our [charcoal products](#range-charcoal), the [Clear Skin Routine](#rituals) or the [dandruff edit](#concern-dandruff). Spend over £50 for free UK delivery."}]},"range-rice-water":{"h2":"Rice water shampoo by Deyga","blocks":[{"p":"Deyga Rice Water Shampoo is a rice water shampoo made with rice water extract to improve hair texture and manageability, at £13.99. It gives a gentle, natural cleanse without harsh chemicals, adds shine and smoothness, and leaves hair soft to the touch. The lightweight formula suits daily use on all hair types, and Deyga describes it as cruelty-free."},{"p":"Rice water has long been part of hair care in Asia. If you want a natural shampoo UK delivery can bring to your door, this is a simple choice. Pair it with Deyga Soy Milk Conditioner, which is free from harsh sulphates and parabens, for softer lengths. Anyone looking for a shampoo for dry hair may also like Vilvah Goat Milk Shampoo. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and ships every order from the UK."},{"p":"See both steps, plus Vilvah Anti-Frizz Hair Serum, in our [Smooth & Shine routine](#rituals), or browse all [haircare](#c-haircare)."}]},"range-oud":{"h2":"Oud perfume for men, and unisex oud","blocks":[{"p":"Our oud range gathers 27 fragrances, from £19.99, and a good share of it is oud perfume for men, alongside many unisex bottles. Oud, or agarwood, gives a smoky, resinous depth that suits evenings and cooler months. Every bottle is authentic and sent from our UK base."},{"h3":"For men","p":"Hugo Boss The Collection Confident Oud Eau de Parfum Intense is made for men, at £70.99. Acqua di Parma Oud & Spice EDP 20ml for Men is a compact way to try the house, at £40.99. For a lighter budget, Fumeri Oud Saffron For Men, at £23.95, is an easy, affordable introduction to men's oud. Al Haramain Amber Oud Carbon Edition adds a fresh, aromatic and woody men's style, which makes this a strong place to shop oud perfume for men in the UK."},{"h3":"Unisex and women's oud","p":"Most of the Al Haramain Amber Oud editions are unisex, including Gold, Ruby, Black, Bleu and Tobacco, and our [Amber Oud Discovery routine](#rituals) compares three of them. Tom Ford Oud Wood comes in two sizes, and Gucci Intense Oud, Guerlain Oud Essentiel, Chopard Oud Malaki and Mancera Black Noir round out the designer and niche side. If you want an oud perfume for women, Montale Aoud Damascus blends deep rose with warm oud, and Amber Oud White Edition is lighter."},{"p":"For the full oud perfume family, including Tiziana Terenzi extraits, see [all oud fragrances](#scent-oud), or explore our [oud perfume guide](#k-oud-perfume). Orders over £50 ship free across the UK."}]},"price-0-15":{"h2":"Natural skincare under £15","blocks":[{"p":"Natural skincare under £15 is an easy way to try Indian care without a big spend. This edit gathers 56 products, mostly from Deyga and Vilvah, with prices from £6.99. They make easy add-ons, small gifts or a first step into Indian natural care. Swansura is an official UK partner of both brands, and every order is sent from the UK."},{"h3":"Face care","p":"Vilvah Fragrance-Free Cream Face Wash costs £9.99, and Vilvah Honey Face Wash and Deyga Oat Milk Face Wash are £12.99 each. Vilvah Milk Powder Face Wash is a milk face wash at £13.99. Deyga Pure Rose Water Toner is £11.99, while Vilvah Wild Rose and Charcoal face masks are £11.99 and £12.99. Small kits such as Deyga Hydro Boosting Skin Care Kit and Clear Skin Kit are £14.99."},{"h3":"Lips and body","p":"Lip care is where this price band shines. Vilvah Natural Lip Scrub, a lip scrub with lemon oil, and Natural Lemon Lip Balm are £6.99 each. Deyga Natural Lip Balm is a natural lip balm at £9.99, and Deyga Beetroot Lip Balm Classic is £10.99. For the bath, Swansura Selection goat milk soap bars are £9.99, and Deyga Charcoal Bath Bar is £10.99. Vilvah Deo Shots are a natural deodorant at £9.99, in Lavender & Sage or Rose & Vanilla."},{"p":"Building a basket of natural skincare under £15? Add a few of these to reach the £50 free UK delivery threshold, or step up to our [£15 to £25 edit](#price-15-25). You can also browse [stocking fillers](#k-stocking-fillers) and [lip care](#concern-lips)."}]},"price-15-25":{"h2":"Gifts under £25: perfume minis, skincare and body care","blocks":[{"p":"Our £15 to £25 edit is full of gifts under £25, with 108 products from designer perfume minis to natural body care. Many are everyday heroes you will reach for again and again. Every item is authentic and ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Fragrance at this price","p":"Designer miniatures let you try a famous scent without a full bottle. Gucci Bloom Parfum 10ml Miniature Spray and Gucci Guilty Pour Femme 10ml are £19.99, and Calvin Klein Eternity, Defy and My Euphoria 10ml minis are £18.99 each. Hermès Un Jardin 15ml miniatures, at £24.99, make a lovely travel size perfume. Full bottles include Davidoff Champion Eau de Toilette at £23.99, Armaf Hunter at £22.99, and La Maison de la Vanille Royal Oud and Ambre Secret at £19.99. Jean Paul Gaultier Classique Perfumed Shower Gel, at £22.99, is a Jean Paul perfume treat for the shower."},{"h3":"Skin and body care","p":"Deyga Chocolate Body Butter is a chocolate body butter at £15.99, and Deyga Body Scrub, a fruit-based body scrub, is £16.99. Deyga Charcoal Detox Face Mask and Activated Charcoal Body Wash are £15.99 each. Highborn London Crystal Cleanser at £24 and Superior Lip Butter (15ml) at £22.50 bring luxury English care into this band. Deyga Soft Lip Combo, at £17.99, is a small skincare gift set for lips."},{"p":"For more ideas, see our [gifts under £25](#k-gifts-under-25) page, or move up to the [£25 to £50 edit](#price-25-50). Free UK delivery applies on orders over £50."}]},"price-25-50":{"h2":"Gifts under £50: perfume, routines and treats","blocks":[{"p":"Our £25 to £50 edit is where you will find gifts under £50 that feel special, with 219 products from full-size perfumes to complete routines. Every item is authentic, and orders ship from the UK."},{"h3":"Perfume","p":"Calvin Klein Eternity Eau de Parfum is £28.99 and Eternity for Men Eau de Toilette 100ml is £38.99. DKNY Be Tempted 100ml is £39.99, and Chloé Rose Naturelle Intense and Nomade Jasmin Naturel Intense are £43.99 each. Burberry My Burberry Eau de Parfum 50ml is £48.99. Bentley's men's range, including Infinite, Momentum Unlimited and Become, sits between £30.99 and £40.99. A miniature perfume set, such as Calvin Klein Women's Miniature Fragrance Set at £33.99 or the Chloé and Burberry 4x5ml sets at £45.99, lets someone try several scents at once. See our [perfume gift sets](#k-perfume-gift-sets) for more."},{"h3":"Skincare and sleep","p":"Highborn London Imperial Moisturiser is £46, its Cleanse and Tone Pack is £44 and Diamond Toner is £25. anatomē's sleep range fits neatly here: each sleep oil is £28, the pillow sprays are £34, and The Little Gift of Good Sleep is £35. anatomē Balance and Focus Eau de Parfum start at £28. For a skincare gift set, Deyga Vitamin C Daily Glow Combo is £30.99."},{"p":"When you shop gifts under £50, one more item may take you past the free UK delivery threshold. Compare with our [£50 and over edit](#price-50-9999) or [gifts £25 to £50](#k-gifts-25-to-50)."}]},"price-50-9999":{"h2":"Luxury gifts over £50, with free UK delivery","blocks":[{"p":"Our luxury gifts over £50 bring together niche and designer perfume, luxury English skincare and generous gift sets, 162 products in all. Most single items here take your order past the £50 free UK delivery threshold, and every item is authentic and shipped from the UK."},{"h3":"Luxury skincare","p":"Highborn London leads the luxury skincare side. Pre-Eminent Beauty Serum is £66, Night Elixir £56 and Imperial Eye Gel £59. YOUTHBOOST Anti-Ageing Peptide Serum and Organic Age-Defying Facial Oil are £94 each, and Bakuchiol Youth Elixir is £99. For a complete set, Four Phase Day and Night is £145 and the Seven Phase Collection is £185. anatomē Illuminating Rose-hip, Grape Seed & Avocado Face Oil is £52, and its Bath & Shower Oils are £68."},{"h3":"Perfume and gift sets","p":"Full-size designer perfumes include Chloé Nomade Eau de Parfum 50ml at £51.99, Nomade Nuit d'Égypte at £55.99, and Burberry My Burberry Black Parfum 90ml at £58.99. Hemel Valley of Diamond, Fragrance Affair and Patchouli For All are £61.99 each. anatomē Eau de Parfum options at £125 include Focus, Energy and Expression. Perfume gift sets include Chloé Nomade with a 20ml travel spray at £66.99 and Highborn London Scrub and Glow Luminosity Set at £89. For more choice, see [niche perfume](#k-niche-perfume) and [luxury gifts over £50](#k-gifts-over-50)."},{"p":"If you would like to spend a little less, our [£25 to £50 edit](#price-25-50) has plenty of options, or browse [all gifts and sets](#c-gifts)."}]},"rituals":{"h2":"Skincare routine sets for skin, hair, body and scent","blocks":[{"p":"A good skincare routine does not need ten steps. Our routines put two or three products in the right order, so you can shop a complete regime in one go. There are 16 in total, for skin, hair, body and fragrance, built mostly from Deyga and Vilvah, the Indian brands Swansura is an official UK partner of, plus Highborn London, anatomē and Al Haramain. Everything ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Skin","p":"The Clear Skin Routine pairs Deyga Charcoal Face Wash, Tea Tree Facial Toner and Neem Seed Oil for oily skin. The Vitamin C Glow Routine runs from foaming wash to 10% Vitamin C serum to Deyga Sunscreen. For skincare for dry skin, the Deep Hydration Routine combines Vilvah Honey Face Wash, Deyga 2% Hyaluronic Acid Serum and Deep Moisturising Face Cream. The Milk Glow Routine uses Vilvah's milk range, the Sensitive Skin Routine starts with a fragrance-free cleanser and pure aloe, and the Age-Defying Routine brings together Highborn London Crystal Cleanser, YOUTHBOOST serum and Imperial Moisturiser."},{"h3":"Hair and body","p":"The Hair Fall Rescue oils the roots, washes gently and conditions the lengths with Vilvah. The Smooth & Shine Routine pairs Deyga Rice Water Shampoo and Soy Milk Conditioner with Vilvah Anti-Frizz Hair Serum, and makes a thoughtful hair care gift set. The Calm Scalp Duo is an oil and shampoo for flakes. For the body, the Body Polish Ritual adds a body scrub between wash and butter, and the Foot Spa at Home ends with Vilvah Foot Care Cream, a rich foot cream with shea and mango butter. The Lip Wardrobe starts with a lip scrub and finishes with SPF, and the Sleep Ritual uses anatomē bath salts, sleep oil and pillow spray."},{"h3":"Scent","p":"Fragrance lasts longer on moisturised skin, and every skincare routine can end with scent, so the Amber Oud Evening pairs Deyga Chocolate Body Butter with Al Haramain Amber Oud Ruby Edition. The Amber Oud Discovery lets you compare Bleu, White and Gold editions, and the Gentleman's Set brings a charcoal body wash, a neem wood comb and Fumeri Blue For Men together. Browse [gifts and sets](#c-gifts), [oud fragrances](#scent-oud) or shop by concern from [deep hydration](#concern-hydration). Orders over £50 get free UK delivery."}]},"brands":{"h2":"Beauty and perfume brands A to Z","blocks":[{"p":"Our perfume brands and skincare labels run from Abercrombie & Fitch to Yves Saint Laurent. Our 66 brands range from Indian natural care to European fashion houses, Arabian perfumers and niche labels, and every product is authentic and shipped from the UK."},{"h3":"Natural skincare brands","p":"Our care side is led by [Deyga](#b-deyga) and [Vilvah](#b-vilvah), two Indian natural skincare brands with more than 70 products each. Swansura is an official UK partner of both. Highborn London brings 22 luxury English skincare and body products, anatomē adds sleep oils, bath oils and mindful fragrance, and our own Swansura Selection gathers goat milk soaps and small treats. Shiseido completes the list."},{"h3":"Designer perfume houses","p":"Fashion and beauty houses include Calvin Klein, Chloé, Burberry, DKNY, Gucci, Dior, Guerlain, Bvlgari, Hermès, Givenchy, Lancôme, Tom Ford and Yves Saint Laurent. The [Dolce & Gabbana](#b-dolce-gabbana) perfume range covers The One, Devotion and K with gift sets, and the Jean Paul perfume line from [Jean Paul Gaultier](#b-jean-paul-gaultier) includes Scandal Gold. Elie Saab, Carolina Herrera, Marc Jacobs and Dunhill each bring a strong line-up too."},{"h3":"Arabian and niche","p":"For Arabian perfume, Al Haramain, Hemel, Signature D'orient, Fumeri, SAP and Korloff offer oud, amber and spice. Niche perfume lovers will find Tiziana Terenzi with 22 fragrances, Jo Milano, Mancera, Montale, Serge Lutens and The Woods Collection. Every page in our list of perfume brands shows the full range with prices, and free UK delivery applies on orders over £50."}]},"home":{"h2":"Natural skincare in the UK from Deyga and Vilvah, plus fine fragrance","blocks":[{"p":"Swansura is the UK home of natural skincare from Indian brands Deyga and Vilvah, and for niche, Arabian and designer fragrance. We bring both brands to your door, alongside 357 perfumes from around the world. Swansura is an official UK partner of Deyga and Vilvah, every product is 100% authentic, and every order ships from the UK."},{"h3":"Indian natural care, made simple","p":"Deyga and Vilvah build their products on plant oils, milks, clays and traditional herbs such as neem, amla, bhringraj and turmeric. Try Vilvah Goat Milk Shampoo, Deyga Rice Water Shampoo or the Hair Growth Oils if you want a natural shampoo UK delivery can bring quickly, or start your face with a gentle wash, a serum and a moisturiser. Lip balms, bath bars, body butters and face packs complete the range. This is natural skincare made for everyday use, and many products draw on Ayurvedic tradition, so it is a good place to begin if you want Ayurvedic skincare in the UK without the wait. Browse [Skincare](#c-skincare) or shop by concern, such as [deep hydration](#concern-hydration)."},{"h3":"Fragrance from three worlds","p":"Our fragrance shelf mixes designer houses such as Gucci, Chloé, Dolce & Gabbana and Calvin Klein with Arabian perfumers such as Al Haramain, Hemel and Signature D'orient, and niche names such as Tiziana Terenzi and Jo Milano. If you are looking for oud perfume, our [oud fragrances](#scent-oud) bring the smoky, resinous side together. Miniatures and discovery sets help you try before you commit."},{"h3":"Routines, gifts and delivery","p":"Not sure where to start? Our [routines and sets](#rituals) pair two or three products in the right order, and kits from Deyga, Vilvah and Highborn London make an easy skincare gift set. Every order over £50 travels free across the UK, which makes us an easy choice for natural skincare in the UK. Shop by concern, by scent family or by price, and find the products that suit you."}]}};
